<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Nyingnam</para>
  <para style="toc1">Apostol vdwgv NYINGNAM</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nyingnam</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nyim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Apostol vdwgv</para>
  <para style="mt1">NYINGNAM</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Apostol vdwgv Nyingnam </char> vnam kitap si <char style="bk">Luk gv alvnv Gamlv lvktong ngv</char>. Si kainv risvvngsv nga mimpado oguaingbv kvvlo gv Jisunyi riming gvnv vdwa, Darwknv Dow gv, rigvnam lokv alvnv Gamlv nga japgo karmunamv “Jerusalem hoka, Judia okv Samaria mvnwng ho, okv sichingmooku gv ataranya lo” (1.8). Soogv higu si Kristan rirap kunam lvkwnglo oogv Jius nyi vdwgv pingkolo richo kunamv okv mvngjwng ngv sichingmooku so aanya kunamv. Lvknv vka mvngjwng toku lvkpvku ninyigv lvknam am kaanv vdwv mvngjwng duku Kristan rinam si Roman mooku lokv gwngmi sunama, okv oogv Kristan mvngjwng namsi Jius mooku lo lingkunam.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Nyingnam</char> kitap si lvkdung jvngv lvkrw lvkpa pvkunam, baak aom gobv rilakunam, vv Jisu gv alvnv Gamlv nga mingkar kunam okv gvrja aka mvkunam lvkwnglo lvktoku: (1) atuake ho Jerusalem mooku lo kristan vdwv rirab kunam ho Jisu gv ao mooku bv Chaakunamv; (2) Palestin mooku lo aku akusibv minkar kunamv; okv (3) ho hoka kaiyasin bv Mediterranian gwngda gv adarai Rom mooku ho.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Nyingnam</char> kitap lo dinchinam angv Darwknv Dow gv rikunam vdwv, hv Pintikost alulo mvngjwngnv vdwlo jwkrw jilwkla rigvdogvnv vdwa gwlwk am jila gvrja nga alvbv rigvdogv mokunam vdwa mimpadu. Kvvlo gv richodochonv kristan vdwgv doin vdwa lvkrwlvkpa jila vvpv jidu, okv <char style="bk">Nyingnam </char> kitap so lvkpvnam dvdvlo kaapado ho jwkrw gv doina mvngjwngnv vdwgv rinamdoonam lo okv gvrja vdwgv akin minsukunam lokv.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Tvvyakaria nvgv ripv kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Jisu gv minyungminya bv gamki kunam okv milvnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Judas gv ritungnga ripwngrinya jikunv<char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem lo tvvriakarianv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Judia okv Samaria lo tvvriakarianv vdwv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paul gv kudungkua rinam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Atuake lo Missionari vngkarnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Jerusalem lo vngkumnam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Lvnyinvbv missionari vngtin kunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Lvum nvbv missionari vngkunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:16">18:23—21:16</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Jerusalem, Kaisaria okv Rom lo Paul patwk dookunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Lk 1:1-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Pakmisinam Tiopilas:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Ngoogv lvktulwkke lwknam kitap lo ngo Jisu gv ogumvnwng rinam okv minam ninyigv atukalu ho rinama lvkpvnv <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>ninyi nyidomooku chaatv madvbv alulo. Ninyigv chaama dvbv, Hv kaatamritamla Darwknv Dow jwkrw lokv ninyigv Apostol gobv darlin kunam nyi vdwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Vkvgv siro kunam kochingso alu champi go ogolo lamtv lo hv nyi vdwa kaarwksuku nama ho hv turpvkunv vv nyi vdwa kaatam kunam. Bunu ninyia kaatoku, okv hv bunua lvkobv Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv lvgabv japbam toku. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Lk 24:49</ref> </char></note> Okv vdwlo bunu lvkobv aato kudw,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vdwlo bunu lvkobv aato kudw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vdwlo hv bunua lvkobv doodung bvdw, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vdwlo bunua lvkobv hv dvdung bvdw. </char></note> hv bunua so orto sum jitoku: “Jerusalem am vngyu mabv kv, vbvritola jwkrw lvgabv doyato ngoogv nonuam minpv nama, ngo Abu gv jwkrw milv nama. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mt 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mk 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Lk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Jn 1:33</ref> </char></note> Jon isi lokv baptisma jito, vbvritola so lonyiloum so nonua Darwknv Dow lokv baptisma jire.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Nyidomooku chaakunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Vdwlo Apostol vdwv Jisunyi kaarwk sikubvdw, bunu vdwv ninyia tvvkato, “Ahtu, no so vjakdadw suka Israel am Karv nga jikur dooku bvre?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Ridwvngdw ngv ngoogv Abu gv atubogv tujupkunamv, okv so si nonu lvgabv chinsvma vdwlo vv bunu ririkudw. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mt 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mk 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Lk 24:47</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:48">48</ref> </char></note>Vbvritola vdwlo Darwknv Dowv nonu gvlo aaku bolo, no jwkrw doriku, okv no ngo gvbvku minjiyanv gobv ririku Jerusalem lo Judia mvnwnglo okv Samaria okv sichingmooku gv dotvr mvnwnglo mingo jinv gobv ririku.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Lk 24:50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref> </char></note> Miro koching so ninyi nyidomooku naacha kunama ho vdwv kaaria toku, okv ho vdwgv kaanyung aku ninyia hapumv kaklum toku.<verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Bunu vdwv vjaklodvbv nyido tlo bv ninyigv chaanama roodungla kaaria kunamv, ogolokv nyi anyigo vji jipung kootola dvminmabv bunu vdwgvlo aala dakbamto <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>okv minto, “Galili nyi vdwv, ogulvgabv nonuno daktola nyidotolo kaadung dunv? Si Jisu si, nonugv lokv nyidomooku bv naacha kunama, nonu ninyia nyidomooku bv chaadubv kaaming gvnam aingbv nw vbvching lvkodv aakur reku.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas gv ritungnga ripwngrinya jikunv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Okv Apostol vdwv Olib gv Moodw lokv Jerusalem lo vngkur toku, hv pamtv lokv lvtw gobv aduto. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mt 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mk 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Lk 6:14-16</ref> </char></note> Bunu banggu lo aachi toku okv ho vdwgv karchung dookulo chaachi toku: Pitar, Jon, Jems okv Andriu, Pilip okv Tomas, Bartolomiu okv Metiu, Alpius gv kuunyilo Jems, Saimon ringria kunv okv Jems gv kuunyilo Judas. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Bunu dookum nyato kumbwng nyala, anvnyimv vdwv okv Jisu gv anv Meri okv ninyigv boru vdwv lvkobv.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Alu lonyiloum koching ho mvngjwngnv vdwv doopamgo pamto, hokaku lwnggola chamnyi gubv, okv Pitarnyi japdubv daktoku. <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>“Ngoogv ajin vdwv,” hv minto, “Darwknv Dow lokv minamv darwknv kitapv jvjvbv aaduku, Dabid gv lokv, oogv Jisunyi booku nama chigudabianv Judas gv lvkwng lo mincho moodubv mvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Judas ka ngonugv apam lo ribamv, hv ngonugv kudungkua aba lo ribam kunam akobv darlin kunamv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:17">(<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18,19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mt 27:3-8</ref> </char></note> Judas gv alvmanv rijo morko paanama rongo rvvnv toku, ho rongo hoka ninyi atubongv hoksar sitoku; ninyi godit goitla okv ninyigv tangiv pokdik lintoku. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Jerusalem lo nyi doonv vdwv so sum tvvpa kunam, okv ho vdwgv atubogv gaam bv ho rongo nga Akeldama vla vdwv minkunam, Akeldama, minam si “Gwngrw Talwng Rongo.”)<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:25">Miri 69:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Miri 109:8</ref> </char>
    </note> “Holvgabv soogv Miri kitap si vbv lvkpv pvku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Oogv naam lo nyi akoka dookuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">Holvgabv vkvgv naamv arochoko duku.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">So si ka lvkpv duku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Vbvmabvdv akonvka vkvgv risvdosv nga naariku.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21-22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mt 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mk 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Lk 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Lk 24:51</ref> </char>
    </note>“Holvgabv, Ahtu Jisu gv turkur kunama, ho kaariatarianv akobv ngonu gvlo ribam rungdu kubv, hv nyi angv kvvlo lokv Ahtu Jisu ngonugv lvkobv vnggo karla Jon ninyigv baptisma gv doina japgo kari lokv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21-22 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jon ninyigv baptisma gv doina japgo kari lokv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jon ninyia batisma jito. </char></note> Jisunyi nyidomooku lo ngonugv pingko lokv laachama dvdv lobv riming gvnv gobv rirungpv lage.”<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Vbvrikunamv, bunu vdwv nyi anyi gonyi mimpv toku: Josep, um Barsabbas vtoku (Justus bvka mintoku) okv Matias. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu kumtoku, “Ahtu, no mvnwng gv mvngnama chindu, noogv gaklin pvvnam nyidum anyi sum ngonua kaatam bvka <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Apostol aingbv ridubv Judas gv vngro kunam lokv, nyi ogolokvdw ho vngkunam.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu nyi anyia amin chingkw sito okv ako chincha namv Matiasnyi Apostol akobv chilin toku vringgola akinlo aapwng toku.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Darwknv Dowv aakunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Leb 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Det 16:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Vdwlo Pintikost aluv aakunamv, mvngjwngnv vdwv lvkobv dooku akin lo dookum toku. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Dvminmabv nyido gvngv doogumdoori ngv gumnam jvbv kai alvbv svdu duto, okv bunu vdwgv dooku naam lo dulwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu ogu vmv mvriak taakar nam aingbv kaapatoku okv hoka akinakin lo mvsit karto. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Darwknv Dowv lvkobv ho mvnwng nga aaku namv Dowv kvvbi gaam aingbv japdu kubv bunua mvtoku.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Jerusalem lo Jius vdwv dookunamv, nyiamooku mvnwng lokv diringmooku mvnwng dormo nyi vdwv aakum toku. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Vdwlo bunu so svdua tvvpapvdw, nyi nyitwnggo aakum toku. Bunu mvnwng ngv yaa mvngtoku, ogulvgavbolo akinakin bv mvnwng ngv mvngjwngnv vdwa bunu atugv gaambv japdubv tvvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Mvngrimvngma okv kaasartabo mvngdukla bunu gokto, “So nyi japnv vdwv si Galili nyi jvbv! <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Si oguaingbv, vbvrikunamv, ngonu mvnwng ngv ho bunua ngonugv atugv gaam nga japdubv tvvdunv? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Ngonu Partia lokv, Media, okv Elam; Mesopotamia lokv, Judia, okv kapadosia; Pontus okv Asia lokv gvngv, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Prigia lokv, okv Pampilia lokv, Ijipt okv Sairen nvchi Libya mooku lokv. Ngonu kvvgonv Rom lokv gvngv, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Jius okv Jentail judaism lo aakunv nyitwng anyiv, okv ngonu kvvgonv Kret okv Arabia lokv gvngv vjvka ngonu mvnwng ngv bunua ngoogv gaambv japdubv tvvdu Pwknvyarnv gv ogu kairungnv go rinam lvgabv!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Lamnam okv mvngbwk mabv, bunu akonv akonyi tvvka minsuto, “Si ogu gubvri?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Vbvritola kvvgonv mvngjwngnv vdwa giokw nyala, minto, “So nyi vdwv tvngkium nyapv!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar gv Doin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar vringgola akin Apostol am lvkobv daktoku okv gamtv alvbv milinto bunua: “Okv yvvdw Jerusalem lo doonv vdwv nonu mvnwng ngv Jius aingbv ritoku, nga tvvriato okv klai ngo nonua mintodv si oguvdw. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>So nyi vdwv tvngmanv, oguaingbv no mvngdudw; si arugv kia baje mvngchikdu. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Vmabvya, so si nyijwk Joel gv ogugo mingkunamv vvkv:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Jol 2:28-32</ref> </char>
    </note> ‘Pwknvyarnv minto, ogu gunyi ngo rirungre so sung ataranya alu lo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Ngoogv Dowa ngo mvnwng gv aolo pwlwk jire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Ngoogv doina, noogv kuunyilo okv nyimv vdwv minkar riku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">noogv nyipayapa vdwv nyikrw kaare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">okv noogv nyikam vdwv yuma maare.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Vvka tikmabv, ngoogv nyira anyi, pakbu okv paknv loka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Ngo aamure ngoogv Dow ho alunyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">okv bunu minjire ngoogv doina.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Ngo nyido aolo lamrwpadubv kaatamre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">okv sichingmooku lvkwnglo kaasartabo more.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Hoka ka oyi, vmv, okv mvkwv doore;<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Donyiv nyikumare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">okv Pooluv oyi jvbv yalwngre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Ahtu gv aamadvbv kairungnv okv yunglitnam alu lo.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Okv vbvrikunamv, yvvdw Ahtunyi ringkudubv gokdunv um ringreku.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>“Tvvgapto soogv gamchar am, Israel ribam vdwv! Jisu Najaret gv nyi go vv darwknv tulwkkunama kaatamto nonua lamrwpadubv okv kaasartabo bv Pwknvyarnv ninyigv lokv kaatamto. Nonu atubongv chinsudo sum, si nonugv pingkolo ritoku. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mt 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mk 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Lk 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Jn 19:18</ref> </char></note> Ninyigv atubongv mvngdung lokv Pwknvyarnv mvngpv kunam ho Jisunyi bunu gvlo laklwk jitoku; okv nonuno rimurnv nyi vdwa ninyia daapo lo takki motoku. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mt 28:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mk 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Lk 24:5</ref> </char></note> Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv ninyia sinam lokv turkur motoku, ninyia jwkrw jitoku, ogulvgabv ninyia hv rila mato sinamv patwk doonv nyi jvbv naatung nyomare. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Miri 16:8-11</ref> </char></note> Dabid ninyigv lvkwnglo minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Hoogv dw mvnwng lo ngo Ahtunyi kaato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">hv ngoogv nvchilo dooto okv ngo adwkakunam kaamare.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Okv vkvlvgabv ngo gvlo himpuv puulvk duku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">okv ngoogv gamcharv achialvbv alv duku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Okv ngo, sidajvka ngo ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">mvngjwng ngv doming gvvriku,<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>vkvlvgabv no nga achialvbv siku sichingmooku lo tulatua mare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">noogv mvngjwngnv nyira nga nyibunglo yaalwk momare.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>No nga kaatamto singjiku lamtv nga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">okv noogv doonam lokv nga lvkobv himpu moto.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>“Ngoogv ajin vdwa, Ngo nonua minda kalabv mindunv ngoogv yungnam abuapa Dvbv Dabid gv lvkwngbv. Hv sitoku okv svma nga ritoku, okv ninyigv nyibung ngv silu gudvbv ngonua lvkobv dooming gvdo. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Miri 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref> </char></note> Hv nyijwk gubv ritoku, okv Pwknvyarnv ogugo ninyia milv pvdw um hv chindu: Pwknvyarnv milv toku Dvbv Dabid aingnvgo, ninyigv husi lokv akonyi Dvbv bv mvre. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Dabid kaapato Pwknvyarnv ogugo vngtvritv dunvdw aarinvlo, okv hv minto Kristo gv turkur kunam lvkwng lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Hv siku sichingmooku soka tulatua kumare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">ninyigv ayak vv nyibung boloka yaaku mare.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Pwknvyarnv Jisunyi sikunam lokv tukur motoku, okv sung ngonu mvnwng ngv jvjv nga kaarianvngv. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Hv ka turkur kunv ngv Pwknvyarnv gv lakbik peelvbv doonv, ninyigv Abu lokv okv Darwknv Dowa ninyi naarwk sitoku, ninyigv milvnam lokv. No ogu gunyi vjv kaadunv okv tvvdunv si ninyigv jinamgo ho hv ngonua Darwknv Dowa jilwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Miri 110:1</ref></char></note> Hv Dabid mato yvvdw nyidomooku tolobv chaakunv; vbvritola Dabid atuv mintoku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Ahtu ngoogv Ahtunyi minto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Soka dooto ngoogv lakbik kiambv<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>ngo noogv nyimak am lvchu arwnglo vvpvma dvdvlo.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>“Israel gv nyi mvnwng ngv, vbvritola hoka nonu chirungto si Jisu, yvvnyi nonu daapolo takipvdw, ho angv Pwknvyarnv gv mvkunam Ahtu okv Messiah!”<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Vdwlo nyi vdwv sum tvvpa pukudw, bunu mvnwng ngv achialvbv adwkakuto okv Pitarnyi minto okv kvvbi Apostol vdwaka, “Achiboru vdwv ngonu ogubv rire?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Pitar bunua minto, “Nonuno akinakinv rimur lokv lirung tokuka okv Jisu Kristo gv amin bv baptisma laato kuka, vbvribolo nonugv rimur am mvngnga jiriku; okv nonuno Pwknvyarnv gv jinam nga naarwk siriku, Darwknv Dowa. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Pwknvyarnv gv milvpvvnamv nonua okv nonugv umvuu vdwa, okv mvnwng nga yvvbunu adu lokv—mvnwng nga ngonugv Ahtu Pwknvyarnv ninyi atubogv lvgabv goklwkto.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Pitar bunua dinchinam gaam minto okv hv mindwkkrwkla minto, “Alvmanv nyi vdwgvlo mvritririt aarinvpv nonuno ringsu laka!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Bunu vdwv awgonv mvngjwngto ninyigv doina okv baptisma naakunam, okv ho alulo hejar aom dvsv gobv nyitwnggo apam hoka aapwng toku. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Bunugv dwa jila Apostol vdwgvlo risar sunya toku, kumkulo kumbam nyato, dvnam am jimi suto okv kummi suto.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwngnv vdwgv lokv singdung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Aigo lamrwpanam okv kaasartabo namgo ritoku Apostol lokv okv nyi mvnwng ngv kaalam paktola mvngto. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Nyim 4:32-35</ref> </char></note> Mvngjwngnv mvnwng ngv lvkin gubv nvchibv kumkulo kumbv ribv nyatoku okv bunugv yikungyira am ajinanying nga jimi sunya toku. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Bunu vdwv atugv yikungyira okv ayi nga pyoktokula okv morko nga mvnwng ngv pingkolo akinakin gv ogugo dinchinam nga orpinorin sito. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Alu logo yayaku bunu lvkobv Pwknvyarnv gv Naam arwnglo apam gubv kaarwksuto, okv bunugv dvnamtvngnam nga bunugv naamlo lvkobv, hapokv mvngpula okv nyaknyak bv dvbamto, <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Pwknvyarnv hartv la, okv nyi mvnwng gv alvbv mvngnam saknama himpala himpu nyatoku. Okv alu lokia Ahtu ringlin kunam vdwa bunugv apumlo aapwng momu toku.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lvpiknv nyi anga mvpunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Alu logolo Pitar okv Jon kumdw lo, ariumgv gunta aom lo kumbv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Hoka Kaapunv Agi minamgo dooto, nyi ako ninyigv singcha ilo gvngv lvpik bogobv rinvgo dooto. Aludwkibv ninyia agi lo baklwk kito nyi vdwlokv morko koonam lvgabv yvvbunu Pwknvyarnv gv Pwknvyarnvnaam bv vngdudw. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Vdwlo hv Pitar okv Jon bunyia arwngbv aadubv kaapa tokudw, hv ogu achukgo ninyia jikubv bunua kootoku. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Bunu ninyia kaadichinchin la kaato, okv Pitar mintoku, “Ngonua kaato!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Vkvlvgabv hv bunua kaato, mvngto bunu gvlo ogu achukgo paiji vla. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Vbvritola Pitar ninyia mintoku, “Vjak ngo gvlo morko achukguka kaama, vbvritola ngo nam jire ngo gvlo ogugo doopvdw: Najaret Jisu Kristo gv amin bv ngo nam mindunv gudungto okv vngkar tokuka!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Vbvrikunamv hv gakbwngto ninyigv laakbik laak lokv okv ninyia svvraptoku. Vjakpigobv nyi angv gv lvpa okv gorbwng ngv gwlwktoku; <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>hv pokdinpokrin toku, ninyigv lvpa ngv dakdin jitoku, okv vngraptoku angchar vngyarla. Vbvrikunamv hv bunugv lvkobv Pwknvyarnv gv Naam arwngbv aaming gvvto, vngyingla okv pokyingla okv Pwknvyarnv hartvbamtvla. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Hoka nyi vdwv ninyia vngkar dubv kaatoku okv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvbamtv dubv, <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>okv vdwlo bunu ninyia kaapunv agilo dootola koriak karnv gubv kachin tukudw, bunu mvnwng ngv lamdokpanyato okv mvngnyato ogugo ninyia ripv kunvdw.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnvnaam arwnglo Pitar gv Doin minam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Pitar okv Jon Solomon gv giabv, vla um vbvching mintoku hoka vngrilo nyi angv bunyia gakbwng toku, nyi vdwv lamngakpanyato okv bunu gvlo joklwk nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Vdwlo Pitar nyi vdwa kaapa tokula, hv bunua minto, “Israel gv nyi vdwv, Ho so nonuno ogubv lamdokpadunv, okv nonuno ogubv ngonua kaagap chinchila kaadunv? Nonu vbv mvngdunvre soogv nyi angv sum vngdu kubv mvnam si ngonu atugv gwlwk vmalo jwkrw lokv mvpv nvgo mvngdu ai? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Mog 3:15</ref> </char></note>Abraham gv, Isaak gv, okv Jakop gv Pwknvyarnv, ngonugv abuapa vdwgv Pwknvyarnv, ninyigv Pakbu Jisunyi ninyigv kainv jwkrwa jito. Vbvritola nonuno ninyia rigvdoogvnv vdwgvlo laklwkto, okv nonuno Pilot gv dookulo ninyia toa jitoku, Pilat gv ninyia topu dokubv vla minro koching bvka. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mt 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mk 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Lk 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Jn 19:12-15</ref> </char></note> Hv darwkto okv alvnvbv ritoku, vbvritola nonuno ninyia toa toku, okv bununo nyi mvki yanv anga alvyabv mvngla tulin kunam lvgabv pilatnyi nonuno koonyato. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Nonuno singkurikulo vnggv jinv anga mvkito, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv ninyia sikunvnga turkur motoku—okv so sung ngonuv kaarianv vdwv. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Jisu ninyigv amin bv jwkrwa so lvpiknv nyi anga turnv nvnga jitoku. Nonuno ogu gunyi kaadudw okv chindu kudw mvngjwng lokv ninyigv amin bv ripvkonv; Jisunyi mvngjwng kunam lvgalo ninyia alvmopv kunv, vbv nonu mvnwng nga kaadubv.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>“Okv vjv, ngoogv ajin vdwv, ngo chindu ho nonuno ogugunyi okv nonugv nyi rigvnv vdwv Jisunyi chinchirichi mabv rinyato. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Klu gvngv Pwknvyarnv nyijwk mvnwng gvlo mimu toku ho ninyigv Kristo ngv hinching chingre; okv hv um svbv jvjv dukubv mvjitoku. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Vbvrikunamv, mvngdwn tokuka, okv Pwknvyarnv gvlo aanyato, nonuno vbv rikubolo, hv nonugv rimur am mvngnga jiriku. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Ahtu gvlokv Dow atortornv nvnv dw ngv aariku, okv hv Jisunyi vngmu riku, yvvdw Messiah vla hv nonuno gv lvgabv gakpv kunamv. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Hv nyidomooku lo doyare ho dw vv aama dvdvlo ogumvnwng ngv anw malo, Pwknvyarnv vbv mimpa jito ninyigv darwknv nyijwk yvvbunudw krimklu gv rinv lokv. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref> </char></note> Moses minto, Nonugv Pwknvyarnv Ahtu nonua jilwkre nyijwk akobv, sijv nga hv jilwknam aingbv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sijv nga hv jilwknam aingbv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngam jvjv. </char></note> okv nonugv atugv nyi lokv akonv singri nvpv. Nonuno ogumvnwng nga tvvtoka ho nonuno ninyigv minama ritoka. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Det 18:19</ref> </char></note> Akonv yvv ho nyijwk am tvvmabolo Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwgvlo mvpin suriku okv mvyakmvchak riku.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Okv nyijwk mvnwng ngv yvv doin minpvdw Samuelnyi mindvla okv yvvbunu ninyigv kochingbv aakunv, japta jitoku Silumelu ogugo ridu kudw. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Atk 22:18</ref> </char></note> Nonu gvbv nyijwk vdwgv lokv Pwknvyarnv milv jito, okv ogugonyi Pwknvyarnv nonugv abuapa vdwa lvkobv mvrwjinama nonuno mvpinmiyin minsuto. Hv Abrahamnyi vbv minto, ‘Nonugv husi lokv ngo schingmooku gv nyi mvnwng nga ayare.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Okv vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv ninyigv Pakbu nga gaklin riku okv ninyia nonu lo jilwk chore, nonua ayare nonugv akinakin gv alvmanv lamtv loka lingkur moriku.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Pitar okv Jon kvbadopam kaagialo dooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Pitar okv Jon nyi vdwa mindung rilo, nyibu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nyibu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv kitap nyibu butv vdwv. </char></note> kvvgonv, Pwknvyarnvnaam dakriakarianv okv Sadusi kvvgonv vngchi toku. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Bunu ridwkriku nyato vkvlvgavbolo Apostol anyiv nyi vdwa tamsarla ho Jisu gv sipikula turkur kunama, vdwlo chintoku ho sitokula turkur kunv nga. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu bunua naatungto okv bunua patwk arwnglo tumpvto alu lonyinvnv aama dvdvbv, si ogubvrijvka tapv rotoku. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Vbvritokula meegonv yvv doina tvvpvdw vv mvngjwngto; okv nyi vdwv aapwng yayala hejar angu dvsv gubv ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Alu logonvgv kochingbv Jius gv rigvbu vdw, nyigagatv vdw, okv pvbv tamsarnv vdwv Jerusalem aakumto. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Bunu lvkobv kaarwk minsuto nyibu butvyachok Annas okv Kaiapas, Jon, Alekjandar, okv yvvdw nyibu butv gv dvpar parkin bv rinv kvvbi vdwaka. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Bunu milinto Apostol vdwa bunugv atuklo dakmu tvla okv bunua tvuto, “No oguaingbv ripvnv so? No ogolokv jwkrw papvnv vmalo yvvgv amin bv nonu rinv dunv?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Pitar, Darwknv Dow ngv akomaring bv dootola, bunua mirwksuto, “Nyi vdwa tujupkunam vdwa la okv nyigagatv vdwa: <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>ngonu silu alvrungnv rinam nyi lvpikbo anga okv oguaingbv hv mvpunam vdw tvvkabolo, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>vbvrikunamv nonu mvnwng ngv chinto kulaka, okv Israel gv nyi mvnwng vka chinto kulaka, ho nonugv kaagialo so suka daknv nyi angv ogumvnwng ngv alv duku Najaret Jisu kristo gv amin gv jwkrw nonugv daapo lo takkinam okv sikunv anga Pwknvyarnv gv turkur mokunam. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Miri 118:22</ref> </char></note> Jisu Darwknv kitaplo minpvnam angv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Nonu naam mvnv vdwgv toakunam vlwng angv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">mvnwng nga dinchi yachok nvgobv ritoku.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Ringlinbaalin nama ninyi akin lokv pamwngre; nyiamooku soka Pwknvyarnv yvvnyika jinam kaama ngonua ringnyu dubv.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Dopam gv nyi vdwv Pitar okv Jon bunyia kaanyato okv chintoku bunyiv ogumanv ngv puriputa kaama nvgo oguaingbv busu mabv mindu nvgoda vla lamnyato. Vbvrikunamv bunu mvngdw toku ho bunyiv Jisu gv rikulo rinvgo. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Vbvritola bunu hoka oguka minyu kumato, ogulvgavbolo nyi mvpunam angv Pitar okv Jon bunyi lvkobv dakdubv bunu kaato. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu bunua kvbadopam karchung lokv vngro dukubv mintoku, okv vbvrikunamv bunu bunugv pinkolo japrap minsuto. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>“Ngonu so nyi vdwa lvkobv ogu ridubv?” bunu tvvkato. “Jerusalem gv nyi nyicharv ho chinyato so bunu gvlo akusubv rinyu manam lamrwpanam go kaatamto, okv ngonu hum miya jinyuma. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Vbvritola so gaam sum pvpvlaju nyi vdwgv pinkolo tvvsik suma dubv, klvi ngonu so nyi vdwa gamrw laju yvvnyika lvkodv Jisu gv amina minkar kuma dubv mintor laju.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu arwnglo bunua gokkur lvkto okv bunua mintoku ogugoka tvvkayo nonuno Jisu gv amin bv japkuyo vmalo tamsarka koomabvkv. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Vbvritola Pitar okv Jon bunua mirwksuto, “Nonu atuv jwngkadaka suto ogolo angv Pwknvyarnv gvlo tarwkbak yadunvdw—nonua tvvria svgobvri vmalo Pwknvyarnvnyi tvvria svgobvri. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Ngonu atubongv ogugo kaapvdw okv tvvpvdw um ngonu mintong nga topunyuma.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Vkvlvgabv dopamv bunua kaiyayabv gamrw rwkto okv vbvrikunamv bunua topu nyatoku. Bunu kaatoku hoka bunua mvrit nyomare vla, ogulvgavbolo ogugo ripvkudi um nyi mvnwng ngv Pwknvyarnv hartv tvvdung nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Yvvnyi lamrwpadubv kaatamla mvpunam nyi angv anying champi lvgubv ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwngnv vdwgv mvngkamnam lvgabv kumnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Pitar okv Jon bunyia topusopitda, bunugv ribam achamlo bunu vngkurtuku okv bunua mimpa toku ogugo nyibu butv vdwgv okv nyigagatv vdwgv minku nvnga. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Mog 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Miri 146:6</ref> </char></note> Vdwlo mvngjwngnv vdwv um tvvpa namgola, bunu mvnwng ngv lvkin gobv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumto: “Ahtuv okv nyidomooku nga Pwklinyarlinv, sichingmooku, okv Svmasa, okv ho bunu doonv mvnwng ngv ninyi gvngv! <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25,26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Miri 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref> </char></note> No minto Darwknv Dow lokv ngonugv abuapa noogv pakbu, Dabid gvlo, vdwlo hv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ogubv Jentail vdwa haak nyadunv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">ogubv nyi vdwv anyung kaamabv bunu gwngnya dunv?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Sichingmooku gv dvbv vdwv bunu atubongv mvngbv rinyato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">okv nyi am rigvnv vdwv lvkobv kaarwk minsula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Ahtunyi okv ninyigv Kristonyi nyiru nyato.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Lk 23:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mk 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Lk 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Jn 18:28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:29">29</ref> </char>
    </note> Herod okv Pontius Pilat soogv pamtvlo jentail vdwa lvkobv kaarwk minsuto okv Israel gv nyi vdwvka Jisunyi nyirula, noogv Darwknv Pakbu, yvvnyi noogv Messiah mvnamv. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Bunu ogumvnwng nga ridubv vngkum nyatoku ho noogv jwkrw okv mvngnam lokv rirung nvpv vnamv. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Okv vjv, Ahtua, bunugv milam mincham la rinam am kaayato, okv ngonua jito, noogv pakbu vdwa milakdubv, noogv doin mvnwng nga lvkobv busukano kamabv mindubv. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Mvpudubv noogv laakv irapto, okv ho gv kaasartabo okv lamrwpanama kaatam dubv jilinto noogv darwknv Pakbu Jisu gv amin bv.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Vdwlo bunu kumnya kunam gola, hoka bunugv dopam dookulo hwkdinto. Bunu mvnwng nga lvkobv Darwknv Dow aatoku okv Pwknvyarnv gv doina lvkobv busukano kamabv japgo raptoku.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwngnv vdwv bunugv yikungyira nga orpin sitoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44">Nyim 2:44</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:45">45</ref> </char>
    </note> Mvngjwngnv vdwv haapokv pwkin gubv mvngtoku. Yvvka ninyigv atu gvngv kv vla minkumato, vbvritola bunugv ogugo doodudw mvnwng nga bunu vdwv lvkobv orpin sitoku. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Kainv jwkrwa lvkobv Apostol vdwv Ahtu Jisu gv turkur kunama mingo jitoku, okv Pwknvyarnv bunu mvnwng nga nyitv nga boktalwkji toku. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Hoka nyipam arwng hoka yvvnyika paajinv dvdv ngv pamanam kaakuma. Yvvbunudw rongo vmalo naam doonv ngv um pyoktokula, pyoknam morko naarwk sukunama bvnglwk nyatoku, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>okv um Apostol vdwgv laak lo laklwk toku; okv morko nga barsaksakbv ninyigv mvngnam lo orpin sitoku.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Okv vbv ho Josep vnamgo, Lebi nyigo Saipraslo bvngnamgo, ninyia Apostol vdwv Barnabas vla minto (ho minamsi “Oogv mintvmiru yanv”), <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>hv atubongv gv rongo nga pyoklaku, morko nga bvnglwk jitoku, okv Apostol vdwgvlo laklwk jitoku.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ananias la Sapira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Vbvritola hoka nyi akonvgv aminv Ananias, ho ninyigv nywng Sapphira lvkobv bunugvlo yikungyira doonv nga kvvgonyi pyoktoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Vbvritola ninyigv nywng gv lvkobv umkvpakv vmisila hv morko kvvgonyi nyigvbv pvchingto okv kvvgonyi Apostol vdwlo laklwkto. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Pitar ninyia minto, “Ananias, no ogulvgabv Uyudvbv nga yaaku dunv okv yikungyira lokv paanam morko nga kvvgonyi pvpvtola no Darwknv Dowa mvvdunv? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Atuk lo no yikungyira nga pyoktv madvbv, vv no gvbv rito; okv pyokro kochingbv, morko ngv nokvku. Vbvrikunamv, no ogubv so svkvnvgo ridubv mvngpvnv? No nyi am mvvmado—no Pwknvyarnvnyi mvvdu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Ananias so tvvpa sopikda, hv giyala sidasirato; okv yvv um tvvbvdw mvnwng ngv busu nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Nyipayapa vdwv aatoku, ninyigv ayak am maatum tumtoku, ninyia agumbv baklin toku, okv ninyia sima ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Gunta aom lvlv kochinglo ninyigv nywng ngv, ogugo ripvdw chiya kumabv, arwnglo aatoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Pitar ninyia tvvkato, “Nga mimpato, morko mvnwng ngv si mvngchikre no la noogv nyilu nonyi gv yikungyira pyoknam lo paanamv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">“Vmabv,” hv mirwkto, “mvnwng vmabv.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Vkvlvgabv Pitar ninyia minto, “Ogubv no la noogv nyiluv Ahtu gv Dowa rikwripak dubv mvngpvnv? Noogv nyilu nga simarinv nyi vdwv vjv agiv daknyado, okv bunu namka agumlo baklin riku!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Vjakpigobv hv ninyigv lvpa lvkwng bv gimupla okv sidapvto. Yaapa vdwv arwng aatola okv ho kaakunamv hv sitoku, vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia baklinto okv ninyigv nyilu adarlo ritoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Gvrja mvnwng ngv okv yvvdw so kvvbi tvvpapvdw tvvnv mvnwng ngv busu nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lamrwpanambv okv kaasartabobv rinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Mvngchigo lamrwpadubv okv kaasartabobv nyi vdwgv pinkolo Apostol vdwv kaatamto. Mvngjwngnv mvnwng ngv lvkin gubv Solomon gv giabv lo kaarwk minsuto. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Agum lokv akonvka nyitwnglo mvngpak mabv bunua lvkobv aapwng nyumato, nyi vdwv bunua kainvgobv japnya kujvka. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Vbvritola kaiyayabv nyi yangv nyipamv aapwng yayato—Ahtunyi mvngjwngnv nyimv okv nyilo bv twngtv toku. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Kaakunamv lvvmanv nyi vdwa lamtv lo bakdar linto okv gadw lo okv kuchoklo karmu tola ho maanyikinyingka Pitar gv yalu babuv bunua vngsikla okv bunua poya modubv vla ritoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Okv Jerusalem adarai gv banggu lokv nyitwnggo aatoku, ho vdwv yvv lvvmapvdw vmalo yvvbunuam alvmanv dow doonv nga aagvnyato; okv bunu mvnwng ngv poyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apostol vdwa mvdwkmvku kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Vbvrikunamv Nyibu Butvyachuk okv ninyigv richam mvnwng ngv, sadusis gv ridungnv vdw vla, Apostol vdwa achialvbv kaanwng mabv rinyato; vkvlvgabv bunu rirap dokubv mimisitoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Bunu Apostol vdwa naatung toku okv bunua kvba patwk arwnglo tumlwkto. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Vbvritola ho ayuyupra lo Ahtu gv nyidogindung akonv patwk agiya kukda pvvtola, Apostol vdwa agum linggvto, okv bunua minto, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>“Vngnyika okv Pwknvyarnvnaam arwnglo daktola nyi mvnwng nga so anwnv singdung lvgabv mimpa tvka.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Apostol vdwv tvvda laikula, okv arukamchi doonyi chaalin rilo bunu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo aalakula okv tamsar sarap toku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Nyibu Butvyachok okv ninyigv ajin vdwv Jius gv nyigagatv mvnwng nga dopam pamdubv gokum nyato; vbvrikunamv patwk lo nyi vdwa orto jitola Apostol vdwa bunugv kaagialo boolwk dubv minto. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Vbvritola vdwlo nyigam vdwv vngchi tokudw, bunu Apostol vdwa patwk arwnglo kaapa kuma, vkvlvgabv bunu kvba lo vngkur lakula okv mimpa toku, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>“Ngonu vdwlo patwk hoka vngchi kunamv, ngonu vriap am alvbv raktin dubv kaato okv agi ho kaaria nvngv chin mvnwng ngv dakdubv kaato; vbvritola vdwlo ngonu agiya kokda kunamv, ngonu arwnglo akoka kaapa kumato!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Vdwlo nyibu butv mvnwng okv gvrja lo kaariadakrianv vdwv so tvvpa kunam gola, Apostol vdwa ogugo riku namngvdw bunu lamrwsuk panya toku. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Vbvrikunamv nyi ako arwng aatoku okv bunua minto, “Tvvriato! Nonu patwk tumnam nyi vdwv Pwknvyarnvnaam arwng gv nyi vdwa tamsar nyadu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Vkvlvgabv Nyigam gamtv angv ninyigv nyi vdwa lvkobv vnglaku okv Apostol vdwa aakur gvvtoku. Vbvrikujvka, bunu mvduridu bv mvngka kuma, vkvlvgavbolo bunu busu nyato ho nyi vdwv bunua vlwng orji mvngbv.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Bunu Apostol vdwa arwnglo aagv tola, bunua kvba kaagialo dakmu toku, okv Nyibu Butvyachok angv bunua tvvkato. <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mt 27:25</ref> </char></note> “Ngonu nonuam so nyi angv amin bv tamsar karma bvkv vla orto jitoku,” hv minto; “vbvritola nonuno ogugo ridudw kaatoku! Nonugv tamsarnama Jerusalem mvnwnglo dupwng mooto, okv nonuno ninyigv siku nvgv lvgabv alv ponampoma nga ngonua laarwk simu dubv mvngdu!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Pitar okv Apostol kvvgonv mirwksito, “Ngonu Pwknvyarnvnyi tvvrung dubv rirungdu, nyi yanga ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Ngonugv abuapa gv Pwknvyarnv sikunv Jisunyi turrap motoku, nonugv ninyia daapolo takkiro kochingbv. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Pwknvyarnv ninyia turkur motoku ninyigv lakbik takbvku Rigvnvgobv okv Ringnv gobv, Israel gv nyi vdwa mvngdin modubv alvnv dw nga jitoku okv bunugv rimur am mvngnga dokubv. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>So oguogu mvnwng nga ngonu tvriakarianv vdwv Ngonu okv Darwknv Dow, yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gv amin jinam hogv yvbunudw ninyia tvvdunv.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Vdwlo dopam gv nyi vdwv sum tvvpa nvgola, ho bunu mvnwng ngv achialvbv haachito bunu Apostol vdwa mvki dukubv mvngnya toku. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Vbvritola bunugv lokv akonv, Parisis go aminv Gamaliel vnamgo hv Pvbv tamsar nvgo okv nyi mvnwng gv mvngdv kunam go, kvba arwnglo dakrap toku. Hv Apostol vdwa agumlo achukgo daklin modubv orto jitoku, <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>okv vbvrikunamv hv kvba vdwa minto, “Israel gv ribam vdwa, so nyi vdw sum nonuno ogugo ritvdonvdw imasuto laka. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Nonuno mvngpato kvvlogv ho Tiudas gv kaatam nama, nyi kvvgonv kaibogobv hartvto, okv nyiga lvngpi gobv ninyia tulwkla riming gvvto. Vbvritola ninyia mvki kunamv, ninyigv nyi vdwv apinain toku, okv ninyigv binamtapnamka siro nyvrokaku. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Hokochingbv, Judas Galili nyi go amin lvkardw alulo aalwkto; ninyigv nyitwnggo ninyia kochingbv riming gvvto, vbvritola ninyia aka mvki toku, okv ninyigv ribam mvnwng vka kipinkiyin toku. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Okv so lvgabv, ngo nonua mindunv, oguguka ho nyi vdwa mvmarima bvka. Bunua mvngchik toputo! Bunu ogugo rungdupadudw okv ridupadudw vv nyi mvngdungridung lokv ridubolo, vv nyeri kunvpv, <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>vbvritola vv Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aadubolo, nonuno bunua mvchinrichin nyomare. Nonuno chinsure atubongv Pwknvyarnvnyi rinyingriru bv padarminsu namnga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Kvba mvnwng ngv Gamaliel gv minam am tvvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Bunu Apostol vdwa goklwk tvla, bunua svnyak patoku, okv bunua Jisu gv amin bv mingku madu kubv mintoku; okv vbvrikunamv bunua anyubv topu jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Okvku Apostol vdwv kvba lokv lintoku, bunu himpu toku, vkvlvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv ngv bunua Jisu gvbv rinam adwkaku nvnga boktalwkji toku. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Okv aludwkibv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo okv nyi mvnwng gv naam lo bunu minsar sarbv dula okv alvnv yunying nga Jisu Kristo lvkwnglo gvvtam jitoku.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ridornv kanwgo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ayungjvma nga, lvbwlaksu vdwv twngtv yaya toku, hoka Grik gaam minv Jius gola okv Jius jvjvgo bunu gvlo yalunggo dumisito. Grik minv Jius vdwv minyato ho bunugv hvngmi vdwv aludwkibv dvnamtvngnam ornam nga mvnglwk makv vto. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Vkvlvgabv Apostol vringgola anyiv mvngjwngnv vdwa lvkobv gokkum nyato okv minto, “So si ngonu gvbv alvma Pwknvyarnv gv gaama japma yabvya ainmorko a gakbwngla rinamv. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Vkvlvgabv, ajin vdwv nonugv pinkolo nyi kanwgo darlinto yvv alvjvbv darwknv Dowa gvvdunv okv minlak dunv, okv vkvnvlo ngonu bunua soogv lvgabv kaaria dubv tulwkre. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Vbvritola, ngonu atubongv kumku lo okv japgokolo rilwkdoolwk riku.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Nyitwng mvnwng ngv Apostol gv mingku bv lvkobv tulwk minggv toku, vkvlvgabv bunu Stipinnyi tulwkto, nyi angv achialvbv mvngjwng okv Darwknv Dow dooto, okv Pilip, Prokoras, Nikanor, Timon, Parminas, okv Nikolas, Antiok lokv Jentail nyi go klu lokv Judaism lo aaku nvgo. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Nyitwng ngv bunua Apostol vdwgvlo daklin motoku, bunu mvnwng gv laak v bunu gvlo lakpv tola kumtoku.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Okv Pwknvyarnv gv gamcharv tloblobv dupwng karbv moduku. Mvngjwng nvngv Jerusalem lo twngtv yaya toku, okv nyibu vdwka achialvgo mvngjwng la tulwk minggv toku.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stipinnyi laatungnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Stipin, Pwknvyarnv gv jwkrw okv kairungnv boktalwkjinam nyi ako, nyi mvnwng gv apam lo achialvgo lamrwpadubv okv kaasartabo bv kaatamto. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Vbvritola ninyia Jius kumkunaam gv topukunam nyi vdwv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Topukunam nyi vdwv </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bunu nyira mvkunam jius vdwv, vbvritola arv jitola laalin kunam vmalo bunugv jilin lakula topukunam.</char></note> bunu kaanwng mabv rito, (um vbv minto) ho vv Jius lokv Sairene okv Alekjandaria gvgoto. Bunu okv kvvbi Jius Silisia okv Asia lokv Stipinnyi lvkobv larmi surap toku. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Vbvritola Darwknv Dowv Stipinnyi mvnglak moto vdwlo hv mirap tokudw, bunu ninyia larya yanyumato. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu nyi kvvgonyi jinamgo jinyok tola mimuto, “Ngonu ninyia Moses okv Pwknvyarnvnyi tvvrutvya dubv minam am tvvyapvnv kv!” <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Vbvrila bunu nyi mvnwng nga miriok patoku, nyigagatv vdwa, okv pvbv tamsarnv vdwa. Bunu Stipinnyi naatung toku okv ninyia kvba kaagialo boolwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Vbvrikunamv ninyia mvvya modu bv bunu nyi meego naalwkto. Bunu minto, “so nyi si”, “ngonugv Pwknvyarnvnaam gv okv Moses gv Pvbv nga dvbvdwkibv minyingmiru mingki yado. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Ngonu ninyia vbv mindubv tvvto so Najaret gv Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam am mvyakre okv Moses gv lokv ngonu kvvlogv ridung mvnwng nga akusibv mvriku!” <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Kvbalo doonv mvnwng ngv bunugv nyikv Stipinnyi kaagap jinjin namv ninyigv nyukmuv nyidogindung gv nyukmu aingbv ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Stipin gv japnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Nyibu butvyachok ngv Stipinnyi tvvkato, “So si jvjv ngvri?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2,3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Atk 12:1</ref> </char></note> Stipin mirwksito, “Achiboru vdw okv Abu vdw, ngoogv minama tvvriato! Kvvlo ngonugv abuapa Abraham Haran lo vngtv madvbv Mesopotamia doyilo kairungnv Pwknvyarnv ninyia kaatam suto <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>okv ninyia minto, ‘Noogv mooku isi okv vpinvriap vngyuto okv vnglinto ho mookulo nam ngo kaatamre.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Atk 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">Atk 12:4</ref> </char></note> Okv hv vbvrikunamv ninyigv diringmooku isi nga vngyu toku okv Haran lo vngla dootoku. Abraham gv abu siro kochingbv, Pwknvyarnv ninyia so mooku so doodubv mvto vjak ogolo hv doopvdw. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Atk 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref> </char></note> Vbvrikunamv Pwknvyarnv Abrahamnyi mooku achukguka ninyigvbv jimato, lvchu kurpv kogodaka jimato, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv milvto ninyia sum jidubv vla, okv vv ninyigvbv ridukubv okv ninyigv singsit gvbv ridukubv. Alu dwlo Pwknvyarnv soogv milv nam sum milin jitoku, ho Abraham gv umvuu kaamarilo. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6,7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Atk 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref> </char></note> Ninyia Pwknvyarnv svbv minto: ‘Noogv singsit vdwv nyebunyi diringmooku isi lo doore, hoka bunua nyira gubv okv anying nyingpi go hingching dubv mvrikla doogvre. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Mog 3:12</ref> </char></note> Vbvritola ngo nyi vdwgvlo vngbo jwngkadaka namgo doore ho bunu vdwv pakbu jvbv ririku, Okv Hokochingbv noogv singsit vdwv bunu vnglin riku ho diringmooku lokv okv nga kumriku so gwngda arwnglo.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Atk 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">Atk 21:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:26">Atk 25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:31-35:18">Atk 29:31—35:18</ref> </char></note> Vbvrikunamv Pwknvyarnv Abrahamnyi ayakmvu namgo kaachin dubv bunyi gv mingkimiyak minsu nama mvngpala rimunam lvgabv jitoku. Vkvlvgabv Abraham Isaaknyi bvngla alu kanw kochinglo ayakmvu toku; Isaak ninyigv kuunyilo Jakopnyi ayakmvu toku, okv Jakop ninyigv kuunyilo ngonugv yunyingyunam abuapa bv rinv kuunyilo vdwa ayakmvu toku.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Atk 37:11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:28">Atk 37:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:2">Atk 39:2</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref> </char>
    </note> “Jakop gv kuunyilo vdwv bunugv boru Josepnyi kaanwng mabv rito okv ninyia pakbu bv Ijipt lo pioklwkto. Vbvrijvka Pwknvyarnv ninyi gvlo lvkobv dooto <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Atk 41:39-41</ref> </char></note> okv ninyigv adwkaku mvnwng lokv ninyia atupachi kaama dubv laalwk toku. Vdwlo Josep Ijipt gv dvbv nga kaarwksitv madvbv, Pwknvyarnv ngv ninyia mvngyam nvnv okv mvnglaknvnv am jilwkto, okv dvbv ngv Josepnyi diringmooku isi mvnwng okv nasungnaam nga kaaria dubv gobunor gubv mvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1">Atk 42:1</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 42:2">2</ref> </char></note> Vbvrikunamv Ijipt okv Kanaan mooku mvnwng lo hoka yarwngdwrw ngv aatoku, vbvrikunamv achialvbv adwkaku toku. Ngonugv abuapa vdwv oguguka dvsvtwngsv ka paakuma, <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>okv vdwlo Jakop Ijipt lo hoka aamtami dvpatwngpa dubv tvvpapvdw, hv vngmuto ninyigv kuunyilo vdwa, ngonugv abuapa, bunua hoka vngcho moto. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Atk 45:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 45:16">Atk 45:16</ref> </char></note> Lvnyinvbv vngkurkunam lo Josepnyi atubongv achiboru vdwa kaachin kodu bv ritoku, okv Ijipt gv dvbv ngv Josep gv vpinvriap am chinya toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9">Atk 45:9</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">Atk 46:27</ref> </char></note> Vbvrikunamv Josep atugv abu Jakopnyi yunying go, ninyia milwkto okv vpinvriap mvnwng nga, nyi chamkanw gola angu mvnwng aka, Ijipt lo aadubv. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Atk 46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:33">Atk 49:33</ref> </char></note> Vbvrikunamv Jakop Ijipt lo vngto, ogolo ninyila okv ninyigv kuunyilo vdwgv silwkku bv rikuv. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Atk 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Js 24:32</ref> </char></note> Ho bunugv svma nga Sikem lo baktoku, bunugv nyibung rikua Abraham Hamor haalung gvlo morko jitola rvtoku.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7">Mog 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:8">8</ref> </char>
    </note> “Vdwlo Pwknvyarnv Abrahamnyi milv namv dw vv aanwk tokudw, Ijipt lo ngonugv nyi ngv twngtv yaya toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Anyungnga Josep gv lvkwng lo chima nvgonv dvbv ako Ijipt lo rigvla riraptoku. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10">Mog 1:10</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Mog 1:22</ref> </char></note> Hv ngonugv abuapa nga gwngkupto okv bunua aiamar mato, bunugv kuu anga vdwa bunua naam lokv agumlo charlila dubv mvto, vkvlvgavbolo simu dubv vla <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Mog 2:2</ref> </char></note> Ho dwlo Mosesnyi bvngto, anga angv achialvbv kaaputo. Ninyia naam lo poolu pwkgumgo ringchum la rito, <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Mog 2:3-10</ref> </char></note> okv vdwlo ninyigv naam lokv ninyia agum lo topak tokudw, dvbv gv umvnyijar angv ninyia laato okv ninyia atugv kuunyilo gubv mvla ninyia sootv toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Ninyi Ijipt nyi vdwgv mvngkimvnglak mvnwng nga tamsar toku okv kokwng loku gaamlo milaknv chinvpanv kainv nyi gubv ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23-29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Mog 2:11-15</ref> </char>
    </note> “Vdwlo Moses anying champi tokudw, hv mvngchinla ritoku ninyigv Israel ajin vdwgv vdwgo hirukaya mvnwng nga hinla ridu kudw. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Bunugv lokv akonyi Ijipt nyi akonv richingriying ridubv hv kaapa toku, vkvlvgabv ninyia ringbv hv vngtoku okv mvrwk sula ninyia mvki toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>(Hv mvngnamv ninyigv atugv nyi vdwv mvngchin pvkunvpv Pwknvyarnv ninyia bunua linggv dukubv ritv dunv vla, vbvrilachin bunu vdwv oguka mvngchin mato) <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Lvnyinvbv logo nvnga vngyilo hv Israel nyi anyigo mvmi sudubv kaapato, okv hv anyi gv pingkolo alv minsu modubv gwngkw rikwto. Hv minto, ‘nyi vdwa, tvriato,’ ‘bunyi anyino Israel anying vlaka; ogubv nonuno sibv padarminsu dunv?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Vbvritola richingriying yanv akonv Mosesnyi nvnglin toku. Hv mintoku, ‘Ngonyi gv pingkolo nam miriavngria dubv mvnv ngv yvvla?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>‘No meru hogv Ijipt nyi akonyi mvki nam aingbv, no ngaaka mvkiso mvngpv ai?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3">Mog 18:3</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 18:4">4</ref> </char></note> Vdwlo sum Moses tvvpa namgola, hv Ijipt mooku gvngv kilin toku okv Midian mooku lo vngla dootoku. Hoka ninyi kuunyilo anyigo dootoku.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Mog 3:1-10</ref> </char>
    </note> “Anying champi go vngro koching nga, nyidogindung akonv chokri mooku gv mootum yamchum golo vmvbv gulinla Sinai moodw gv nvchilo Mosesnyi kaarwksuto. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Moses kaato kula hv lamngakpatoku, okv mootum gv yamchum nvchilo aatoku kaabwk dubv vla. Vbvritola Ahtu gv gaama hv tvvpa toku:” <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‘Ngo nonugv abuapa vdwgv Pwknvyarnv ngv, Abraham, Isaak, okv Jakop gv Pwknvyarnv ngv.’ Moses busula jinjin rumrumto okv kaadw chinchi nyumato. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Ahtu ninyia minto, ‘Noogv lvkiama pilin pvtoka, no ogolo dakpvdw ho kwdwv darwk nvngv. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Ngoogv nyi vdwa Ijipt lo alvmabv hirukaya hindubv kaato. Ngo bunugv svgok goknama tvvpvnv, okv ngo bunua ringlin tvvbv ipvnv. Vjak aato; ngo nam Ijipt lo vngmure.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Mog 2:14</ref> </char>
    </note> “Moses Israel nyi vdwgv toakunam akonv. Bunu tvvkato, ‘nam yvvla ngonua kaariataria nvgobv okv mvpvnv?’ Pwknvyarnv ho ninyia nyi vdwa kaariatarianv akobv okv bunua ringlin dubv vngmuto nyidogindung ninyia mootum yamchum lo vmvbv gula kaarwk sunv gv ridur lokv. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Mog 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">Mog 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Num 14:33</ref> </char></note> Hv nyi vdwa Ijipt loka vnglin gvvtoku, kaasartabo okv Ijipt lo lamripanam kaatamto okv Lwngchingnv svmasa lo okv anying champi go chokrimookulo rikwngto. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref> </char></note> Moses akinmwng Israel gv nyi mvnwng nga minv ngv, ‘Pwknvyarnv nyijwk ako jilwkre, ninyia vjak nga jilwknam aingbv,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ninyi vjak nga jilwknam aingbv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nga jvjvbv. </char></note> okv vv nonugv atugv nyi ako bv rire.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Mog 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Det 5:1-33</ref> </char></note> Hv laka Israel nyi vdwa lvkobv chukri mookulo dokumla rigvdonv; hv hoka ngonugv abuapa gv lvkobvka okv ninyia lvkobv nyidogindung Sinai moodwlo ninyia japnv, okv hv Pwknvyarnv gv singdung doina naarwkla ngonu gvlo jilwkto.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>“Vbvritola ngonugv abuapa vdwv ninyia tvvjimakv vtoku; bunu ninyia nvnglin pvto okv Ijipt bv vngkur dukubv bunu mvnggya toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Mog 32:1</ref></char></note> Vkvlvgabv bunu Aaronnyi minto, ‘Ngonua rigvnv pwknvyarnv gonv vtwng go ngonua mvji yapi. Ngonu chinkuma ho nyi Mosesnyi ogubv ripv kunvdw ngonua Ijipt lokv lingvkunv ngv.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Mog 32:2-6</ref></char></note> Vbvrikunamv bunu vbv rinya toku morti go svv nga mvring namgo mvtola, um erinpeelwkla rito, okv bunugv vbv ogugo mvpvdw ho mvkunam lvgabv hartv minsu laku dvpam goka pamnya toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5:25-27</ref> </char></note> Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnv bunua dakkur toku okv bunua nyidomooku gv takar vdwa kumdujoodu bv jitoku, so sum nyijwk vdwgv kitap lo lvkpvto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Israel gv nyi vdwa! ho vv ngo gvbvma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">nonugv chukrimooku lo anying champi go rila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">svnwngsvmin am pakila okv erinpeeji namv.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Ho gv vv Pwknvyarnv Molvk gv tombuv ho nonuno bakkar karnamv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">okv Repan gv potuv, nonugv takar Pwknvyarnv ngv;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">vv bunu morti ngv nonugv kumdubv mvnam vdwv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Okv vkvlvgabv nonua ngo Bebilon nga vngbola vngram more.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:9">Mog 25:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref> </char>
    </note> “Ngonugv abuapa vdwv Pwknvyarnv gv doomwng gvvnam tombuv chukrimooku lo bunua lvkobv dooming gvvto, vv Pwknvyarnv gv Mosesnyi mvtokv vla mingku lokv mvto, vbv mvtokv vla milam lo Moses kaatam jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:14-17">Jem 3:14-17</ref> </char></note> Kochingso, ngonugv abuapa vdwv bunugv abu vdwlokv tombua laatoku um bunu Josua gv lvkobv okv Pwknvyarnv gv kvvbi diringmooku vdwa charpak jiroku kvdw hoka aarilo bunu um bakbwngto. Okv ho tombu angv Dabid gv singri loka doodvto. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2Sam 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1Kri 17:1-14</ref> </char></note> Hv Pwknvyarnv gv mvngkiam bv rito okv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumto ninyia Jakop gv Pwknvyarnv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jakop gv Pwknvyarnv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonv doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Israel gv nyi vdwv. </char></note> gv lvgabv doogingku naam go mvnyu dubv jila bvkv vla kooto. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1Dv 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2Kri 3:1-17</ref></char></note> Vbvritola Solomon yabv ninyigv lvgabv naam a mvtoku.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>“Vbvritola Kai yachoknv Pwknvyarnv ngv nyia laak lokv mvnam naam lo dooma dvnv; Nyijwk gv minam jvbv,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49,50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Aij 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref> </char>
    </note> ‘Ahtu mindu, nyidomooku ngv ngoogv dooging ngv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">okv sichingmooku si ngoogv lvpa daging ngv.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Oguaingnv naam go nonu ngoogv lvgabv mvtv tvvdunv?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ogolo ngoogv doolwk jikuv?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Ngo atubongv so ogumvnwng nga mvvma pvnvre?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Aij 63:10</ref> </char>
    </note> “Vdwgo nonuno mvngkuk linyu madunv!” Stipin um mimbwng dvdvto. “Vdwgo nonugv haapokv chimadunv, vdwgo nonuno Pwknvyarnv gv doina rungji nyadunv! Nonuno nonugv abuapa vdwgv apia jvbv ridu; nonuka Darwknv Dowa naarwk mabv dvdvbv rikidu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Nonugv abuapa vdwv nyijwk akoka mvjwk mvbit la rima nvngvre? Bunu Pwknvyarnv gv gindungpingko go, hogv klu kuchugv ninyigv darwkchongjornv Pakbu go aaji kunv nga mimpa jiyakunv om mvkito. Okv vjak nonu ninyia pyoktoku okv mvki toku. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Nonuno kunv Pwknvyarnv gv Pvbv nga nyidogindung gv laak loka naarwk sikunv—vbvrijvka nonuno vjaklodvbv um mingku lo tvvma duku!”<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stipinnyi vlwng orkinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Kvba lo nyi vdwv Stipin gv minama tvvriala dooto, bunu achialv bv hidik nyato okv bunugv hijung ngv itikkvrwk nyala dokcha nyato. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Vbvritola Stipin, Darwknv Dow akomaring tukula nyidomooku kaadungto okv Pwknvyarnv gv hartvkai nama kaapato okv Jisu Pwknvyarnv gv lakbik takbv dakto. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Hv minto, “Kaato!” “Ngo nyidomooku nga kukko dubv kaapado okv ho Nyi gv Kuunyilo ngv Pwknvyarnv gv lakbik tangv lo dakdo!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Kvba nyi vdwv achialv bv goknyala bunu lvkobv bunugv nyarung nga bunugv laakv mamtum nyato. Bunu mvnwng ngv baapu alvbv lvkin gubv Stipinnyi nvngjab nyato, <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>pamtv gv agum bv ninyia charlin nyato, okv ninyia vlwng ngv ornyato. Kaayatvrianv vdwv bunugv vji laklwk am Sol vnam yaapa gvlo kaachumtai yadubv orkum jito. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Bunu Stipinnyi vlwng ngv ordungto hv svgokla Ahtunyi gokto, “Ahtu Jisu, ngoogv dowa laarwk kubvkv!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Hv lvbwng kumpv tokula okv achialv bv gokla kapto, “Ahtua! so rimur kunam sum mvngpa kuma bvkv bunugv rinyingriru kunama!” Hv sum mintokula okv sitoku.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Okv Sol vkvgv gwngrw sinama alv nvgobv mvngtoku.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sol Gvrja nga mvritririt toku</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">O alulo Jerusalem gvrja lo alvmanv nyi vdwv mvdwmvku namv rirapto. Mvngjwngnv mvnwng ngv Judia mooku lola okv Samaria mookulo vngyakvngchak nyato, Apostol vdwv vmwngku. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Nyi alvbv mvngjwngnv kvvgonv Stipinnyi svma ritoku, ninyigvbv mvngdwk nyala kapnya toku.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4">Nyim 22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Vbvritola Sol gvrja nga mvyakmvchak dubv gwngtoku; naam lo vngla, hv mvngjwngnv vdwa svdarlinto, anvnyimv jvka nyiga jvka okv bunua patwk lo tumlwk nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria lo alvnv gamlv nga japkar toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Mvngjwngnv vdwv ogolo mooku mvnwng lo vngsik karpv kudw, mooku mvnwng lo vnggola doina mingkar nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Pilip samariya dinchiyachoknv pamtv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mookudinchinv pamtv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Som kitap kvvgonvlo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pamtv akobv.</char></note> lo vngla Messiah nga nyi vdwlo japkar jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Ogugo Pilip mimpvdw nyipamv vngkam nyala tvvnyato, bunu ninyia tvvgap kaagap nyato okv ninyia lamrwpadubv rinama kaanya toku. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Achialvbv nyi vdwgvlo alvmanv dow achialvbv kapla linya toku, achialvgo nyi dwgwngnv okv lvpiknv ponya toku. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Vkvlvgvbv ho pamtv okaku achialvbv mvngpu nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Nyi ako aminv Saimon vnamgo hoka dooto, hv lvko lvkobv ninyi lama hinam lokv Samaritan nyi vdwa lamrwpadubv mvto. Ho ninyi atubongv kainv akobv minsuto, <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>okv pamtv gv nyi mvnwng ngv ninyia tvvkamkaakam nyato. Bunu minto, “Hv oogv Pwknvyarnv gv jwkrwv, ‘Kainv jwkrw” vla chimbwng kunam go. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Bunu dinchi alvbv ninyia tvvriakariato ogulvgavbolo kvvlo gvngv lokv ninyi bunua ninyigv lama lokv lamrwpadubv mvbwng jito. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Vbvritola vdwlo bunu Pilip gv doin alvnv yunying Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv lvkwng lo okv Jisu Kristo gv lvkwng lo tvvla mvngjwng tukudw, bunu mvvga jvka nyiga jvka, baptisma lanya toku. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Saimon atubongv ka mvngjwng sutoku; okv kochingso baptisma laatoku, hv Pilip gv nvchilo doomin gvvto, okv kaakw manam lamrwpadubv kaatamritam nama kaala kaasartabo bv kaatoku.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Jerusalem lo doonv Apostol vdwv Samaria gv nyi vdwv Pwknvyarnv gv gaama laarwk supvku vla tvvpa toku, vkvlvgabv bunu Pitar nyila Jonnyi bunu gvlo vngmuto. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Vdwlo bunu vngchi tokudw, bunu mvngjwngnv vdwa Darwknv Dowa paamu dubv vla kumtoku. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Darwknv Dowv bunu gvlo yvvnyika aatv madvto; bunu Ahtu Jisu gv amin bv baptisma laamwngto. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar okv Jon bunyi gv laakv bunu gvlo lakpvto, okv bunu Darwknv Dowa paatoku.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Saimon vdwlo Apostol vdwv mvngjwngnv vdwa bunugv laakv lakpvnam gola darwknv Dow jinama kaapa toku. Vkvlvgabv hv Pitar nyila Jonnyi morko jito, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>okv minto, “So jwkrw sum ngaka jila bvkv, vkvlvgabv ngoogv yvvnyika laakv lakpv ridw bunu Darwknv Dowa paadubv.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Vbvritola Pitar ninyia mirwksito, “No okv noogv morko ngv uyumooku bv vngnyika, no Pwknvyarnv gv amin jinam am morko lokv rvnyure vla mvngnam lvgabv. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>No ngonu gvlo ribamdakbam dubv rikuma, ogulvgavbolo noogv haapok gv mvngnamv Pwknvyarnv gvlo alvkuma. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Vbvrikunamv, mvngdinto, svbv noogv alvmanv mvngnama, okv Ahtunyi kumtoka hv noogv svbv mvngmur nama mvngnga jireku. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Ngo kaanamv no achialv bv kabiutari yaya nvgo okv rimur gv patwk lo tumnamgo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Saimon Pitar nyila Jonnyi minto, “Ayala ngo gvbv Ahtunyi kumji labv, nonugv minam vdwsi ngo gvlo rima dubv.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Bunu bunugv minsvrisv nga mintamro kochingbv bunu Ahtu gv doina minggo jitoku. Pitar okv Jon bunyi Jerusalem bv vngkur toku. Bunugv vngku lamtv lo bunu Alvnv Yunying nga Samaria gv nampum mvnwng lo japgo jitoku.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilip okv Itiopian nyigam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Ahtu gv nyidogindung akonv pilipnyi minto, “Gudungto okv yurko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yurko </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">alu lvpa.</char></note> yabv Jerusalem lokv Gaja vngjiku lamtv bv vngdubv.” (So lamtv si sinyingsilu vngkuma)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">So lamtv si sinyingsilu vngkuma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Soogv si chokri lamtv ngv.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27-28"/>Vkvlvgabv Pilip vngdu kubv rila okv vngtoku, vjak Itopian alvyachoknv nyigam hijra go Itopia dvnv gv ainmorko nga rigvyanv go, ninyigv naam takbv vnglintoku. Hv Jerusalem lo vngla Pwknvyarnvnyi kumpikula okv ninyigv yikungyira nga bakla ikula naam bv vngkur toku. Hv vbv vngdula, hv nyijwk Aijaya gv kitap nga purito. <verse eid="ACT 8:27-28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Darwknv Dowv Pilipnyi minto, “Yikungyira bagla vngnv, um vngchitvka okv vkvgv nvchilo vngtoka.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Pilip ninyi gvlo joklwk toku okv ninyia nyijwk Aijaya gv kitap nga puri dubv tvvpato. Ninyia tvvkato, “Noogv purinam um no chinpvre?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Oo nyigam angv mvrwksuto, “Nyigonv mimpa mabolo ngo oguaingbv sum chindubv?” Okv hv Pilipnyi gvvchala chaatokv vla gokto okv ninyia yikungyira baknv nga lvkobv dootokv vla. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32,33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Aij 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref> </char></note> Ninyigv kitap puri ridungnam angv si:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Hv svlar ako boola ila pakinam aingbv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">svlarkuu gv amw peelin jvka sidu manv aingbv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">hv oguguka gamchar milinma.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Ninyia nyi mangv aingbv mvto, okv jvjv nga kaajitajinv vv ninyia tvvma jitoku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Yvvka ninyigv husi lvgabv mimpa jila nyumare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">ogulvgavbolo ninyigv singdung ngv nyiamooku so singnya dukubv aaduku.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Nyigam angv Pilipnyi tvvkato, “Nga mimpa labv, nyijwk angv si yvvnyi mindunv? Atubongvre vmalo ako gunyire?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Vbvrikunamv Pilip japrap toku; so darwknv kitap lokv puri rirapto, ninyi Jisu gv Alvnv Yunying nga hv mimpa toku. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Bunu lamtv pvkwng bvku irilo, bunu isi meego dooku gulo aatoku, okv nyigam angv minto, “So si isi meego doopv. Nga so baptisma jilabv?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonv soogv verse nga lvkpwngdo 37: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pilipnyi minto, “Noogv haapok gv mvngjwng pvnvlo nam Baptisma jire.” Ninyi mirwkto, “Vv kv,” “Ngo mvngjwng do Jisu Kristo Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv.” </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Pilipnyi minto, “Noogv haapok gv mvngjwng pvnvlo nam Baptisma jire.” Ninyi mirwkto, “Vv kv,” “Ngo mvngjwng do Jisu Kristo Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Ho nyigam angv goragari nga daktung moto, okv Pilip la nyigam angv bunyi isi dokubv lvkobv ito, okv Pilip ninyia Baptisma jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Vdwlo bunu isi gvngv agum lintokudw, Ahtu gv Darwknv Dow Pilipnyi lala vngro gvvtoku. Nyigam angv ninyia kaapa kumato vbvritola ninyigv vngtunglo himpu la vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Ajotas lo Pilip atubongv kaapa suto; hv kaisaria bv vnglintoku, okv hv lamtv lo vngyingla Alvnv yunying nga banggu mvnwnglo japkar toku.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sol gv mvngdin kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Nyim 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Sol ho apo gunv nga Ahtu ninyigv mvngjwngnv vdwa rinyingrirula ninyia yalungyachung dula gwngrw talwngbv rila mvritto. Ninyi nyibu butvyachok gvlo vngto, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>okv Damaskas lo Jius vdwgv kumkunaam lo kaatam nvdubv sitiputa go kooto, ogulvgavbolo ho hoka yvvnyika hv kaapa ridw Ahtu gv lamtvlo vngnv vdwa, hv bunua nyimv jvka nyilo jvka naatung tola okv bunua Jerusalem bv bookar dukubv vla.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Sol Damaskas gv pamtv lo aachi svlv nga, dvminmabv nyido gvngv ninyia dooriak loung go ungkato. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Hv kwdwlo gipvto okv ninyia vlv gamgo mindubv tvvpato, “Sol, Sol! No ogubv nga mvdwkmvku dunv?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Sol tvvkato, “Ahtu, no yvvla?” ho gv vlv ngv minto,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">“Ngoonv Jisu, noogv mvdwkmvku kunam,” vlv ngv vbv minto. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>“Vbvritola gudungto okv pamtv lo vngnyika ho hoka nam mimpare no ogugunyi risvdw.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Sol gv lvkobv nyi vngbam vdwv daktung nyatoku, gamchar guka milin kuma; bunu gaam go tvvpato vbvritola oguguka kaapama. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sol kvdw gvngv godung toku okv ninyigv nyikv nyiktar toku, vbvritola oguachuk goka kaapama. Vbvrikunamv ninyia bunu laak am gakbwng tukula okv ninyia Damaskas lo vnggv toku. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Hv alu loum go kaapa kuma, okv ho dw lo hv ogugoka dvkutvngku mato.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Damaskas lo mvngjwngnv ako doonv gv aminv Ananias. Hv nyikrw kaanamv, ninyia Ahtu minto, “Ananias!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Hv mirwksito, “Ahtu, ngo sika kv.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Ahtuv ninyia minto, “Gudungto okv lamtv vngchik bv vngdavngra tvka, okv Judas gv naam lo Tarsus lokv nyi Sol vnam amin go um tvvkato. Hv kumdungdo, <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>okv hv nyikrwgo kaato Ananias vnam nyi ako ninyigv laakv ninyia kaapa modu kubv vla hipo dubv yuma maato.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Ananias mirwksuto, “Ahtu, so nyi agv lvkwng lo achialvbv nyi vdwv nga minjipvnv okv Jerusalem lo doonv noogv nyi vdwa hv achialvbv alvmabv rinv ngv. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Okv hv Damaskas lo nyibu butv vdwgv lokv nam kumnvjonv nyi vdwa naatung dubv vla naatung nvnv siti pota lala aapvnv.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Ahtu ninyia minto, “Vngnyika, ngo ninyia ngo gvbv ridukubv darlin pvkunv, ogulvgavbolo ngoogv amina Jentail vdwlo okv dvbv vdwlo okv Israel nyi vdwlo chinmu dukubv. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Okv ngo atubongv ninyia ngoogv lvgabv hv vdwgo hirukaya nga hinsvkudw ho mvnwng nga ngo ninyia kaatamre.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Vkvlvgabv Ananias vngtoku, Sol ogolo naam lo doopvdw ho aatoku, okv ninyigv laakv ninyia lakpv tola. Hv minto, “Achiboru Sol,” “Ahtu Jisu atubongv nga so aamu pvnv, noogv so aatv ringa lamtv lo noogv kaarwk sunam. Hv nga aamu pvnv ogulvgavbolo nam lvkodv kaapa modu kubv vla okv Darwknv Dowa paamu dukubv vla.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Vjakpigobv Sol gv nyik lokv ngui asikarik ainggo olinto, okv hv lvkodv kaapa toku. Hv dakrap toku okv baptisma naatoku; <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Okv kochingso hv dvnam dvnyu laku okv ninyigv gwlwkv aakur toku.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sol Damaskas lo japnam</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sol mvngjwngnv vdwgv lvkobv alu lonyiloum go Damaskas lo doomin gvvto. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Hv Jius vdwgv kumkunaamlo vngdavngra la okv ho Jisu Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngvkv vla japrap toku.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Ninyigv minama tvvnv mvnwng ngv lamrwpato okv tvvkato, “So nyi angv mai Jerusalem alo hogv nyi Jisunyi kumnvjoonv nga mvkinv? Okv hv vbv so ogugo mvngla aama sudw ho nyi vdwa naatung la okv bunua nyibu butv vdwgvlo bookur lwkdu kubv ridu nvgori?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Vbvritola Sol gv japnamv tvvngam yaya toku, okv ninyi Jisu Messiah vla kaatam la mintoku ho Damaskas lo doonv Jius nyi vdwv ninyia yvvka mirwk sinyu matoku.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2Kor 11:32</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref> </char>
    </note> Alu mvngchigo vngro kochinglo, Jius vdwv lvkobv kaarwk suto okv Solnyi mvki dubv rungnyato, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>vbvritola ninyia bunugv rungnam nga mimpa toku. Aluayu bv ninyia mvki dubv vla bunu pamtv gv agilo tooya toku. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Vbvritola ayu yupgo lo Sol gv rigvvnam vdwv ninyia chikchiya mvko tvla okv otum gulo doomu gvrila lvkwnglo soolu toku.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem lo Sol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Sol Jerusalem lo vngto okv lvbwlaksu vdwgvlo ribam dubv rito. Vbvritola bunu ninyia lvbwlaksu gubv mvngjwng mato, okv bunu mvnwng ngv ninyia busuto. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Vbvrikunamv Barnabas ninyia naarwk sudubv aatoku okv ninyia Apostol vdwgvlo vnggv toku. Hv bunua oguaingbv Sol Ahtu ninyia lamtv lo kaarwk supvdw okv ho Ahtu ninyia oguaingbv raami supvdw mimbwk jitoku. Hv ka bunua mimpa toku Sol gv busukano kumabv Damaskas lo Jisu gv amin bv japgo karku nama. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Okv vbvrikunamv Sol bunua lvkobv doobam toku okv Jerusalem bv vngyik kartoku, Ahtu amin bv busukano kumabv japto. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Hv ka Grik bv japnv Jius vdwa japmi sila okv haak minsuto, vbvritola bunu ninyia mvki dubv rito. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Vdwlo mvngjwngnv vdwv um chinpa namgola, bunu Solnyi Kaisaria lo aagvto okv ninyia Tarsus lo vngmu toku.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Okv vkvlgabv ho Judia, Galili, okv Samaria Gvrja lo ho dwa sarsopoyoto. Darwknv Dow gv ridur kolokv hoka gwlwk nyato okv Ahtunyi alvbv mvngjwng nyato, mvngjwng nvngvka kaiyaya toku.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Lidda okv Joppa lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Pitar mooku dvdvlo vngsik karto, okv lvko nvnga Lidda lo doonv Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwa kaalwkbv hv vngto. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Hoka Ainias vnam nyi ako ninyia kaarwk suto, hv digwngla doonvgo okv gadw lo gudung nyuku mabv anying pinw go dooku nvgo. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Pitarnyi minto, “Ainias,” “Jisu Kristo nam alvdubv mvpure. Gudungto okv noogv gadwa mvdinmvta tokuka.” Vjakpigobv Ainias gudung toku. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Lidda okv Soran lo doonv nyi mvnwng ngv ninyia kaapa toku, okv Ahtunyi bunu mvngjwng nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Joppa hoka ka Tabita vnam nyimv ako dooto, Hv mvngjwng nvgo. (Grik bv ninyigv amina Dorkas gobv minto, minam si “svdum ako”). Ninyigv singnam mvnwng nga alvnvgobv rito okv heemanv vdwa ridurto. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Oogv dw lo hv lvvmala sitoku. Ninyigv svma nga harkak tokula okv pvvya yagv karchung lo joopv toku. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Lidda lokv Joppa ngv adu minsu mato, okv vdwlo Joppa lo doonv mvngjwngnv vdwv Pitarnyi Lidda lo doopv vla tvvpa pvkudw, bunu nyi anyigo milwkla vngmu toku, “Ayala ngonu gvlo baapubv aaji labvkv.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Vkvlvgabv Pitar gwnggegwngrap tokula okv bunugv lvkobv vngtoku. Vdwlo hv vngchi tokudw, ninyia pvvya yagv karchung lo chaagv toku, hoka hvngmi mvnwng ngv ninyia doyumto, kapdula okv jvkok laklwk, jvtv Dorkas gv turla doori lo chumji nama ninyia kaatamto. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Pitar bunu mvnwng nga karchung agumbv limu tokula, okv guplwk doola kumtoku; vbvrikunamv hv svma takbv dakrwk tola okv minto, “Tabita, gudungto!” hv ninyigv nyikv nyiktar toku, okv vdwlo hv Pitarnyi kaapa tokudw, hv gudung toku. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Pitar nvchilo aanwk tola okv ninyia svvdungto. Vbvrikunamv hv mvngjwngnv vdwa, hvngmi vdwa mintala, goklwk toku okv bunua ninyia turdu kubv kaatam nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Soogv yunying ngv Joppa mooku mvnwng lo dupwng nyato, okv Ahtunyi achialvgo mvngjwng toku. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Pitar Joppa lo apin mvnv Saimon minam nyi ako lvkobv alu meego doomin gvvtoku.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pitar okv Kornelias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Kaisaria lo Kornelias vnam nyi ako dooto, Hv Rom sipai rejiment gv kiapten bv rito, um “Italian rejiment” vla minto. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Hv dormo nyi ako; hv okv ninyigv vpin mvnwng ngv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumnvjoonv go. Hv Jius nyi heema nvnga ka kaadur nvgo okv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumbwng nvgo. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Alu logo lo arium gv gunta aom rilo hv nyikrwgo kaato, hv pvbwngvrwngbv kaato Pwknvyarnv gv nyidogindung go aala okv ninyia minto, “Kornelias!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Hv nyidogindung nga busula kaadi chinchi to okv minto, “Tamsarnv, si oguv?” Nyidogindung ngv mirwkto, “Pwknvyarnv noogv kumnam okv jilakrumlak nama alvbv mvngdu, okv nam mirwk sudubv mvngdu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Okv vjak Joppa lo nyi meego vngmuto nyi daadwvrw rungnv go vkvgv aminv Saimon Pitar kv. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Hv apin mvnv Saimon vnam, svmasa agum lo naam doonv gvlo nyen bv rila doodu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Vbvrikunamv nyidogindung ngv vnglintoku, okv Kornelias ninyigv naam gv nyira anyigo okv sipai ako, nyi dormo lo doonv ako, hogv akonv vv ninyigv atubogv lokv kaaria tarianvgo to. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Hv ogugo ripvdw bunua mimpa toku okv bunua Joppa lo vngmu toku.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Alu logo nvnga, bunu lamtv bv vngdungto okv Joppa gv nvchilo aari nga, donyitabv nga Pitar kumbv naam namwng aulo chaato. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Hv kano toku okv ogugo dvnwng toku; vdwlo dvnam nga mvdung la ripv nga, hv nyikrwgo kaato. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Hv nyidomooku gv agiya kokko dubv kaapato okv ogu ako vji jvbor bortvnv aingbv kaanv go atung tungpi nga kvlum tola sichingmooku bv oolu dubv kaapa toku. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Hoka piakarnv svnwngsvmin nvgwng nvngv dooto, okv mootum pvta ngvka. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Vlvgo ninyia minto, “Pitar, gudungto; mvkitvla okv dvvto!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar mirwksito, “Ahtu, vbv makv! Ngo oguguka darmanv okv darwk manv go dvka mapvnv.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Ninyia lvkodv vlvgo mindvto, “Pwknvyarnv gv darwk pvnvkv vnama no darwkmanv gubv miyoka.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>So si lvom go rito, okv vbvrikunamv um nyidomooku bv naakur chaatoku.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Pitar nyikrw kaanama lamrw palaku si ogugubvri vla mvngla doori lo, ho Kornelias gv vngmunam nyi mvnwng ngv Saimon gv naam am chintoku, okv bunu vdwv vjak agi peelv ho daknyato. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Bunu gokto okv tvvka nyato, “So si Saimon Pitar vnam nyen ako dopvre?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Pitar vjv gubv ninyigv nyikrw kaanama ogugubvri mvngla chindubv rito, Darwknv Dowv minto, “Tvvriato! soka ka nyi aom go<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aomgo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonvlo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kvvgonv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap akingonv lo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">anyigo. </char></note> nam makar kardu. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Vkvlvgabv gudung toku okv pvkwng bv ito, bunua lvkobv vngdubv mvngram mabvkv ngo bunua kanam la vngmu pvnv.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Vkvlvgabv Pitar itoku okv nyi vdwa minto, “Nonugv makar nam nyiv ngookv. Nonu ogu mvlwk pvnv?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>“Kiapten nyigam Kornelias ngonuam kanam pvnv,” bunu mirwksito. “Hv alvnv nyi ako Pwknvyarnv ninyia kumnvjonv go okv Jius nyi mvnwng ngv ninyia kaibv mvngdv nyadunv. Pwknvyarnv gv nyidogindung ako ninyia minto ninyigv naam lo nam goktokv vla, vkvlvgabv noogv minama ninyia tvvmu dubv.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Pitar nyi vdwa arwngbv goklwkto okv bunua ho ayu miyayala yupmuto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Logo nvngaku hv gwngrapsingrap tokula okv bunugv lvkobv vngtoku; okv mvngjwngnv meego Joppa lokvka ninyia lvkobv vngming gvvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Alu logo nvngaku hv Kaisaria lo vngchi toku, okaku ogolo Kornelias ninyia kaaria la, ninyigv agungaram vdwa lvkobv doobam la dooto kudw okv ajin vdwa ninyigv goknam dvdv nga lvkobv doobam toku. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Pitar arwngbv aatv ringa, Kornelias ninyia kaarwk sito, okv ninyigv lvpalo gupba la okv ninyigv kaagia guplwkto. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Vbvritola Pitar ninyia svdungto. Hv minto; “Dakrapto, Ngooka nyi ngvmabv.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Pitar Korneliasnyi gaam japmi sila hv naam arwng bv aatoku, ninyia hoka nyi achialvgo dopam dubv kaapato. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Hv bunua minto, “Nonu atubongv alvbv chinsu pvnvpv ho Jentail vdwa lvkobv kaarwk okv ribam mabvkv vla Jius bunugv ridungsingdung lo mindu. Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv nga kaatamdo ho yvvnyiv darwkmanv jeka okv kasingkanyak jeka ngo alvmakv vla mare. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Okv vkvlvgabv no vdwlo nyi kanamla ngo gvlo vngmuto, ngo oguguka ma vla mvngnam kamabv aapvnv. Ngo nam tvvkadu, vbvrikunamv, no ngo gvlo ogubv nyi kanam la vngmu pvnv?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Kornelias minto, “Soogv dw so vjak alu loum go vngro pvkua ho ngo atugv naam soka arium gv gunta aom baji lo kumdungla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kumdungla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yikla okv kumdungla. </char></note> doosuto. Dvminmabv nyi go vji yapung tojinv gvvtola ngoogv habolo dakto <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>okv minto: ‘Kornelias! Pwknvyarnv noogv kumnam am tvvpato okv noogv nyi am jinamrungnama kaapa duku. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Nyi go Joppa lo vngmuto ho ninyigv lvgabv aminv Saimon Pitar vnamgo. Hv Saimon apin mvnv, svmasa adarlo doonv gv naam lo nyen bv doopv.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Okv vkvlvgabv ngo vjakpigobv noogv lvgabv vngmu pvnvkv, okv no so alvrungbv aalwk jipv. Vjv ngonu mvnwng ngv Pwknvyarnv gv dooku si doodu, Ahtu ogugo ritokv vla nam mimpv kudw um minama tvvbv doyala doodunv.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar gv japnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Det 10:17</ref> </char>
    </note> Pitar japrap toku: “Vjv ngo mvngdw kunamv so si jvjv ngv Pwknvyarnv nyi mvnwng nga akin gubv mvngla ridunv. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Yvvdw ninyia kumnvjoonv ngv okv alvbv ridu singdunv vv ninyia turwk sunam gubv ridunv, hv ogolokv ogunv nyi haalung gubv rijeka. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Nonu chindu hv doina Israel nyi vdwlo jilwk kunama, mvnwng gv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv Alvnv yunying nga japji kunama. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Nonu chinyado Israel gv kvvdw mvnwng so kaibv dunamlamnam go rikunama, Galili lo riraptoku Jon gv baptisma gv lvgabv japjiro koching bv. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Nonu Najaret gv Jisunyi chinyado okv Pwknvyarnv ninyia oguaingbv Darwknv Dowv okv jwkrw nga jiku nama. Hv mooku mvnwng lo vngyik kartoku, alvnv rikarto okv Uyuvram gv arwnglo doonv mvnwng aka mvpu karto, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv ninyia lvkobv dooming gvvto. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Hv ogugo Israel gv kvvdw lo okv Jerusalem so ripvkudw ngonu mvnwng ngv ho mvnwng nga tvvriakaaria kunama japyariya yajikunv. Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyia daapo lo kali lokv sidukubv takki toku. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv ninyia alu loum koching lo sikunvnga turkur motoku okv ninyia kaapa modubv mvtoku, <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>nyi mvnwng nga kaatam ma, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv gv darlin pvvnam kaarianv mvngchik amwng, hv sipikula turkurro koching bv ninyigv lvkobv ngonu ninyia lvkobv dvbamtvngbam kunam ngv. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Okv hv ngonua yunying ngam nyi vdwlo japkar dubv kanamto okv Pwknvyarnv gv darlin kunam angv turnv okv sikunv vdwgv jwngyadaya yanv gubv. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Nyijwk mvnwng ngv ninyigv lvkwng lo japto, vbv minjito yvvdw ninyia mvngjwng dunv vv ninyigv amin jwkrw lokv vkv rimur am mvngnga jiriku.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jentail vdwv Darwknv Dowa paatoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Vdwlo Pitar gv japdung rilo, Darwknv Dowv ilwkjito mvnwng gvlo yvv ninyigv doina tvvla doonv vdwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Joppa lokv Pitarnyi lvkobv aanv Jius nyi mvngjwngnv vdwv Pwknvyarnv gv Jentail vdwaka Darwknv Dowa jilwk nama kaapatola lamrw pakunam. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Ogulvgavbolo bunu bunua akusubv japdubv okv Pwknvyarnv gv kainama hartv dubv tvvnyato. Pitar japrapto: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>“So nyi vdwsi Darwknv Dowa paapvku, ngonu gvka paakunam aingbv. Vbvrikunamv, nyigonv, bunua isi lo baptisma nama dubv mintor nyuji kunv?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Vkvlvgabv hv bunua Jisu Kristo gv amin bv baptisma naadubv mintoku. Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyia bunugv lvkobv alu lonyiloum go doomin gvdubv kooto.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Pitar gv Jerusalem gvrja lo minpa kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Apostol vdwv okv Judia mvnwng lokv kvvbi mvngjwngnv vdwv tvvpa nyatoku Jentail vdwvka Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar am laarwk suta pvku vla. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Vdwlo Pitar Jerusalem lo vngto kudw, yvvbunudw Jentail vdwa ayakmvua mvnglwknv vdwv Pitarnyi minjimio la minto, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>“No Jentail ayakmvu manv nyi vdwgv naam lo nyen gubv ripvi, okv no bunua lvkobv dvbamtvngbamdu ai!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Vkvlvgabv Pitar bunua atuk lokv oguaingbv rirap pvkudw ho mvnwng nga mimpa jitoku:<verse eid="ACT 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>“Vdwlo ngo Joppa gv pamtv lo kumla doori lo, Ngo nyikrwgo kaato. Nyidomooku tvlokv vji jvbor aingbv kaanv go atung tungpi am kvlum tola ogugo solu dubv ngo kaapato, okv ho vv ngo takbv olwkto. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Ngo arwngbv kaatar lwkla kaakunamv soonam okv somanam svnwngsvmin, piakarnvngv, mootum pvta vkv kaapato. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Vbvrikunamv ngo vlvgo nga mindubv tvvpato, ‘Gudungto, Pitar; mvkitvla okv dvto!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Vbvritola ngo minto, ‘Ahtu, vbv makv! yaboryachenv vmalo dvnam kasingkanyak nvngv ngoogv gaam lo vdwloka aakw mapvnv.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Nyidomooku tvlokv vlvgo lvkodv minto, ‘Pwknvyarnv gv darwk pvnvkv vnama ogu darwkmanv gubv mvngma bvka.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>So si lvom gubv rijito, okv anyunganya nga ogumvnwng nga nyidomooku bv chaakur gvvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Vbvrida sopikda nyi aom vv Kaisaria lokv ngo gvlo vngmunam vdwv ngo ogolo doopvdw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngo ogolo doopvdw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv kitap lo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngonu ogolo doopvdw. </char></note> oogv naam hoka vngchi toku. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Darwknv Dowv nga bunua lvkobv vnglaka mvngram mabvkv vla minto. Oogv mvngjwngnv nyi akvgo nga lvkobv Joppa gvngv Kaisaria lo vngming gvvto, okv ngonu mvnwng ngv Kornelias gv naam arwnglo aatoku. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Ninyi ngonua minjito ninyia oguaingbv nyidogindung angv ninyigv naam arwng lo dakdubv kaanama, ho ninyi minto, ‘Nyi go Saimon Pitarnyi hardubv Joppa bv vngmu tvka. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Hv nonua gaam japjire ho no okv noogv vpin mvnwng ngv ringnam am paariku.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Okv vdwlo ngo japrap kunamv, Darwknv Dowv bunu gvlo ilwk toku atuk lo ngonu gvlo aanam jvbvku. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Nyim 1:5</ref> </char></note> Vbvrikunamv ngo mvngpa toku ogugonyi Ahtu minpvdw: ‘Jon isi bv baptisma jidu, vbvritola nonuam Darwknv Dow lvkobv baptisma jire.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Si pvbwngvrwng dukunv vv Pwknvyarnv Jentail vdwa ngonua jwkrw jinam apiabv jipv vdwlo ngonu Ahtu Jisu Kristonyi mvngjwng tokudw; vbvrikunamv ngo yvvla, Pwknvyarnvnyi mvtor dubv ridunv!”<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Vdwlo bunu sum tvvto kudw, bunu miriminu kuma okv Pwknvyarnvnyi ombonyikv, vnya toku, “Vbvrikunamv Pwknvyarnv Jentail vdwaka mvngdin modukubv jito okv singmurimu dukubv alvnv alua lomu toku!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antiok gv Gvrja lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Nyim 8:1-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Stipinnyi vlwng orki rilo Jisunyi mvngjwngnv vdwa mvdwmvkunam lvgabv bunu mooku mookulo kiakkipak toku. Kvvgonv Jius mvngchik ka doina japjito Poenesia lobv, Saipras okv Antiok lobv vngto. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Vbvritola mvngjwngnv kvvbi vdwv, Saipras okv Sairene lokv nyiga vdwv, Antiok bv vngto okv doina Jentail<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jentail; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Grik-mindung ngv Jius </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Grik-mindung ngv nyi. </char></note> vdwlo japji toku, Ahtu Jisu gv Alvnv Yunying nga bunua ka minji toku. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Ahtu gv jwkrwv bunugv lvkobv dooto, okv nyi vdwv kaiyabv mvngjwng la twngtvya toku okv Ahtu gvlo aakur nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>So yunying ngv Jerusalem Gvrja lo vngchi toku, vkvlvgabv bunu Barnabasnyi Antiok bv vngmuto. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Vdwlo hv vngchi tokudw okv ninyia Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwa vdwgo boktalwkji kunama kaapa toku, hv mvngpu toku okv nyi vdwa ninyi tamsarto Ahtunyi haapok mvnwng lokv jvjvbv okv mvnglwkkaalwk bv rilaka vla minto. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barnabas alvnv nyi go, Darwknv Dow gvnv go okv mvngjwng nvgo, okv nyi meego Ahtu gvlo aagv jito.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Vbvrikunamv Barnabas Solnyi kaakar bv Tarsus lo vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Vdwlo hv ninyia kaapa kunamv, hv ninyia Antiok bv vnggv toku, okv anying nyinggo bv bunyi lvkobv Gvrja gv nyi vdwa kaarwk sito okv nyitwngtwngtv nvgo tamsar toku. Mvngjwngnv vdwa Kristan vla mintuminke bv minrap kongv Antiok lo.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Vbv riri hoka nyijwk meego Jerusalem lokv Antiok lo vnglwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Nyim 21:10</ref> </char></note> Bunugv lokv akonvgv aminv Agabas, Darwknv Dow gv jwkrw lokv dakrap danv kokwnglo riji nama mincho jila vbv minto achialvbv alvmanv dvmayarwng go sichingmooku so vngtv tvvdu vla minto. (Klaudius gv Dvbv bv ririlo vv aatoku.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Lvbwlaksu vdwv Judia lokv mvngjwngnv ajin vdwa vdwgo rila pvdw ridur dubv vla japmi sinyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Bunu sum ritoku, vbvrikunamv morko nga Barnabas okv Sol bunyigv laak lo jilwk la Gvrja gv nyigagatv vdwlo jidukubv.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kaiyayabv mvdwkmvku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>So lvkwng lo vbv ririlo hoka Dvbv Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dvbv Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Agrippa Ngo, Pilestine mvngwng gv rigvdogv nvngv.</char></note> gvrja nyi meegonyi mvdwkmvku rapto. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Hv Jemsnyi, Jon gv boru am rioksv lokv pakitoku. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Vdwlo hv vbvrinam si Jius vdwa alvbv mvngpu modu vla kaapa pvkudw hv Pitar nyika naatungto. (Svbv rikuv vpap lwkmabv vtwng dvdw pumja alu lo). <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mog 12:1-27</ref> </char></note> Pitarnyi naatungro koching bv patwk lo tumlwk toku, hoka ninyia sipai nyitwng api lokv akinakin sakbv naalinla ninyia apigo dagv yamuto. Herodnyi vngbo dvmin gv kochinglo kvba vdwgv kaakulo mvtungmvre dubv vla rungto. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Vkvlvgabv Pitarnyi patwk lo tumlwk pvto, vbvritola gvrja lo nyi vdwv ninyigvbv Pwknvyarnvnyi dinchi rungbv kumji nyato.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Patwk lokv Lingkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Pitarnyi ho ayu Herod gv nyi vdwgvlo boolin madv bv, Pitar dakrianv anyi gv pingkolo yupla dooto. Ninyia jaako sonyi gonv leepvto, okv okaku dakrianv vdwv patwk agi lo dakria nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Dvminmabv Ahtu gv nyidogindung ako hoka daktoku, okv patwk arwnglo loung go unglinto. Pitar gv Gorbwng lo nyidogindung lakpvnamv lamrwpato, ninyia mvu toku, okv minto, “Gudungto! baapubvkv!” Pitar gv laak lokv vjakpigobv rvngja ngv taasokto. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Vbvrikunamv nyidogindung ngv minto, “Noogv tainhokpo nga hukto kuka okv noogv lvkiama gvvto.” Pitar vbv ritoku, okv nyidogindung ngv minto, “Noogv pakria nga koorwkto okv nga lvkobv aato.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Pitar oguka chimabv, patwk arwng lokv agum bv, ninyia vngming gvvtoku, ogubv rikujvka, vbv nyidogindung gv rinam yangv jvjv guya; vla hv mvngtoku ninyi nyikrwgo kaapv nvgobvri vla. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Bunu dakria la dakcho konga vngboto okv anyi nvngaka, okv vngnyung nga pamtv bv vngjiku riokdar agi lo aatoku. Agiv bunugv lvgabv kokda sila dooto, okv bunu agum bv vnglintoku. Bunu pamtv gv ara bv ilwkla vngto, okv nyidogindung ngv Vjakgobv Pitarnyi vngyu toku.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar ninyigv ogugo ripvdw mvngdw tola, okv minto, “Ngo svjv chimpvku so si jvjv gurung! Ahtu ninyigv nyidogindung nga kanam tola nga Herod gv jwkrw lokv okv Jius nyi vdwgv vbvrijeyiku nvpv vla mvngmin nam mvnwng loka ringlin pvku.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Ninyigv svbv riyi so himakaya sudubv, hv Jon mark gv anv Meri gv naam lo vngtoku, hoka nyi vdwv achialv dookum la okv kumla doonyato. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Pitar hoka agi am takdinto, okv nyimvpaknv aminv Roda vnam ako um mirwk sudubv aatoku. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Hv Pitar gv gaama tvvchinto okv himpu yalaku agiya koko mabv ninyi arwngbv jukkur lwktoku, okv Pitar agum vv dakpv vla arwnglo gokyak pato. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Bunu ninyia minto, “No suru pvnvgo!” Vbvritola hv si jvjv ngvkv vla mimbwng jito. Vkvlvgabv bunu mirwksito, “So si ninyigv nyidogindung go.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Vbv ridung rilo Pitar takdin dvla doodvto. Anyungnga bunu agiya kokko jitoku, okv vdwlo bunu ninyia kaapa namgola, bunu lamnya toku. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Pitar ninyigv laakv lakbvla bunua choibvkv vla mintoku, okv hv bunua oguaingbv Ahtu ninyia patwk lokv linggv kunam am mimbwk la mimpa jitoku. “Sum Jems okv mvngjwngnv dvdvlo mimpa laka,” hv minto; vbvrikunamv ninyia vngyu toku okv mooku kvvbilo vngtoku.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Vdwlo arukamchi kubvdw, hoka dakria kaarianv vdwgv pingkolo abwk kuma bv ritoku—Pitarnyi ogugo ripv nvgobvri? <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herod Pitarnyi makar dubv orto jito, vbvritola bunu ninyia mapa kuma toku. Vkvlvgabv hv dakriakarianv vdwa tvukapak tokula okv bunua mvki dvkubv orto jitoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">So kochingbv, Herod Judia nga vngyula okv Kaisaria lo apogo dootoku.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herod gv Sikunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Herod Tayar okv Sidon gv nyi vdwa achialv bv haachi toku, vkvlvgabv bunu lvkin gubv ritola ninyia kaatv bv vngtoku. Atuk chochok bv dvbvkarv nga doogvdakgv yanv nyi, Blastasnyi bunu mindin chootoku, bunua ninyia kaadur kodubv vla. Vbvrikunamv bunu Herod gv dokubv vngto okv sarsopoyonam lvgabv ninyia tvvkato, ogulvgavbolo bunugv mooku ngv ambinamor am dvbv gv diringmooku lokv jilwk doonv.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Darlinnam alu gulo Herod ninyigv Dvbv vji jvtv laklwk ka gvvto, ninyigv dvbvdotung kolo doolwk toku okv nyi vdwa kvba gaam go japto. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Bunu gokla minto, “So si nyi gv japnam bv rima, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv gv japnam bv rido!.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Vjakgobv Ahtu gv nyidogindung ngv Herodnyi svtap pala seluto, ogulvgavbolo hv Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngdv jimato. Ninyia tapumv chetoku okv sitoku.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Vbvriro kochingbv Pwknvyarnv gv gaamv tvvsik yaya toku okv kaiyayabv ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnabas okv Sol bunyi gv minkarrikar svnga rinya toku, okv bunyi Jerusalem lokv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Lokv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonvlo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gvlo. </char></note> aakur laku, Jon Mark ninyia naalaila bunyi gv lvkobv vnggv toku.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Barnabas okv Sol bunyia darlinla vngmukunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Antiok gv gvrja hoka ka nyijwk vdwv okv tamsarnv vdwv meego doonyato: Barnabas, Saimeon (Yakianv vla minto), Lusias (Sairene lokv), Manaen (Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas, Galili gv rigvdonv Lk 3:1 lo kaato. </char></note> gobunor gv lvkobv sochakunam), okv Sol. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Bunu Ahtu gv kanam nama rilapala okv dvmatvngma bv yikdungla doori lo, bunua Darwknv Dowv minto, “Ngo gvbv Barnabas la Sol bunyia akusubv vngmuto, ngoogv gokla kanam nama bunua rimudubv.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Bunu dvmatvngma bv yikdungto okv kumtoku, bunugv laakv bunua lakpv tola okv bunua vngmu toku.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saipraslo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Darwknv Dow gv kanam la vngmukunam lokv, Barnabas okv Sol Seleukia lo vngtoku okv svpwbv dula Saipras bokpin lo vnglwkto. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Vdwlo bunu Salamis hoka vngchi kunamv, bunu Pwknvyarnv gv doina Jius kumkunaamlo japji toku. Bunu Jon Marknyi bunugv riku lo rigvto ridur riadubv.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Bunu bokpin mvnwng nga vngbola Papos lo vnglwkto, hoka bunu tagohinv ako aminv Bar-Jisu, vnamgo paami sito, hv Jius nyi go nyijwk akobv minsunv. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Hv bokpin gv gobunor gv ajin bv rito, Sergius Paulusnyi chinvpanv gubv rito. Gobunor angv Barnabas nyila Solnyi vkvgvlo gokcho lwkto ogulvgavbolo ninyia Pwknvyarnv gv doina tvvnwngto. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Vbvritola tagohinv Elimas (ho vv Grik amin minam) bunu mvnwng am kaanwng mabv rito rinyingriruto, ninyi Gobunornyi mvngjwng moma dubv rikwto. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Vbvrikunamv Sol— nyika Paul vla chinya kunam—Darwknv Dowv aakunamv; hv tagohinv nga kaagap chinchila kaato <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>okv minto, “No uyu gv kuunyilo! No alvnv ogumvnwng gv nyirunyimak kv. No alvmabv gwngnamrungnam am gvnv okv no Ahtu gv jvjv nga mvvnam gubv rimu dubv lokia rikwnv! <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Ahtu gv laakv no gvlo vjak laklure; no nyikching riku okv alu gv loung nga meego kaapa mabv ririku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Vjakgobv Elimas gv nyiklo kanv ngv jing mvlwkto, okv ninyi vngdubv vngtvto nyigonv ninyigv laak am gakbwng tvla vnggv labv vla riakarto. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Vdwlo gobunor angv um kaapv kudw hv mvngjwng toku; Ahtu gv lvgabv tamsarnama tvvla hv kairungbv lamngapatoku.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pisidia gv Antiok lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Paul okv ninyigv ajin mvnwng ngv Papos lokv Pampilia pamtv bv Parga lo svpw bv raplwk toku, hoka Jon Mark bunua kayupikula Jerusalem bv vngkur toku. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Bunu Parga lokv vngraptoku okv Pisidia gv Antiok lo vngchi toku, okv bunu Jius doonu alulo kumkunaam arwng aalaku okv dootung nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Moses gv Pvbv nga okv nyijwk vdwgv lvkpv nama um puri riro kochingso, Jius kumkunaam gv nyigam vdwv bunua gaam go milwkto: “Ajin vdwv, nonu nyi vdwa doin tamsarkinu gaam go doodu bolo mintokv vla ngonu mvngdu.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Paul dakrab dvla, ninyigv laakv ijodvla, okv minrap toku:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Israel ajin vdwa okv soka Jentail vdwa yvv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumdunv: nga tvvriato! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Mog 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Mog 12:51</ref> </char></note> Israel nyi vdwgv Pwknvyarnv ngonugv abuapa vdwa dartoku okv nyi vdwa kainv mooku gubv mvtoku Ijipt lo bunugv nyen pakbubv rila doori lo. Pwknvyarnv gv kainv jwkrw lokv bunua Ijipt loka agum naalin toku, <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Num 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Det 1:31</ref> </char></note> okv anying champi gubv bunua chokrimookulo Hv saktv toku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hv saktv toku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hv laachumlaila ridu. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Det 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Js 14:1</ref> </char></note> Pwknvyarnv Kanaan gwngda lo diringmooku kanwgo mvyakmvchak tvla okv ninyigv nyi vdwa mookuatu bv mvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sam 3:20</ref> </char></note> So mvnwng si anying lvngpi gula chamngu gobv ritoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Soogv kochingso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">So mvnwng gv Kitap si 450 anying donv. Soogv kochingso; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kvvgonv anying chamngu kochinglo.</char></note> ninyi bunua nyi kiyahakya nvgobv jitoku Samuel nyijwk gv dootv madvbv. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Sam 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">1Sam 10:21</ref> </char></note> Okv vdwlo bunu dvbv lo ako jibvkv vla koonamv, Pwknvyarnv bunua Binjamin haalung lokv Kis gv kuunyilo Solnyi, bunugv dvbv bv anying champi gubv singmuto. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1Sam 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">1Sam 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Miri 89:20</ref> </char></note> Kochingso ninyia rimu kuma namv, Pwknvyarnv Dabidnyi bunugv dvbv bv mvtoku. So si ogugonyi Pwknvyarnv ninyia minamv: ‘Ngo paapvku Jesse gv kuunyilo Dabid ngoogv haang lo mvnglwknam nyi gobv rido, ngo ogugo mvngpvdw ninyia um mvnwng nga riji nvgobv riyinvpv.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>O Jisu, Dabid gv husi lokv, yvvnyi Pwknvyarnv Israel nyi vdwgv ringlinnv gubv, ninyia mvtoku ninyigv milvla mimpv nam lokv. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Lk 3:3</ref> </char></note> Jisu ninyigv ridung nga ritam madvbv, Jon Israel gv nyi mvnwng nga japkar choto ho nonugv rimur lokv nonu lintokv okv baptisma laato kukv vla. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mt 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mk 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Lk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Jn 1:27</ref> </char></note> Okv Jon ninyigv risvvngsv nga rinya svlv bv rire hoka, hv nyi vdwa minto, ‘Nonuno nga yvv vla mvngdu? Nonugv kaaria la doonam angv vv makv. Vbvritola tvvriato! Hv ngoogv koching lo aadungdu, okv ngo vbv alvka yama ninyigv lvkiam ngaka ninyigv lvchu loka pilin dubvka rinyuma.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>“Israel gv ngoogv ajin vdw, Abraham gv husi vdwa, okv soka Jentail mvnwng ngv yvv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumdudw: soogv turnam gv doin sum ngonugv lvgabv jilwk jipvnv! <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Jerusalem lo doonv nyi vdwv okv bunua rigvnv vdwvka ho Jisunyi ringnvbaanv ngvkv vla chimato, Doonu alu lokia nyijwk vdwgv gaam ngaka puri rilin jinam aka chinv kaama. Vjvlodvbv Jisunyi miyakaya tola bunu nyijwk vdwgv gaam yanga jvjvbv limuyato. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mt 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13">Mk 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Lk 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Jn 19:15</ref> </char></note> Okv bunu ninyia mvki dubv gaam mimbwk svgo dooma jvka, bunu Pilatnyi ninyia mvkito vla kooto. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref> </char></note> Okv kochingso bunu ogumvnwng nga ritoku ho Darwknv kitap lo ninyigv lvkwng lo minam nga, bunu ninyia daapo gvnga jolu toku okv ninyia nyibung arwngbv lwktoku. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv ninyia sikunvnga turkur motoku, <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Nyim 1:3</ref> </char></note> okv alu aw gobv yvvbunu ninyigv lvkobv Galili lokv Jerusalem bv vngming gvnv nga kaapa kotoku. Bunu mvnwng ngv sijv Israel nyi vdwgvbv ninyigv lvgabv ririamiria nvgu bv rinya dukunv. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Miri 2:7</ref> </char></note>Okv ngonu mvnwng ngv sika nonu gvbv alvnv yunying nga bvnglwk jitv dunv: Pwknvyarnv ogugo ngonugv abuapa vdwa minpvnam nga hv ritv hinvkv, hv vjakka ngonu gvbvka um rilin jipvku, yvvbunudw bunugv husi bv ripvkudw, Jisunyi sikunvnga singdu kubv mvto kula. Mirimimpak lo baanyi nvnv lo minam jvbv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:32-33">‘No ngoogv kuunyilo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:32-33">silu ngo noogv Abu bv riduku.’<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Aij 55:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Okv so si Pwknvyarnv ninyia sinam lokv turkur mooku nambv minto, vdwloka nyibung arwng lo yalwk mabvka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ngo nonuam Dabidnyi milvnam darwknv okv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">jvjvrungbv boktalwkjire.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Miri 16:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Svbvka hv borgu nvlo mindu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘No noogv jwkjwkvrwk rungnv pakbu nga nyibung arwnglo yaamin momare.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Dabid Pwknvyarnv gv mvngnama ninyigv ridwlo ritoku, okv vbvrikunamv hv sitoku, abuapa vdwgv lvkobv sima ritoku, okv ninyigv ayakv nyibunglo yaalwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Vbvritola Pwknvyarnv gv sikunvnga turkur mookunam angv gvlo so si riku mato. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39"/>Ngonu nonua chinmu nvpv mvngdu ngoogv Israel ajin vdwa, Jisu gv lokv rimur vdwa mvngnga jikunam gv doina nonua japji toku; Moses gv Pvbv jinam lokv nonua rimur loka topunyuma nama topu jiriku yvvdw ninyia mvngjwng dukunv. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Vbvrikunamv, hima sulakv ogulvgavbolo nyijwk vdwgv minamv nonu gvlo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonv doomadu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nonu gvlo.</char></note> rilwk madubv:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb 1:5</ref> </char>
    </note> ‘Kaatoka, nonu nyarjikaunv vdwv! Lamrwpalaka okv silakuka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ngo silu ogugo ridung dunv si vkvnv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ogugo nonu mvngjwng mare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">vdwlo nyigonv nonua alvbv mintam jida jvka!’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Paul la okv Barnabas bunyi Jius kumkunaam lokv lindung rilo, nyi vdwv bunua lvko aakur dvla aainvgv bunugv Doonu alu lo okv bunua soogv lvgabv sum kaiyabv minjilabv vla mintoku. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Kochingso nyi vdwgv kvbadopam lokv vngpinvngyin rikulo, Paul la Barnabas bunyi gv kochingbv Jius okv Jentail Judaism lo aalwkla rikunv vdw vkv achialv bv vngming gvvto. Apostol vdwv bunua japtoku okv Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya lo alvbv doobwng runglaka vla mintvmiru toku.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Bunugv Doonu alu akonvnga banggu gv nyichar mvnwng ngv Ahtu gv gaam nga tvvbv aakum nyato. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Vdwlo Jius vdwv nyipam am kaapv kudw, bunu mvnwng ngv kaakbriak nyato; Paul gv japnama bunu ridwkrikuto okv ninyia nyarjitari toku. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Vbvritola Paul la Barnabas bunyi busukano kaakumabv japrapto: “Pwknvyarnv gv gaama ho nonu gvlo japcho jidubv ripvkv. Vbvritola nonu um toasula okv turbwngnv singnama paanyu manv gubv mvngsu dvnv bolo ngonu nonua kayupikula Jentail nyi vdwlo vngriku. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Aij 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref> </char></note> So si Ahtu ngonua gamki pvjinamv:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Ngo nonua Jentail vdwgv lvgabv loung gubv mvpvnv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ogulvgavbolo nyiamooku gv nyi vdwv turnama paadu kubv.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Vdwlo Jentail vdwv sum tvvpa kunam gula, bunu mvnwng ngv himpu pulaku okv Ahtu gv doina umbonyikv mvngtoku; okv yvvbunu ninyia turbwngnv singnam lo darlin pvkudw bunu mvngjwng nvgobv ritoku.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Ahtu gv gaamv ho mooku mvnwng lo dupwng kartoku. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Vbvritola Jius vdwv pamtv gv Jius nyiga vdwa mivrmimbam la jokkumrikum motoku okv Jentail anvnyimv kaibv rigvnv vdwv yvv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumnvjonv vdwv. Bunu Paul okv Barnabas bunyia yalungyachung durab toku okv bunugv mooku loka bunua charlin toku. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mt 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mk 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Lk 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref> </char></note> Apostol vdwv bunua rinyingriru dunv vla bunugv lvchu gv pvmar am mvkak supi kula bunu Ikonium mooku bv vnglintoku. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Antiok lo doonyabu mvngjwngnv mvnwng lo Darwknv Dow lokv okv achialvbv himpu nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ikonium lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Ikonium loka vbvdvdv bv rito: Paul la Barnabas bunyiv Jius vdwgv kumkunaamlo vngto okv vbv japlaku Jius vla Jentail nyi vdwa achialvgo mvngjwng nvgobv rimutoku. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Vbvritola Jius mvngjwng manv nyi vdwv Jentail nyi vdwa meerla okv mvngjwngnv vdwa rinyingriru moto. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Apostol vdwv hoka alu achialv gubv dootoku, Ahtu gv lvgabv busukano mabv japtoku, bunugv ninyigv anyuaya namgv doinv jvjv rungdo vla kaamu dubv bunu jwkrw lokv achialvgo kaasartabo okv lamrwpadubv rila kaatamto. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Pamtv gv nyi vdwv apinain sitoku: meegonv Jius vdwgvbv, kvvgonv Apostol vdw gvbvku.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Vbvrikunamv Jentail nyi meego okv Jius vdwv bunugv rigvnv vdwa lvkobv, Apostol vdwa vlwng orla alvmabv ridubv minbam sitoku. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Vdwlo Apostol vdwv um tvvpa namgola, bunu Listra okv Darbe okv dokardovr mooku Likaonia pamtv vdwlo kelwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Hoka bunu Alvnv Yunying nga japtoku.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Listra okv Darbe lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Listra lo nyi ako dooto vv bvnglin lokv lvpikto okv vdwloka vngkar nyumabv rito. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Hv hoka doya tola okv Paul gv gaama tvvriato. Paul kaatoku hvkvgv mvngjwng kunam am okv poya nyola suku nama, vkvlvgabv hv ninyia kaagap lalatoku. <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>Okv gaam gamtv bv goktoku, “Noogv lvdubv dakdin chinchila daktokv!” Nyi angv pokdinpokrinla okv vngchar vngyarla vngrab toku. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Vdwlo nyi nyipam vv Paul ogugo ripvkudw um kaato kula, bunu atugv Likaonia gaam bv bunu gokrap toku, “Pwknvyarnv ngv nyi jvbv ritokula okv ngonu gvlo ipvku!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Bunu Barnabasnyi Jeus gobv amin minto okv Paulnyi Harmes gobv minya toku, ogulvgavbolo hv japlaknv kaiyachok kunv go. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Jeus Pwknvyarnv gv nyibu go pwknvyarnvnaamv banggu agum gv adar hoka dooto, ninyila nyipam vdwv svv vvpu okv apungana vkv agi hoka bvnglwkto Apostol vdwa erinpeeji dubv vla mvngnyato.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Bunugv ritv nama Barnabas okv Paul bunyiv tvvpa namgola, bunyi vji am putak pasuto okv nyitwng pingko gv arwng lo juklwkla, gokto, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Mog 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Miri 146:6</ref> </char></note> “Nonuno ogubv svbv rinya dunv? Ngonu atubongv ka nonuno aingbv nyi vmwng mabv! Ngonu mvnwng ngv sukaka Alvnv Yunying nga, nonuam mimpa dubv doodunv Pwknvyarnv yvvdw nyidomookua, sichingmookua, svmasa nga, okv ogugo dopvkudw Pwknvyarnv gvlo svkvnv ogu arv kamanv ridungsingdung loka mvngdin modukubv vla. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Vngro ikunv atuk lo hv nyi mvnwng nga bunugv mvngbv vngkarchaakar moto. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Vbvritola ninyigv alvbv rijinam lokv hv kaatam sudunv, hv nyidomooku tologv nyido odw lo omudu okv aliami, aamtami nga nyindw lo nyimu dunv; hv nonua dvnamtvngnam nga jila haapok am mvngpu sakpu la rimudu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Apostol vdwv so svkvnv gaam vkv milaku bunua raaibv ho bunyia erinpeeji tvku loka mintor toku.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Jius nyi meego Pisidia gv Antiok lokv okv Ikonium lokv aatoku; bunu nyipam nga miyayala bunu gvlo minkiam lwkto, Paulnyi vlwng ngv ortoku okv ninyi sipvkudw mvngnyato, ninyi banggu gvnga svvlin toku. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Vbvritola ninyia mvngjwngnv vdwv sooyum kunam ngv, hv gudung toku okv banggu arwngbv vngkur toku. Logo nvnga hv la Barnabas Darbe bv vngtoku.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sairia aragv Antiok lo vngkurkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Paul okv Barnabas Alvnv Yunying nga Darbe lo japji toku okv achialv nyi vkv mvngjwng motoku. Vbvrikunamv bunu Listra bv, Ikonium bv, okv Pisidia gv Antiok lo vngkur nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Bunu mvngjwngnv vdwa gwlwk bvkv okv alvbv mvngjwng nyalakv vla bunua tamsarto. “Ngonu Pwknvyarnv gv Karvlo aapvnam lvgabv ngonu atuklo achialv bv hirukaya hirungre.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Gvrja lokv nyigagatv vdw akinsago bunu laalinla rigv modubv parlwk toku um yigla kumla doogvrila Ahtu gvlo kobik lwkji toku, okv yvvnyi bunu mvngjwng nyapvkudw.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Pisidia gv mooku nga vngnyaro koching bv, bunu Pampilia lo aatoku. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Bunu Parga hoka doina japji pikula okv vbvrikunamv Attalia bv vngtoku, <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>okv hoka gvngv bunu svpwbv Antiok lo vngkur toku, ho mookuv bunua kvvlo Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya lvgabv kudungkua nga vjakgv ripwngrinya kunam anga kaaduridubv tulwk kongv.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Vdwlo bunu Antiok lo vngchi tokudw, bunu gvrja gv nyi vdwa lvkobv gokum nyatola okv bunugv lvkobv Pwknvyarnv gv rinam mvnwng nga okv oguaingbv Jentail nyi vdwa mvngjwng dukubv hv lamtv nga mvkok jiku nama bunuv mintam jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Okv bunu mvngjwngnv vdwgv lvkobv hoka apo go doomin gvvtoku.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem lo dopam Dookunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leb 12:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Nyi meegonv Judia lokv Antiok lo aanya toku okv mvngjwngnv vdwa tamsar sarab toku, “Nonu Moses gv Pvbv aingbv ayakmvu sudubv rinya mabolo nonuv ringnama paamare.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Paul okv Barnabas bunyi so gv lvgabv bunua lvkobv achialvbv larmi sunya toku, vkvlvgabv Paul okv Barnabas okv Antiok gv nyi meegonv Jerusalem lo vngla okv Apostol vdwa okv nyigagatv vdwgv lvkobv soogv raagv dvnam sum kaarung svgo vla japmi sunya toku.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Gvrja lokv bunua kanam toku bunuv lamtv lo vngdungto; okv bunu vbv Poenesia okv Samaria bv vngpik nyato, bunua oguaingbv Jentail vdwv Pwknvyarnv gvlo aadu kudw um mimpa kartoku; so yunying ngv mvngjwngnv vdwlo gwlwk jinamv mvnwng ngv achialvbv himpu nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Vdwlo bunu Jerusalem lo vngchi tokudw, bunua gvrja vdwv alvbv naarwk sinyatoku, Apostol vdwa, okv nyigagatv vdwa, Paul la Barnabas bunyi Pwknvyarnv oguaingbv bunyi am rinv la ripvkudw um japji toku. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Vbvritola Parisis apam lokv mvngjwngnv meegonv dakto la okv minto, “Jentail vdwv ayakmvu rirungtoka okv Moses gv Pvbv nga tvvdubv mintoka.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Apostol vdwv okv nyigagatv vdwv so tvvka nam um alv bvju vla kaarwk sunyato. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Nyim 10:1-43</ref> </char></note> Achialvbv raakwng minsuro kochingbv Pitar dakrap la minto, “Ngoogv ajin vdwv, nonu chinyado kvvlo gvngv Pwknvyarnv nga nonugv pingko loka goklinto Jentail nyi vdwgvlo Alvnv Yunying nga japji dubv, vkvlvgabv ho bunu tvvria tvla okv mvngjwng dubv. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Nyim 10:44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">Nyim 2:4</ref> </char></note> Okv Pwknvyarnv yvvdw nyichar mvnwng gv mvngnam saknama chinv, ngonua rinam aingbv Jentail nyi vdwaka Darwknv Dowa ninyigv jinama kaatam jito. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Hv ngonua okv bunua pingkolo yvvnyika akusubv mvngnam kaama; hv bunugv rimur am mvngnga jipvku ogulvgavbolo bunuka mvngjwngto. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Vbvrikunamv, vjak nonu ogulvgabv mvngjwngnv vdwgv koching lo vge nga tulwk tola Pwknvyarnvnyi ingka dunv vmalo ngonugv abuapa ngvka malo ngonu mvnwng vka um baknyure? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Vv makv! Ngonu mvngjwngnam lvgabv okv Ahtu Jisu gv anyuaya ngv ringpv kunv, vbvching bunu nyika rdunv.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Nyitwng dopam mvnwng ngv Barnabas okv Paul bunyi gvlo Pwknvyarnv gv Jentail nyi vdwlo lamrwpadubv okv kaasartabo dubv rinam am bunyi gv mimpa jiku nama tvvriala choibv doonyato. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Vdwlo bunu japnya kunam gola, Jems japrapto: “Ngoogv ajin vdwa, nga tvriato! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Saimon vjv mimbwk jigv ibv oguaingbv Pwknvyarnv Jentail nyi vdwa ninyigv chigudabia nga kaatam kunama okv bunua ninyigv nyigvbv laatulake bv naarwk suku nama. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Nyijwk vdwgv gaam vdwv so sum lvkobv tulwk minggvto. Kitap lo vbv mindu,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amo 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 9:12">12</ref> </char>
    </note>‘Ahtu minto, So kochingbv ngo akur riku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">okv Dabid gv karv nga lvkodv laakumlaapa riku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ngo darmwk kunama um mvdin rikunv</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">okv lvkodv um gwlwk dukubv mvdin riku.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Okv vkvlvgabv nyi mvnwng ngv ngo gvlo aariku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Jentail nyi mvnwng vka yvv bunua ngo atubogv bv mvngla gokku nam vdwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Vkvlvgabv vbvching Ahtu minto, yvvdw sum krimklu lokv chimu dukubv mvkunv.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>“So si ngoogv mvngnamv,” Jems japdungto, ho ngonu mvnwng ngv Pwknvyarnv gvlo aakur kunv “Jentail vdwa ridwkriku jimabv. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Mog 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Leb 18:6-23</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Leb 17:10-16</ref> </char></note> Vmabvya, ngonuya bunua siti go lvkto kula mimpa lajuka darwkmanv ogugoka dvma bvkv ogulvgavbolo ho vv morti lo jilwknamv; bunua yoomur minsu mabvka; okv svnwngsvmin hoksar nama vmalo oyi am dvma bvkv vla miya lajukv vla minto <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Moses gv pvbv nga kvvlo lokv Jius kumkunaamlo doonu aludwkibv puri rijikito okv ninyigv gaam nga banggu mvnwnglo japjito.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jentail mvngjwngnv vdwa siti jikunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Vbvrikunamv Apostol vdwvla okv nyigagatv vdwv, Pwknvyarnv gv nyi mvnwng ngv doodum toku, bunugv ajin lokv darlin gvrikula Paul okv Barnabas gv vngkulo Antiok bv vngmu dubv mintoku. Vbvrikunamv mvngjwngnv vdwgv mvngdv kunam nyi anyigo Barnabas vnam Judas nyila Silasnyi darlin toku. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Okv bunua siti meego lvkto kula bunua lvkobv vngmu toku:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Ngonu, Apostol okv nyigagatv vdwv, nonugv abwngboru, Jentail doonv Sairia, okv Silisia gv Antiok lo rinyabu vdwa kumrwk sidunv. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Ngonugv apam lokv nyi meegonv ngonua vbvkv vla mingkuriku mabv vngla nonua mindwkmingku pvkv vla ngonu tvvpa pvku. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Okv vkvlvgabv ngonu mvnwng ngv doodum toku okv nyi meego darlin laku nonu gvlo vngmu dukubv vla tulwk pvkunv bunu ngonugv ajin Paul okv Barnabas bunyia lvkobv vngriku, <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>yvvbunudw atugv singdung nga mvngmabv Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv kudungkua lvgabv mvngla rinvgo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Ngonu nonu gvlo vngmure, vbvrikunamv, Judas okv Silas bunyi nonua nyidum bv ngonugv lvknam so apia bv mimpa jire. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Darwknv Dow vla okv ngonu tulwk minsu pvnv so gv ridung aba so gv lvvyalo nonu gvlo oguaingbv adwkaku go lvkmare vla: <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Morti lo erinpeelwknam dvnama dvma bvka, oyi dvma bvka; svnwngsvmin hoksar nama dvma bvka; okv nonu atubongv yoomur nyama bvka. Nonu so vdw sum rimabv ribamdobam bolo alvre. Ngonugv ayanam mvnglwk lvkobv doming gvvre.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Gingdung mvnwng ngv vngnya toku okv Antiok lo vngchi nyalaku, hoka bunu mvngjwngnv apam mvnwng ngv dookum tokula okv bunua siti nga jinya toku. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Nyitwng ngv siti nga purila, tamsar doin nga puri ripa tokula, bunu mvnwng ngv himpu punya toku. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Judas okv Silas, bunu atubongvka nyijwk go, bunugv lvkobv mvngchigo japnya la doonyato, bunua mintvmiru jito okv vngdwng mooto. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Hoka meego doopi kula koching nga, bunu mvnwng ngv mvngjwngnv lvkobv sarsopoyo pikula okv mvngjwngnv vdwv bunua kanam nvgv dokubv vngkur motoku. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Vbvritola Silas hokaku doodu kubv mvngtoku. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonv verse 34 nga lvkwngdu; </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vbvritola Silas hokaku doodu kubv mvngtoku. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Paul okv Barnabas apogo Antiok lo dootoku, okv bunugv lvkobv nyi meegonyi tamsar nyala okv Ahtu gv gaam nga japnyato.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul okv Barnabas anyi gv vngpinsunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Meego nvgv dw kochingso Paul Barnabasnyi minto, “Kvlai ngonu vngkur lakuju ogolo ngonu Ahtu gv gaam nga banggu mvnwnglo ngonugv mvngjwngnv vdwa japji kunam nga kaakar lakuju, okv kvlai ngonu bunu ogu ripvkudw kaanya lakuju.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnabas Jon Marknyi bunua lvkobv vnggv dubv mvngkato, <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Nyim 13:13</ref> </char></note> vbvrinamv Paulnyi vnggv dubv um mvngka mato, vkvlvgabv ninyia bunugv risv nga lvkobv rinya gvla doomin gvvmado, vbvritola bunua Pampilia lo topak pikula okv vngkur toku. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Hokaku achialvbv larkwng minsu pikula, okv Barnabas Marknyi svpw lokv Saipras bv vnggv toku, <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>hoka Paul Silasnyi gaktoku, okv vnglintoku, mvngjwngnv vdwv Ahtu gv anyuaya nga alv bvkv hvming gvvtoku. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Hv Sairia bvla Silisia bv vngpik kunam, Gvrja vdwa gwlwk ha jitoku.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Timoti Paul okv Silas bunyia lvkobv vngkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Paul Vngtoku Darbe okv Listra lo, ogolo kristan amin Timoti vnamgo doopvdw. Ninyigv anv ka kristan go, Jius gvgo, vbvritola ninyigv abuv Grik go. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Listra okv Ikonium lokv mvngjwngnv mvnwng ngv Timotinyi alv nvgo vla japnya toku. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Paul ninyigv lvkobv Timotinyi vnggv nwngto, vkvlvgabv hv ninyia ayakmvuto. Vkvlvgabv hv ritoku ho mooku gv doonv Jius mvnwng ngv Timoti gv abuv Grik vkv vla chintoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Bunu banggua vngpikla vngrilo, Jerusalem gv Apostol vdwa okv nyigagatv vdwgv pvbv mimpv nama tvvdu ridubv, bunu mvngjwngnv vdwlo japying jito okv ho minam am bunua ridubv mintoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Vkvlvgabv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo gwlwk alvbv mvngjwng toku okv aludwkibv twngtv yaya toku.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Troas lo: Paul gv nyikrw kaanam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Bunu vngraptoku Prigia okv Galatia gv mooku lo ogulvgavbolo Darwknv Dowv bunua Asia mooku lo doina bunua mimu matoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Bunu vdwlo Maisia gv launglo vngchi pvkudw, bunu gwngkw nyato Bitinya mooku lo vngdubv, vbvritola Jisu gv Dowv bunua vngmumato. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu Maisia takbv vngtoku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">takbv vngtoku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">takbv vngbola vngtoku. </char></note> okv Troas lo vnglwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Ho ayu Paul nyikrwgo kaato ninyia Mesedonia ngv dakto la okv ninyia kodwkrwk la kodubv kaato, “Mesedonia lo aala okv ngonua ringla bvkv vla!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Paul so nyikrwa kaanam gola, ngonu mvngrap toku Mesedonia bv vngdu kubv, ogulvgavbolo ngonu Mvngtoku Pwknvyarnv ngonua goklin pvkunv alvnv yunying nga Mesedonia gv nyi vdwa minji dokubv.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilippi lo: Laidia gv mvngdin kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Ngonu Troas lokv svpw gvngv vnglin lakula okv sidakala bv vngdavngra la Samotras lo vngpikla, okv logo nvnga Neapolis lo vngchito. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Ngonu ho mooku gvngv Pilippi lo aalwk toku, ho pamtv vv Mesedonia gv mvtumvke distrik akobv rito;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ho pamtv v Mesedonia gv mvtumvke distrik akobv rito; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonvlo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mesedonia gv distrik rigvdogvnv kainv pamtv akobv rito, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mesedonia aralo ho districk angv kainv rigvdogvnv pamtv akobv rito. </char></note> so si ka Roman nyi vdwgv doolwkku bvka ritoku. Ngonu hoka alu meegoka doa pvkunv. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Doonu alu lo ngonu Jius vdwgv kumdubv dookum kongv hoka dodubv vla mvnggv rila, pamtv gvngv svko takbv linto. Ho anvnyimv vdwa ngonu dootung tokula okv minrap toku. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Ngonu gvlo tvvnv akonv Laidia Taitira lokv, ho vv yalwng yajinv iji pioknv angv. Nyimv angv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumnv go, okv Ahtu ninyigv tuktum mvngnv nvnvnga mvkoto Paul gv ogugo minpvdw alvbv tvvria dubv. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Kochingbv ninyia okv ninyigv naam lo doonv vdwv baptisma naatoku, ninyi ngonua harlwkto, “Aala okv ngoogv naam lo doolaka nonuno nga jvjvbv Ahtu gv mvngjwng bogobv mvngpvlo.” Okv ninyi ngonua gumya yala vnggv toku.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilipi lo patwk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Alu golo ngonu mvnwng ngv kumku mookulo vngtoku; ngonu mvnwng ngv nyijar paknv go vngrwk sito hvkv gvlo darwkmanv dowv doonvgo ho aajinv singdung nga mincho nyunvgo. Ninyigv atu gvbv hv achialv bv morko nga paanv go alvbv aainvgv lvga mincho jinam lokv. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Hv Paul okv ngonua vngming gvtoku, gokto “So nyi vdwsi Kairungnv Pwknvyarnv gv pakbu go! Bunu nonua dupwng jidu oguaingbv nonu singnya svngvdw!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Ninyia svbv rila alu meego ritoku, Anyungnga Paul achialvbv mvngdwk toku ho ninyi hinkur hirwkla okv dowa mintoku, “Ngo Jisu Kristo gv amin bv nyimv sokv alvmanv dowv liro toku vla orto jidunv!” dowv linda toku vbv ho minda rilo.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Vdwlo ninyigv atu gv morko nanv nvngv nyeepv kudw bunu mvngdwk toku, bunu Paul okv Silasnyi gakbwng toku okv bunu svvla ikula rigvdoogvnv nyi vnggiachaagia lo svvlwk nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Bunu bunua Roman nyigam vdwlo boolwk chotola okv mintoku, “So nyi vdwsi Jius vdwgo okv bunu mvnwng ngv ngoogv pamtv so ridwkriku nyadu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Bunu akusunv ridungdodung go tamsar la ngonugv pvbv nga rinyingrirudo, ngonu Roman pamtv lokv, okv ngonu mvnggia mare so ridungdoodung sum vmalo bunugv rinama.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Okv nyipamv lvkin gubv Paul okv Silasnyi naatungto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Vbvrikunamv nyigam vdwv Paul okv Silas gv vji nga putakpuyak tokula okv bunua mvdu ridubv orto nga jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Koching nga achialv bv dwngto la, bunu vdwv buniya patwk arwng lo tumlwk toku, okv patwk rigv nvngv bunua alvbv itum pvvto vla orto nga jito. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Oogv orto nga tvvnam gola, patwk rigvnvgv bunua chenyung lo tunglwk to okv bunugv lvpa nga lvpia lwkpium sitola tumpvto.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Yupra lvpa nga Paul okv Silas bunyiv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumla okv mimin mintoku, okv kvvbi patwk doonv mvnwng ngv bunya tvla dootoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Dvminmabv hoka kairungnv mobi go hwkto, hogv patwk doogingnvnv vka hvkdin rvpwngto. Vbvrinamv agi mvnwng ngv kokko nyatoku, okv patwk lo doonv mvnwng ngv jaako ngv doksok toku. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Patwk am kaarianv angv godung toku, okv vdwlo hv patwk gv age ngv kokda namnga kaapa tokula, ho ninyi patwk lo doonv vdwv toosi pvvkuji mvngtoku; vkvlvgabv hv atubongv rioksv nga svvlin laku okv atubongv peeki sitv toku. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Vbvritola Paul ho lokv gvngv ninyigv gaam bv gokbub lotoku, “No atubongv mvki suma bvka! Ngonu mvnwng ngv si dopvnv!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Patwk am rigv nvngv mvru bvngla ikula, arwngbv chaplwk toku, okv jinjin rumrum laku Paul okv Silas gv lvpa lvkwnglo aalwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Vbvrikunamv hv bunua agumbv linggv toku okv tvuto, “Tamsarbo vdw, ngo oguaingbv rila ringdubv?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Bunu mvrwkto, “Ahtu Jisunyi mvngjwng laka, okv nonua ringya tvvrikunv—nam okv noogv ogu nyi haka.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu Ahtu gv gaam nga japji toku okv ninyigv naam lo doonv kvvbi vdwaka. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Hogv ayulo patwk kaaria nvngv bunua vnggv toku okv bunugv ungv nga harkak toku; okv hv okv ninyigv ogu nyi mvnwng ngv lvkin gubv baptisma naatoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Vbvrikunamv hv Paul okv Silasnyi naambv chaagv toku okv bunua dvnam go meego jitola dvmu tvku. Hv okv ninyigv ogumvnwng ngv achialv bv himpu toku, vkvlvgabv bunu Pwknvyarnvnyi vjv mvngjwng nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Aru gunv nga Roman rigvnv vdwv polis nyigam vdwa orto nga jilinla vngmuto, “Hogv nyi vdwa vngmu laku kv vla.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Vkvlvgabv patwk kaarianv Paulnyi minto, “Nyigam vdwv nam okv Silasnyi orto go jilwkpv topu dukubv. Vbvribolo, nonu vngla riku, vngnyi kuka okv nyanyak alvbvku.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Vbvritola Paul polis nyigam vdwa mintoku, “Ngonu mvnwng lo ogu rimur goka kaapama, bunu ngonu mvnwng nga nyi gv apam lo mvritmvkato—okv ngonu mvnwng vka Roman nyi to! Vbvrinamv bunu ngonu mvnwng nga patwk arwnglo tumlwkto. Okv vjv ngonua chinpa madubv vngmu kuso mvngduku. Vmabv! Roman nyigam vdwv atubongv soka aasu la okv ngonua naalin motoka.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Polis nyigam vdwv mirwk toku soogv gaam am Roman nyigam vdwlo minpa toku; okv vdwlo bunu Paul okv Silasnyi Roman nyi go vla tvvpa kunamv, bunu mvnwng ngv busu nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu aalaku okv bunua minggu lwktoku; Vbvrikunamv bunu patwk gvngv bunua linggv toku okv bunua pamtv nga kayu tokukv vla tvvkato. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Paul okv Silas patwk gvngv linlaku okv Laidia gv naam bv aatoku. Bunu hoka mvngjwngnv vdwa kaarwk sito kula, okv bunua gaam mintvmiru pikula okv vngtoku.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Tesalonika lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Paul okv Silas Ampipolis okv Apollonia bv vngpikla vngtoku, Jius kumkunaam dooku gv Tesalonika lo aatoku. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Paul ninyigv atugv vngdungbv Jius kumkunaamlo vngtoku. Hoka Doonu alu lvum go hv nyitwng gv lvkobv dopam pamgvto Baibel kitap lokv minla, <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>okv Darwknv kitap lokv bunua mindimiyin jila mimpa jitoku ho Kristo hinching la okv sito kula turkur kunama. “Si Jisu oogv ngo nonua mimpa jidunv si,” Paul minto, “Si kv Kristo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Bunugv meegonv Paul okv Silas gv mingku lo tvvlwk minggv toku okv lvkobv ritoku; vkvlvgabv Grik twngtvnv meego okv anvnyimv rigvdogvnv meegoka, oogv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumnyabo vdwv.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Vbvritola Jius vdwv kavtarv toku okv nyi agar manv vngkarchaakarnv meego vngkum motola okv dopam pamnya lakula alvmanv nyitwng gubv ritoku. Bunu pamtv mvnwng lo makarrikar nyato okv nyi akogv naama palwk jitoku Jason minv angv naam nga okv Paul okv Silasnyi mvdubv kaakar nyala okv bunua nyi apam lo boolin dubv. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Vbvritola bunua kaapa kuma nvngv, bunu Jasonnyi okv mvngjwngnv meegonyi pamtv gv rigvdogv nvlo boolin chotola okv goktoku, “So nyi vdwv mooku mvnwng lo ridwkriku nvgo! Bunu vjv ngonugv pamtv lo aapvku, <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>okv Jason bunua ninyigv naam lo doomu toku. Bunu mvnwng ngv Dvbvyachok gv pvbv nga tvvmabv rinia toku, mvvnya toku dvbv kvvbigo dopvkv, vkvgv aminv Jisu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Bunu soogv gaam nga nyipam okv pamtv tujupkunam nga tvvsik motola twngtwng rara mvngmu toku. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Tujupkunam vdwv Jason okv ajin vdwa ainmorko dorsvrisv nga rimu tokula topu toku, okv vbvrikunamv bunua vngmu nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beria lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Kanv sopikda, mvngjwngnv vdwv Paul okv Silas bunyia Beria lo vngmu toku. Vdwlo bunu vngchinam gola, bunu Jius kumkunaam bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Beria gv nyitwng ngv Tesalonika nyitwng nga habia yatoku. Bunu doina tvvnwng alvbv tvvria nyatoku, okv Paul gv minam ngv jvjv gubvri vla bunu Baibel kitap nga alu lokia purila kaanyato. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv awgonv mvngjwng nyatoku, okv Grik gv anvnyimv kaibv rigvdogv awgo okv Grik gv nyiga awgunv ka mvngjwng nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Vbvritola vdwlo Tesalonika lo doonv Jius vdwv Paul Beria lo Pwknvyarnv gv gaam nga japdokv vla tvvpa namgola, bunu hoka aatoku okv lamrwpato kula okv apam am nvngyaknvngchak toku. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Vjakpigobv mvngjwngnv vdwv Paulnyi svmasa gv agum bv vngmu toku; vbvritola Silas okv Timoti bunyi Beria lo dootoku. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Paul gv lvkobv vnggvnv vngbom nyi vdwv ninyia Etins bv vngchi gvvtoku okv vbvrikunamv Paul gvlo lvkobv minsar koto kula ho Silas okv Timotinyi lvkobv aamu dokubv baapubv Beria vngkur toku.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etins lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Vdwlo Paul Etins lo Silas okv Timotinyi kaaria rilo, hv achialvbv mvngru toku pamtv lo morti achialvgo kaapa tokula. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Vkvlvgabv ninyia Pwknvyarnv kumnvjonv Jius okv Jentail vdwgv lvkobv kumkunaamlo dopam pamgv toku okv nyitwng nga aludwkibv vngpiknv vdwaka. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Ipikurian gv meego okv stoik gv tamsarnvnyi larmi sito, mintoku, “so nyi si oguka chima hv ogugo mindu nvdw. Hv ogugo mintv dvnvdw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Kvvbiv minto, “Hv mintv doonvgo ngonua kvvbi Pwknvyarnv meego,” ogulvgavbolo Paul minjito bunua Jisu gv lvkwng lo okv ninyigv sinam lokv turkur kunama.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jisu gv lvkwng lo okv ninyigv sinam lokv turkur kunama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grik lo, nyimv amin bv minam “turkur kunam” nyimv pwknvyarnv amin bv chinla dukunv. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Vbvrikunamv Paulnyi hv vnggv toku, Aropagus kvba, doopamlo hoka hv mintoku, “Ngonua minbwk jilabv so anw rinama noogv ngonua tamsarnama. <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Noogv ngonuam anw bv minjinam nga, okv ngonu chinwngdo soogv tamsarnam si oguvdw,” (<verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Etins lo nyi mvnwng ngv okv nyebunyi mvnwng gv atugv dwa rilwk dula anwnv ogugo minam am tvvria laka rito okv mimpa laka rito.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Paul pamtv gv kvbadopam kaagia lo dakrap toku okv minto, “Ngo kaadu nonugv Etins lo nyi vdwv achialvbv dormo rinv gubv ridu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Ngo nonugv pamtv nga vngpitla okv nonugv kumkujoku am ngo kaakunamv oogv yogwngmvrwng lo lvkpv nama kaapa toku ‘Chimanam Pwknvyarnv gv lvgabv’ hv nonugv kumnamjonam go, vbvrikunamv, vbvrilachin hum nonu chimado, si oguvdw ngo nonua vjak minkar jidukunv. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24,25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1Dv 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Aij 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Nyim 7:48</ref> </char></note> Pwknvyarnv, sichingmooku okv ogumvnwng nga sum pwknv, nyidomooku okv nyiamooku gv Ahtuv okv nyi vdwgv mvnam kumging lo dooma dunv. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Pwknvyarnv ngonu gvlo oguguka mvngma dunv vmalo ngonu ninyia ogugo jila nyudunv hv yabv atuv ngonua saknam turnama okv ogumvnwng nga nyichar mvnwng lo jiya dunv. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Nyi ako lokv hv mooku mvnwng nga mvlinto okv minjito sichingmooku mvnwng lokv turdubv. Hv atubongv mvkimvak jito ogolo okv oguaingbv singsv vdw. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Ninyia sum ritoku vkvlvgabv ho bunu ninyia kaachin sidubv, okv ninyi chinsu lare bunu ninyigv lvkwng lo mvngnama. Hvjvka Pwknvyarnv ngonu mvnwng gv lokv aduma; <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>vbv akonv minto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Ninyigv lokv ngonu singdunv okv bidutapdunv okv turmudakmu dunv.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Si nonugv mimin lvknv meegonv mindunv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Ngonuka ninyigv umvuu ngv.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Ngonu mvnwng ngv Pwknvyarnv gv umvuu ngv vbolo, ngonu vbv mvngmare hv ain vmalo raaji vmalo vlwng lokv morti bv mvnamgo vla. Hv ogu lokvka manvgo nyi vdwlokv mwnglin nam okv mvlin nam. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Vngnyi konv dwlo, Pwknvyarnv kaabotalikla kaato ogulvgavbolo nyi vdwv chimato ogugo bunu ridunvdw. Vbvritola vjak ninyia minduku ho nyi mvnwng nga mooku mvnwng gvngv alvmanv lokv mvngdin la ninyi gvlo aakur tvku vla. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Pwknvyarnv sichingmooku mvnwng nga nyi akin gvlokv alvrungbv jwngkadaka dukubv alua mvpvripv pvku, okv hv sum kaabwk dukubv rilin jitoku ninyia sikunvnga turkur molaku!”<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Vdwlo nyi vdwv, Paul gv oogv sitola turkur kunam gv lvkwngbv japnama tvvpa pvkudw, nyi kvvgonv nyarjito. Vbvritola kvvgonv mintoku, “Ngonu sum tvvria dvre no gvlo lvkodv.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Okv vbvrikunamv Paul bunugv doopam lokv lintoku. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Nyi meegonv Paulnyi mvngjwng toku okv vngming gvvtoku, apam ho Dionysius, hv kvba gv nyi go, hoka anvnyimv ako aminv Damaris, okv nyitwng kvvbi meegoka.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Korin lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>So koching bv, Paul Etins nga kayu pikula okv korin bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Hoka nyi Akuila vnam, pontus lo bvngnam Jius nyi ako kaapato, ninyigv nyimv Prisilanyi lvkobv Itali lokv gvngv aachi sopikto, Klaudius Dvbv Jius mvnwng nga Rom lokv vngro tokukv vla orto jilin toku. Paul bunua kaabv vngto, <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>okv hoka doolwk toku okv bunua lvkobv ridungripa riming gvvto, ogulvgavbolo hv bunugv rinam apia bv vbv tombu mvla turla singnv go. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Ninyia Doonu aludwkiya Jius kumkunaam lo, Jius okv Grik vdwa mvngdin modubv vla dopam lo japbwngto.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Vdwlo Silas okv Timoti Mesedonia gvngv vngchi pvkudw, Paul ninyigv dw mvnwng nga Jius vdwlo ho Jisu Kristo ngv vla doin japku lo rimwng toku. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Vdwlo bunu ninyia maakv vpvdw okv ninyia tvvru kaayanv minto kudw, hv atubogv vji gv amokayok nga tia sidula okv bunua mintoku, “Nonugv atubogv singnwng manamv nonugv mvngmur vsu! hv ngo ajv kaariama. Vjak lokv ngo vngjikun Jentail vdwloku.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Vbvritola hv bunua vngyu toku okv vngla kula Jentail Titius Justus vnam dooku gv naam lo aatoku hv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumnv go; ninyigv naamv Jius kumkunaam koching lo dooto. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Krispas, Jius kumkunaam gv rigvnvgo, Ahtunyi mvngjwng nvgo, ninyigv nyimv kuu mvnwng vka lvkobv; okv Korin gv kvvbi nyitwng mvnwng ngv doina tvvpa tokula, mvngjwng toku, okv baptisma laanya toku.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Ayu yupgo lo Paul nyikrwgo kaatoku Ahtu ninyia ho mintoku, “Busu mabvka, vbvritola japbwng laka okv kayu mabvka, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>ngo noogv lvkobv doodunv. Nam yvvka ogu mvkimvmar jinv kaamare, ogulvgavbolo ngoogv nyi vv soogv pamtv si awgo dopvnv.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Vbvrikunamv Paul hoka dootoku nyingola patung go, Pwknvyarnv gv gaam nga nyi vdwa tamsar la.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Vdwlo Gallionyi Akaia lo Roman mooku gv gobunor gobv mvlin pvkudw, Jius mvnwng ngv lvkin gubv aakum la Paulnyi naatung toku okv ninyia kvba baaku naam bv aagv toku. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>Bunu minto, “So nyi si, tamsardu nyi vdwa Pwknvyarnvnyi kumlakv vla ngonugv pvbv nga rinyingriru bv ridu!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Paul mintv namgola Gallio Jius vdwa minto, “Vdwlo nonu so nyi sum alvmabv pvbv nga riborilikla vmalo rimurvngmur kunam gv gaam gubolo, ngo nonu Jius vdwgv minama tvvria namv vv alvnvgobv rire. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Vbvritola nonugv ogugo raami sinam si gamchar okv amin gv lvkwng mvngchik gomwng mimisinam si nonugv atubogv pvbv gv lvkwng lo. Vkvlvkwngbv no atubongv risu laka soogv adwkaku sum noogv sigwng bv. Ngo sikv nvnga macharmayar nwngria ma!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Okv ninyia bunu mvnwng nga kvbanaam gv agum bv charlin toku. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv, Jius kumkunaam gv rigvnv Sostenesnyi svvbwng tokula okv ninyia kvbanaam alin lo dwngnya toku. Vbvritola dwngjvka Gallio ogugoka mvngma bv riminto.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antiok lo vngkurkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Num 6:18</ref> </char>
    </note> Paul Korint lo awgo mvngjwngnv vdwa lvkobv doopi kula, vbvrikunamv bunua doomu pikula okv svpwlo vngraptoku Prisila okv Akuila gv lvkobv Sairia bv vngtoku. Svpw lokv Senkrai bv vngma dvbv ninyigv dumpo dvmwa mwkak toku ogulvgavbolo hv milv toku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hv milv toku: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soogv dumpo dwmw mwknam si jius vdwgv ridungrimalo milv nama kaatam donv. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu Epesus lo vngtoku, hoka Paul Prisila okv Akuilanyi kayupikula. Hv Jius vdwgv kumkunaam bv vngtoku okv Jius vdwa lvkobv tvulvpak minsuto. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Nyitwng ngv ninyia awgo doodubvri vla tvuto, vbvritola ninyia maakv vla mintoku. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Hv vngrap jiku la, hv milvto, “Ngo aakur riku vbvritola si Pwknvyarnv mvnglwkbolo,” Vbvritola hv doruptoku Epesus lokv.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Vbvrinamv hv kaisaria lo vngchinam gola, ninyi Jerusalem bv vngla Gvrja nga alvpvri vpi kula okv vbvrikunamv Antiok bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Kochingso hoka meego ripikula, hv lintoku okv Galatia okv Prigia mooku bv vngpik lakula mvngjwngnv mvnwng nga adwngchwng motoku.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apollos lo Korin okv Epesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Jius nyi ako aminv Apollos Alekjandaria lo bvngnam go hv Epesus lo aalwkto. Hv alv rungbv milak nvgo okv chinv go okv Darwknv kitap a awbv chinv go. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Hv Ahtu gv Lamtv nga alvbv tamsar jito, okv lvkobv hardv rungbv ninyia japjito okv Jisu gv jvjv nga minjwk la tamsar jito. Vbvka, ninyi Jon gv baptisma nga chimwngdu. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Hv mvngkam alvbv Jius kumkunaam arwng lo japrap toku. Vdwlo Prisila okv Akuila ninyia tvvpa tvkudw, bunu ninyia naam lo lvkobv aagv tokula okv ninyia bunu Pwknvyarnv gv Lamtv nga alvjvbv mirwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Vbvripikula Apollos Akaia lo vngdu kubv ritoku, vkvlvgabv Epesus gv mvngjwngnv vdwv ninyia kaadurto vla Akaia gv mvngjwngnv vdwa siti go bunua lvkto la ninyia alvbv aamu tvkv vto. Hv vngchinam gola, Pwknvyarnv gv anyuayanam lokv mvngjwng kunv vdwa hv alvbv ridur nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Apollos Jius vdwa Jisu Kristo kv vla Darwknv kitap lokv kaatam la nyi apam lo gwlwk alvbv larmi sula bunua larya yatoku.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Epesus lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Apollos Korin lo doori lo, Paul mooku mvnwng lo vngpit karla Epesus lo vngchi toku. Hoka hv lvbwlaksu meego kaapatoku <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>okv bunua tvvkatoku, “Nonuno Darwknv Dow paato bvre vdwlo nonu mvngjwng nvbv rikulo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Bunu mirwksito “Ngonu Darwknv Dowa doopv nvkv vla tvvpama.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>“Vbvrikunamv, alvdo, oguaingnv baptisma naapvnv?” Paul tvvkato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Bunu mirwksito, “Jon gv baptisma.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mt 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Lk 3:4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Jn 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref> </char>
    </note> Paul minto, “Jon gv baptijumv yvvbunudw rimur lokv mvngdin dukunv; okv hv mintoku Israel gv nyi vdwa mvngjwng nyato ninyigv koching lo ako yvvdw aakunv hv Jisu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Vdwlo bunu sum tvvpa pvkudw, bunu mvnwng ngv baptisma naanya toku Ahtu Jisu gv amin bv. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Paul ninyigv laakv bunu gvlo lakpv toku, okv Darwknv Dowv bunu gvlo aatoku; bunu tvvchin madubv gaam ranya toku okv Pwknvyarnv gv doina japnya toku. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv nyi vringgola anyi gobv rito.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Paul Jius kumkunaamlo vngtoku okv poolu pwkgumlo nyi vdwa lvkobv mvngkum alvbv japji toku Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga hv bunua laadubv gwngkwto. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Vbvritola bunu kvvgonv larnyato okv mvngjwng mato, okv bunu mvnwng gv alvmanv gaam mintv madvbv Ahtu gv Lamtv gv lvkwng lo. Vkvlvgabv Paul bunua vngyu toku okv mvngjwngnv vdwa ninyigv lvkobv vnggv laikula, okv Tairannas gv japku naam lo hv dopam go pamgv toku aludwkibv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonvlo lvkpwngdu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">11:00 am lokv lala ila 4:00 pm. </char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Anying nyingnyi go, ho Asia mooku lo nyi doonv mvnwng ngv, Jius okv Jentail, anyiv Ahtu gv gamchar am tvvla dootoku.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Skeba gv kuunyilo vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Pwknvyarnv Paul gvlo rika manam lamrwpanam go kaatam motoku. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Lumar okv vji jiriapjichap lokv hv lvvma nvnga mvnvrinvto, okv bunugv achi nvngv poya toku, okv alvmanv dow vka bunugv lokv lintoku. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Jius nyi gonv vngkarchaakar la okv Ahtu Jisu gv amin lokv minv la alvmanv uyuvram am charlin kwla rika nyato. Bunu alvmanv dowa minto, “Ngo, Paul gv japkar kunam Jisu Kristo gv amin lokv gamki dunv.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Achiboru kanwv, Jius Nyibu Butv gv aminv skvba vnam gv kuu vdwv svbv rinyato.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Vbvritola alvmanv dowv bunua minto, “Ngo Jisunyi chindunv, okv ngo Paul gv lvkwng aka chindunv; Vbvritola nonuno yvvla?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Alvmanv dow doonv nyi angv hv bunu mvnwng gv aulo pokdakto okv mvnwng nga mvtoku. Bunu naam lokv kilin nyatoku, okv abin bv okv oyiv raratvla. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Epesus lo doonv Jius okv Jentail nyi vdwv mvnwng ngv sum tvvpa nyatoku; bunu mvnwng ngv busu nyatoku, okv Ahtu Jisu gv amina kaibv mvngpa nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Mvngjwngnv awgo aalaku, ogugo bunugv rimursingmur kunam nga nyi apam lo mimpa sitoku. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Awgo tagohinv vdwv bunugv kitap am bakkum lakula okv bunu nyi apum lo vmvlo ramyok toku. Bunugv kitap gv arv ngv Raaji lokdwng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Raaji lokdwng: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Raaji lokdwng si nampum nyi vdwgv aludwkibv yilaplapjo nambv rito (Mt 20:2 lo kaatoka). </char></note> hejar chamngu gobv ritoku . <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Vkvlvgabv Ahtu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vkvlvgabv Ahtu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">okv vkvlvgabv Ahtu gv jwkrw lokv, doinv ngv.</char></note> gv gaam gv jwkrwv svbv gwlwk yayabv ritoku okv dupwng kartoku.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epesus lo yalungyachung dukunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Ogumvnwng gv riro koching bv, Paul ninyi atubongv mvngtoku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:21</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Paul ninyi atubongv mvngtoku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Paul, dow lokv, mvngtoku.</char></note> Mesedonia okv Akaia bv vngpikla Jerusalem lo vngdubv mvngtoku. Paul minto, “Hoka ngo vngpikula,” “Ngo Rom haka kaarungre.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Vkvlvgabv ninyigv riduryanv anyigo vngmuto Mesedonia bv, Timoti okv Irastusnyi. Hv vbvritola Asia lo awgo dootoku.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Ahtu gv lamtv gv lvkwngbv ho dw hoka Epesus lo achialv bv yalungyachung dutoku. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Ain pwknvrinv aminv Demetrius vnam nyi angv nyimv pwknvyarnv Artemis gv pwknvyarnvnaam a raaji lokv mvto la pyokto okv yvbunudw ninyigvbv pioknv vdwv achialvbv pyokpa la paakum jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Vkvlvgabv hv bunu mvnwng nga gokum lwkto lvkobv kvvbi vkv bunugv gwngpiabv gwngnv vdwa okv mintoku bunua, “Nyi vdw, nonuno chindu ho ngonugv singkuv soogv gwngnamrinam lokv aadunv. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Vjak, nonu atubongv kaasudu okv tvvsudu ogugo Paul gv ridung doonv nga. Ninyia hoka minto laak lokv mvnam pwknvyarnv ngv pwknvyarnv jvjv mangvkv okv ninyia awgo milwk toku Epesus okv Asia mooku gv nyi taktv yanga ka. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Hoka achialvbv maarw yinvpv, vbvritola, ho ngonugv pioksvrisv ngv alvmanv amin donyiji. Vv twkma, Vbvritola hokaka rire maarw alvbv hogv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo kairungbv Pwknvyarnv nyimv Artemis aariku ogubvka riku mabv, okv hoka ninyigv kairungnv ngv apinayin riku pwknvyarnv nyimv ninyia kumnv Asia mvnwng ngv okv chinggodogo gv mvnwng lokv ngvka!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Nyitwng ngv so gamchar nga tvvpa namgola, bunu mvnwng ngv sakcha nyatoku okv gokrap toku, “Epesus gv kai yachuk nvngv Artemis kv!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Tvvsupkayap dukubv hv bunu dupwng kartoku Pamtv mvnwng lo. Nyi kvvgonv Gaius okv Aristarkasnyi svvtungto, Paulnyi lvkobv vngnv vdw Mesedonia lokv, chapchar minsuto mvnwng ngv dopam dooku lo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Paul atubongv nyitwnglo aala okv minso mvngto, vbvritola mvngjwngnv vdwv ninyia vngmu nwngmato. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Asia mooku gv tujupkunam nyigam kvvgonv Paul gv ajin bv rinv, ninyia kumla minam gindung go vngmuto gokku naam lo vngma bvkv vla. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Dopamripam mvnwng lo aparasar nyatoku: nyi kvvgonv gokto ogu ako, kvvbi gonv gokto oguguyv mvngla, ogulvgabv takloyangv bunu chimato ogubv bunu mvnwng ngv aakum pvdw. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Nyitwng kvvgonv minya toku Alekjandarkv jvjvkv rigvnv, vbv Jius vdwv ninyia atuk lo vngcho dubv mvtoku. Vbvrikunamv Alekjandar nyitwng nga choyi bvkv vla ninyigv laakv riaria toku, okv hv gwngkw tola minkwto miring sidubv. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Vbvritola vdwlo bunu ninyia kaachin pvkudw Jius nyi bv, bunu mvnwng ngv gamkin gubv goklin toku lvkobv ho gunta anyi gubv ritoku: “Artemis kv Epesus lo kai nvngv!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Anyunganya nga banggu gv baabu angv nyitwng nga nyanyak dubv mvla toku. Hv minto, “Epesus gv nyi vdwv!” “Mvnwng ngv chindo ho Epesus pamtv ngv Pwknvyarnvnaam gv kaarianv kainv Artemis okv darwknv vlwng nyidomooku lokv holu pvnv. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Yvvbonu ka sum miya nyomare svkvnv nga. Vkvlvgabv nonuno nyanyak runglakv okv oguka riyoka pvchaharianv gwngnamgo. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>No so nyi sum svka aagvpv vbvritola bunu oguka dvchoma Kumkulo vmalo oguka mima ngonugv pwknvyarnv nyimv gv lvkwngbv. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Vbvritola Demetrius okv ninyigv ririanv nyi vdwv ngonua minkinrikinbolo akonyimaka akonyi, ngonu gvlo mvvlarila gvnvnv tujubkunamv doodu kvbanaam lo aludwkibv mimisidubv. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Vbvritola no ogu kaiyago minsu mvngdv bolo, hum minpwk jiriku pamtv gv mimpumlo. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Silu gv ogugo ripvkunam soogv kochingbv, ngonua hoka yalungyachung rigvnvgobv minv yinvpv. Soogv duyakduchak minsukunam si ogu minkorrikor jvgo kaayoma, okv ngonu so lvkwng sum alvnvgobv minji nyula mare.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Pamtv baabuv svbv minggv rikula, nyitwng nga naam bv vngmu nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Mesedonia okv Akaia lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Yalungyachung rinya nam kochingso, Paul mvngjwngnv vdwa gokkum nyatola okv bunua lvkobv gamgo mintvmiru nyapi kula alvbv vla bunua mintoku. Vbvrikunamv hv vnglin lakula okv Mesedonia bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Hv mooku mvnwnglo vngpikla okv mintvmiru karla nyitwng nga lvkobv doin awgo minggo kartoku. Vbvripikula hv Akaia lo aatoku, <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>hoka hv poolu pwkgumgo dootoku. Hv gwngrap toku Sairia lo vngdu kubv vdwlo hv chinsu pvkudw Jius vdwgv ninyia nyiru rusvnga; vkvlvgabv hv mvngtoku Mesedonia bv vngkur dvkubv. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Beria lokv, Pirhus gv kuunyilo Sopatarnyi lvkobv vngming gvvto; Tesalonika lokv Aristarkas okv Sekundas; Derbe lokv, Gaius; Asia mooku lokv, Taikikas okv Tropimus; okv Timoti. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Bunu vngcho nyala okv Troas lo ngonua kaariala doonya toku. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Ngonu Pilippi lokv vngraptoku vtwnglo vpap lvkmanam dvbam alulo okv alu longu kochingbv ngonu bunua Troas lo ribam tvku, hoka ngonu alu kanwgo ribam tvku.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul gv Troas lo vngnyung bv vngkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Karbualu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Karbualu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vjwngalu. </char></note> gv arium ngonu mvnwng ngv lvkobv aakumchaakum nyatoku dvnam dvbam dubv. Paul nyitwng nga mintoku okv yupra lo gobv mimbwng la, hv logonvlo vngyu tvvkunam lvkwngbv. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Mvdurupum awgo hungdungto ngonu mvnwng gv doopam dooku gv hogv karchung lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Yaapa ako aminv Iutikas vla minam angv kirki lo dooto, okv Paul japbwngto, Yutikas yumi la okv yuptab toku, anyunganya nga ninyi yupngak tvku okv holutvku naam hogv karchung aom lokv kvdwlo hopvtoku. Vdwlo bunu ninyia svvrap tokudw okv hv siro tvku. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Vbvritola Paul itoku okv atubongv ninyi gvlo joklwkla okv ninyia jarbwng toku. “Mvngdwk mabvka,” hv mintoku, “Hv vjak turdvdu!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Vbvrikunamv hv chaakur tvku hogv karchung bv, vtwng nga pimwkto, okv dvtoku. Bunu hum lvkobv awgo raami siro koching bv, Doonyi vka poklin dvkubv, Paul vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Bunu naatoku vmi yaapa anga turdubv naam lo chaagv toku okv mvnwng ngv hinging nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Toras lokv Miletus lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Ngonu svpwbv vngcho yala vngtoku okv Assos lo aalwk tvvto hoka ngonu Paulnyi svpwlo vnggv tvvto. Hv ngonua sibv ritokv vla mintoku, ogulvgavbolo hv hoka kvdwbv vngtvtvto. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Vdwlo hv ngonua Assos lo paami sipvkudw, hv svpwbv vnggla okv Mitiline lo aagv toku. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Ngonu hokv gvngv durapla okv Kios lo logo nvnga aachi toku. Alu gonvgv kochingbv ngonu Samos lo aatoku, okv ho alu ngonu Miletus lo aachitoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Paul svpw lokv Epesus nga vngbo dubv mvngtoku, Asia mookulo dwa nyemu manam lvkwngbv. Vdwgo rinyupvdw, hv Pentikos alulo Jerusalem lo baapu alvbv aalwk dvkubv vla.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Epesus gv nyigagatv vdwa svyinnyilin gaam minkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Miletus lokv Paul Epesus lo gaam go milwkto, Gvrja gv nyigagatv vdwa ninyi kaarwk sudubv mintoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Bunu vdwlo aachi tokudw, ninyi bunua mintoku, “Nonuno chindu oguaingbv ngoogv dwa nonu gvlo lvkobv rilariya kunama, Asia mooku lo ngoogv atuake bv aalwkri alu lokv. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Jius nyi meegonv nga rinyingriruto okv nga achialvbv mvngdwkmvngku okv hirukaaya moto. Vbvritola ngo mvngdwkla nyikla sarla okv nyanyak alvbv Ahtu gv lvgabv ritoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Nonuno ho chindo ngo oguguka mvngtung mabv minjito nonu gvbv alv jinvgo okv mvngtoku mvnwng gvbv okv nonugv naam gvbv. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Jius okv Jentail vdwa ngo dinchi rungbv gamrw jitoku bunu atugv rimur am mvngdin lakula Pwknvyarnv gvloku okv ngonugv Ahtu Jisunyi mvngjwng dvkubv. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Okv vjak, Darwknv Dowa tvvla kuju ngo Jerusalem bv vngjikunv, ngo chinsuma ogugo alo ririkudw. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Ngo mvngchik chindu ho pamtv mvnwng lo Darwknv Dowv gamrw toku nga ho patwk lo dosv nga okv ngoogv hirukaya svngaka. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2Tim 4:7</ref> </char></note> Vbvritola ngo atugv singdung nga oguka mvngsuma; ngoogv mvngnam mvngchik vv ho Ahtu Jisu nga ritokv vla jinama, Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya lokv Alvnv Yunying nga rinyadoonya dukubv mvngmwng dunv.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>“Ngo Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga nonu mvnwng gv, pingkolo vngkarla japji kartoku. Okv vjv ngo chinduku ho nonuno nga lvkoka kaapa kumare. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Vkvlvgabv ngo silu gv alu lokv nonuna jvjvklvbv mirw doonv la: Vdwlo nonu akonvka nyenam goka dubolo, ngo ogugoka nonu lvlo ajv laya kumare. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Ngo Pwknvyarnv gv nonua chinsv gui vla mvngnam ogumvnwng nga nonua minji pvkunv. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Vkvlvgabv nonu atubongv chvrv bv kaala dosutvka okv Darwknv Dow gv nonua svlar kaaria dubv jinam vdwaka. Pwknvyarnv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pwknvyarnv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvgonv kitap lo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ahtu.</char></note> gv goklin kunam nyi vdwa rigv nvgobv ritokuka, hv ninyigv atubogv kuunyilo gv oyi lokv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ninyigv atubogv kuunyilo gv oyi lokv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ninyigv atubogv kuunyilo gv erinpeelwk siijinam lokv; </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vmalo ninyigv atubogv oyi lokv. </char></note> ninyigvbv mvpv kunv. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Ngo chindo ho ngoogv vngrokochingbv, nonugv pingkolo nyi vv busunam svcha jvbv rinv ngv aari nvpv okv gwngkw rinvpv nonua domumare. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Dwv aari kunvpv noogv atubogv nyi lokv, vnggv rikunvpv mvngjwngnv vdwa bunugv koching bv. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Vkvlvgabv bununo atuv hindum silaka! mvngpa laka ngoogv nam doomadakma bv nyiksinyikla dwkla nyingum go ho aluayu bv nonu mvnwng nga okv akinakin bv minpv nama.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>“Okv vjak ngo nonuam Pwknvyarnv gv ringnam lo okv ninyigv ayanv doin lo tulwk jidunv, si nonua gwlwk am jiriku okv Pwknvyarnv gv anyuaya kunam ninyigv nyi mvnwng nga jiriku. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Ngo vdwloka mvngma dvnv Yvvgvloka morkoain go okv vji vbego. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Nonuno chindo oguaingbv ngo kudungkua ridudw ngoogv atugv laak lokv atubongv svngsu dubv okv ajin vdwaka. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Ogumvnwng nga ngo ritoku, ngo kaatamto oguaingbv ridur svngvdw ngonu heema nvnga ridur svvgorung. Mvngpa laka ngonugv Ahtu Jisu gv gaama ninyi atubongv minto, ‘Jinam si laanam amamsvnga mvngpu yadunv.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Paul ninyigv minyaro koching bv, hv lvbwng lokv kompv tvla nyi mvnwng nga okv kumtoku. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv kapnya toku okv chvgap toku okv mopup tvku ninyia. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv mvngru nyatoku ogulvgavbolo Paul bunua mintoku, “nonuno nga vdwloka lvkodv kaapa kumare.” Vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia svpwlo vnglwk minggv toku.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Jerusalem bv vngnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Ngonu bunua alvbv doolakukv vpi kula vngyu toku. Ho koching bv sidakala bv durapla, Kos lo ngonu raplwk toku; logo nvnga ngonu Rodes lo vngchi toku, okv hokv ngv ngonu vngdavngrala Patara bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Ngonu hoka svpw go Poenesia bv vngjinvgo paatoku, vkvlvgabv ngonu hoka aalwk la vngdavngra toku. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Ngonu Saipras bokpin am kaapa dukubv aato, okv vbvrikunamv yorko kiambv dulu la Sairia lo aatoku. Ngonu Taire gv svgambv vngto ogulvgavbolo svpwlo gvvnama hoka gvvpv dokubv. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Ngonu hoka mvngjwngnv nyi meego kaapa minsu la okv bunua lvkobv alu kanwgo doobamto. Bunu Darwknv Dow gv jwkrw lokv Paulnyi Jerusalem bv vngma bvkv vla minto. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Vbvritola bunua lvkobv ngonugv doobam namgv dwv vngnya kunamv, ngonu vngyu tokula okv atugv lamtv bv vngtoku. Bunu mvnwng gv, nywng kuu mvnwng ngv lvkin gobv, ngonua lvkobv pamtv agum bv vnglintoku, hoka ngonu mvnwng ngv isi agum lo lvbwng kumpv tokula kumbam toku. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Vbvrikunamv ngonu asakv alv bvkv vmi sopi kula, okv ngonu svpwlo aatoku okv bunu naam bv vngkur nyatoku.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Ngonu atugv svpwlo vngdungla, Taire lokv Ptolimais lo dulin toku, hokaku ngonu mvngjwngnv vdwa alvbv raami solaku okv bunua lvkobv alu logo bv dooming gvvto. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Nyim 11:28</ref> </char></note> Alu gonv nga ngonu vnglaku okv Kaisaria lo vngchi kunam. Hoka ngonu ebenjelist Pilips gv naam lo dooto, hv Jerusalem lo nyi kanwgo riduryanv gubv darlin kunam lokv akonv. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Ninyi gvlo nyibu vngmadvnv Pwknvyarnv gv doina japgo yanv umvnyijar api go dooto. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Ngonu hoka alu mvngchikgo dookunamv Agabas vnam nyijwk go Judia lokv aalwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Hv ngonu dookulo aato, Paul gv hok am naala, hv atugv lvpa laak lo um leelwk sutola okv minto, “So svbv Darwknv Dowv mindo: Soogv hok atua Jerusalem lo Jius nyi vdwv vbv leeri, okv bunu ninyia Jentail nyi vdwgv laak lo laklwk riku.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Vdwlo ngonu sum tvvpanamgola, hoka ngonu la kvvbi vdwv Paulnyi Jerusalem bv vngma bvkv vla kumla minto. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Vbvritola hv mirwksito, “Nonu ogubv svbv kapnyarinya la ngoogv haapok ka mvngdwk modunv? Ngo Jerusalem mvngchik lo leemwng koodubv mvngma vbvritola hoka ngo Ahtu Jisu gv lvgabv sidubv mvngta dunv.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Ngonu ninyia mintap nyumato, vkvlvgabv ngonu topu tokula, “Ahtu gv mvngnam bv rila kuka.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Kochingso hoka meego ripikula, ngonu atugv yikungyira nga mvgemvrap tokula okv Jerusalem bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Kaisaria lokv lvbwlaksu meego ngonua vngming gvvto okv ngonugv lvkobv naam doojiku ninyigv naam bv ngonua vnggv toku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Okv ngonugv lvkobv naam doojiku ninyigv naam bv ngonua vnggv toku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Oogv nyi agv naam ngonugv vngla doojiku hoka bunua aagdung gvvla rito. </char></note>—Mnason, Saipras lokv, hv kvvlogv lokv mvngjwng nvgobv rinv.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul gv Jemsnyi Kaalwknam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Vdwlo ngonu Jerusalem lo vngchi tokudw, mvngjwngnv nyi vdwv mvngpu nyala ngonua alvbv aamuto. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Logo nvnga Paul Jemsnyi kaabv ngonua lvkobv vngming gvvtoku; okv gvrja nyi nyigagatv vdwv mvnwng ngv lvkobv rinya kunam. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Paul bunu mvnwng nga alvbv kaarwk sito okv ninyigv lokv Pwknvyarnv oguaingbv Jentail vdwgv pingkolo ripvkudw um mvnwng nga bunua mimpa jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Hvkv gvlo tvvronam kochingso, bunu mvnwng ngv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv nyatoku. Vbvrikunamv bunu minto, “Achiboru Paul, no kaakw tvka vdwnvgo hejarhejar Jius nyi vdwv mvngjwng nvbv rinya dukunv, okv bunu mvnwng ngv achialv bv Pvbv ngaka mvnggap nyadunv. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Bunu vbv chimpa duku no Jius nyi mvnwng nga Jentail vdwgv mooku lo rinv doonv vdwa Moses gv Pvbv nga topu dukubv tamsar duku, bunua umvuu vdwa ayakmvu kuma dvbv okv Jius vdwgv krimklu gv ridungdodung nga riming gvvku madubv minduku vla tvvpa nyapvku. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Bunu noogv so aalwk nama tvvpa rungriku. Vbvrikunamv ngonu ogugo risv ngvkudw? Vbvritola, ogugo rinam ngaka? <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Num 6:13-21</ref> </char></note> Ngonu nam svbv risv go vla mvngdunv. So sika nyi api go milvminsu tvla dopvnv. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Bunua lvkobv vngnyika okv mvdurridur kolo aapwng minggv laka okv bunugv rijo minjo nga joji tvka; vbvrikubolo bunu bunugv dwmw am mwkga sito.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bunugv dwmw a mwkga sito; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyim 18:8 am kaatoka.</char></note> Vbvrila mvnwng ngv chinriku bunugv nam minam lo ogu jvjv go dokumanyi vla, vbvritola bunu nonua Moses gv Pvbv lo doobwng dvnvnyi vla chiya rikunv. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Nyim 15:29</ref> </char></note> Vbvritola Jentail mvngjwngnv vdwa yugwngmvrwng lo lwknam dvnamtvngnam okv oyi ngaka okv oksarnam svnwngsvmin ngaka dvku madubv, okv bunua yoomur minsu madubv ngonu mimpv kunv vla bunua siti lo lvkla pau pvkunv.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Vkvlvgabv Paul logo nvnga nyi vdwa vnggv laku, bunua mvdurridur kolo lvkobv rimutoku. Vbvrikunamv hv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngtoku okv bunu mvnwng gv lvgabv mvdurridur kunama vdw lonyi bunu akinakinv risvmvsv ngvdw um minggo jito.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulnyi Pwknvyarnvnaam lo naatung kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Vbvritola vdwlo alu lokkanwv vngnya tvku namv, Asia mooku lokv Jius nyi meego Paulnyi Pwknvyarnvnaam lo kaapa toku. Bunu nyitwng nga nvngyak nvngpak la okv Paulnyi naatung toku. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Bunu goknyato, “Israel gv nyi vdwa!” “Ridurto! So nyi angv si mooku lo vngkarla nyi mvnwng lo Israel nyi vdwa okv Moses gv Pvbv aka okv so Pwknvyarnvnaam am miyakaya la tamsar sargonv. Okv vjak hv Jentail meegoka Pwknvyarnvnaam so aagvla darwknv naam am darwk madubv mvdu!” <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Nyim 20:4</ref> </char></note> (Bunu svbv minam si ogulvgavbolo bunu Epesus lokv Tropimusnyi Paul gv lvkobv pamtv lo ridubv kaato, okv bunu mvngtoku Paulnyi Pwknvyarnvnaam lo aagv pvnv vla.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Tvvbwktvlo kumanam lokv pamtv mvnwng lo dupwng toku, okv nyi vdwv lvkin gobv jokbam nyala, Paulnyi naatungto, okv ninyia Pwknvyarnvnaam agum bv tunglin nyato. Okv Pwknvyarnvnaam gv agi vdwa vjakpigobv koktum nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Nyitwng ngv Paulnyi mvki dubv gwngto, vbvrikunamv Roman sipai kamandar lo yunying ngv aatoku Jerusalem mvnwng lo yalungyachung bv ridu vla. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Vjakpigobv kamandar angv nyigam meego okv sipai twnggo naalaila nyitwng apam lo juklu toku. Vdwlo nyitwng ngv ninyia sipai atwng am kaapa tokudw, bunu Paulnyi jvngkumato. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Kamandar angv Paul dokubv aato, okv ninyia naatung toku, okv ninyia jaako sonyi go leedu kubv milin toku. Vbvrikunamv hv tvvkato, “So nyi si yvvla, okv ninyi ogugo ripvla?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Nyitwng apam lokv meegonv ogugo goknyato, kvvbi vdwv aku subv goknyato. Hoka ho vkvnv abwkalo kuma bv rikunamv Kamandar angv kaabwk nyumato ogugo ripvnvdw, vkvlvgabv hv ninyigv nyi vdwa Paulnyi sipai naam lo vnggv dukubv minto. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Bunu ninyia baatunglo vngchi minggv toku, okv vbvrikunamv sipai vdwv ninyia jootoku vkvlvgavbolo nyitwng ngv iki svrv bv rinyato. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv ninyigv kochingbv aaming gvvtola, “Ninyia mvkito!” vla goknyato.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul atubongv mvngging sunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Sipai vdwv Paulnyi sipai naam arwngbv aagv tvvrilo, hv kamandar anga minto: “Ngo nam gaam lo gamgo minla ridw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">“No Grik gaambv minto, no minyure?” Vla kamandar angv tvvkato. <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>“Vbvrikunamv no kvvlo kvcho gv Ijipt nyi ako yalungyachung dula hejar api alvmanv nyi go rigvla chukrimooku lo riram la ramgvnv angv mai?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Paul mirwksito, “Ngo Jius nyi ngv, Silisia gv Tarsus lo bvngnamv, Pamtv kai nvlo doonv ngv. Ayala nga nyi vdwa gaam japmu labv.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Kamandar angv ninyia japdubv jitoku, vkvlvgabv Paul baatung lo dakpv tvla ninyigv laakv nyi vdwa choi bvkv vla minto. Vdwlo bunu choi bv dooto kudw, Paul bunua Hebru gaambv japtoku:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>“Ngoogv Israel ajin vdwa, ngo atuv mvngging sula minam sum nonu tvvria jilabv!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Vdwlo bunu ninyia Hebru gaambv japdubv tvvto kudw, bunu abuyayabv choi nyatoku; okv Paul japwngla japjuk paying toku:<verse eid="ACT 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Nyim 5:34-39</ref> </char>
    </note> “Ngo Jius nyi vkv, Silisia gv Tarsus lo bvngnamv, vbvritola Jerusalem lo Gamaliel gvlo puri rila singcha toku. Ngo paato abuapa vdwgv alvbv Gamki pvvnama, okv silu so doodunv nonugv asar alvbv Pwknvyarnv gvlo tulwk sunam aingbv rito. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Nyim 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref> </char></note> Ngo so lamtv lo vngming gvnv nyi vdw ngaka pakipamar la sidubv mvtoku. Ngo nyimv jvka okv nyilo jvka naatungla okv bunua patwk arwnglo tumlwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Nyibu butvyachoknv okv kvba nyi mvnwng ngvka chinyadu ngoogv minam si jvjvbv mindunv vla. Ngo bunugv lokv Damaskas lo jius ajin vdwa siti lvknam am naarwksito, vkvlvgabv ngo bunua naatungla Jerusalem lo boolwkla rvngja lokv leeto la mvritririt dubv vla vngto.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul ninyigv mvngjwng kunama mimpa toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Nyim 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>“Ngo vngdungla okv Damaskas lo aachi svlv nga, alo lopo dvsv nga Nyidokolo gvngv dvminmabv dooriak go nga riakyum toku. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Ngo kvdw bolo gipv toku okv gaamgo nga, ‘Sol Sol! No nga ogubv mvdwmvku dunv?’ Vla mindubv tvvpato. <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Ngo tvvkato, ‘Ahtu, no yvvla?’ ‘Noogv mvdwmvku namv, ngo Najaret gv Jisu kv,’ hv nga vbv minto. <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Nga lvkobv vngnv nyiga vdwv loung ungnama kaapa minggvto, vbvritola yvvka nga gaam japnam am tvvpa manyato. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Ngo tvvkato, ‘Ahtu, ngo ogu ridukubv?’ Okv ahtu nga mintoku, ‘Gudungto okv Damaskas bv vngnyika, okv Pwknvyarnv gv no lvgabv mvngnam am no ogu risv ngvdw hoka ogumvnwng nga nam mimpariku.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Loung ngv achialv bv ungkanam lvgabv ngo nyikching toku, okv vbvritola ngoogv vngbam ajin vdwv ngoogv laak am svvbwng tola Damaskas lo aalwk gvvtoku.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>“Ho pamtv lo nyi ako dooto vkvgv aminv Ananias, hv dormo nyi go ngonugv Pvbv ngaka riming gvnv go okv hoka Jius nyi mvnwng ngv kaibv mvngdv namgo. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Hv ngo gvlo aato, ngoogv nvchilo daktola, okv minto, ‘Boru Sol, lvkodv kaadvto!’ Hokaku ngo kaapa toku okv ninyi nyika kaatoku. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Hv mintoku, ‘Ngonugv abuapa vdwgv Pwknvyarnv ngv nam darlinto ninyigv mvngnam nga chimu dubv, ninyigv darwkchongjornv pakbu gubv kaamu dubv, okv ninyigv atu gaambv japrinyi ninyia tvvmu dubv. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>No ninyigvbv kaariatvvria nvbv ririku mvnwng nga mimpa dukubv okv ogugo no kaapv tvvpv kudw. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Okv svjv, ogu gonyi doyadunv? Gudungto okv baptisma naalaku okv noogv rimur am sokga lakuka ninyia kumgv riku laka.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul gv Jentail vdwa goklwkla japjinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>“Ngo Jerusalem bv vngkur toku, okv vdwlo ngo Pwknvyarnvnaam lo kumrilo, ngo nyikrwgo kaato, <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>hoka ngo Ahtunyi kaapato, hv nga vbv minto, ‘baapu alvbv okv Jerusalem am vngyu datoku, ogulvgavbolo so gv nyi vdwv noogv ngo lvkwngbv minam am tvvmare.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>‘Ahtu,’ Ngo mirwksuto, ‘Bunu alv rungbv chindo ho ngo Jius kumkunaamlo vngla okv yvvdw nam mvngjwngnv vdwa naatung la dvngnama. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Nyim 7:58</ref> </char></note> Okv vdwlo noogv kaariariria nvbv rinv Stipinnyi mvki rilo ngo atuv hoka doosuto, ninyigv gwngrw bv sinama alv nvgobv mvnglwk riato okv ninyi gwngrw gwnv vdwgv vji a doogv riato.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Ahtu nga minto, ‘Vngnyilak,’ ‘holvgabv nam ngo Jentail vdwgv dooku adugolo vngmure.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Nyi vdwv Paulnyi vbv mindu kubv tvvria nyatoku; vbvritola bunu goktv rungbv bunugv goknam am gokrap nyatoku, “Ninyia lvkobv adu tvkuka! ninyia mvkito! ninyi singdu kubv rikuma!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv goknyato, vjia lwnglolwnglv karla okv, achuaya nga doori aulo jukar dubv taakar nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Roman kamandar angv atugv nyi vdwa Paulnyi sipai naam arwng lo boolwk tvkv vla orto jitoku okv bunua minto ninyia svnyak patola ogulvkwngbv Jius vdwv ninyia svbv goknya dunvdw um tvvlinto. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Vbvritola vdwlo bunu ninyia svnyak padubv vla leeto kudw, hoka nyigam daknv anga Paul minto, “Svkvnv si noogv pvbv lo Roman nyi am ogu rimur go rima jvka leetola svnyak padubv doorung pvnvre?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Vdwlo nyigam angv ninyia vbv mindubv tvvto kudw, hv orto jinv nyigam gvlo vngtoku okv ninyia tvvkato, “No ogugo ridunv? Alo nyi angv Roman nyi gulaka!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Vbvriku nvngv orto jinv nyigam angv Paul dokubv aatoku okv ninyi tvvkato, “Nga mimpato, no Roman nyi vre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“V” vvkv Paul mirwkto.<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Orto jinv nyigam angv minto, “Ngo achialvbv ainmorko jila Roman nyi bv rinv ngv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paul mirwksito, “Vbvritola ngo bvngyi lokv Roman nyi bv bvngtak linv ngv.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Paul ninyia tvvka jinv nyi vdwv vjakpigobv ninyigv kochingbv daksum nyato; okv orto jinv nyigam angv Paul Roman nyi gupv kunyi okv ninyia jaakobv leeto kubv vla mvngdin lakula hv busutoku.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul kvbadopam atuk lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Orto jinv nyigam angv Jius mvnwng ngv Paulnyi ogubv yalung dupv nvdw mvngla um malinla chindubv mvngtoku; vkvlvgabv logo nvnga hv Paul gv jaako nga paklin toku okv nyibu butv mvnwng nga okv Dopam gv nyi mvnwng nga kaarwk sudubv orto jito. Vbvrikunamv hv Paulnyi aagv toku okv ninyia bunugv atuk lo dakmu toku.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Paul dopam lo doonv nyi vdwa kaagap chinchinla minto, “Ngoogv Israel ajin vdwa! ngoogv haang lo Pwknvyarnv gv lvkwng lo kvvlo lokv silu gobv mvngla tulwksula lamtv lo singduridunv si ribwngching bv mvngbwk la ridunv. <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Nyibu butvyachok Ananias Paul gv nvchilo daknv vdwa ninyigv gaam nga nwknyato vla orto jito. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mt 23:27</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:28">28</ref> </char></note> Paulnyi minto, “Pwknvyarnv ya nam nwkyare! Tanyum gvriabo no! No hoka dootola nga Pvbv lo kaala minjinv, no bunua nga mvtokv vla orto jinv no vjak Pvbv nga mvyak yadunv!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Paul gv nvchilo daknv nyi vdwv ninyia minto, “No Pwknvyarnv gv Nyibu Butvyachok am miyakayadu!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Mog 22:28</ref> </char>
    </note> Paul mirwkto, “Ngoogv Israel richam vdwv, Ngo ninyia Nyibu Butvyachok nvngv vla chima. Darwknv Kitap lo mindu, ‘Nonugv nyi vdwa rigvnvnga alvmanv gaam mima bvka.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Nyim 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Pili 3:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Vdwlo Paul Sadusis apam meegonyi okv Parisis kvgonyi kaapa tokudw, hv doopam lokv goklin toku, “Israel gv achiboru vdwa! Ngooka Parisis gvngv, Parisi gv kuu ngv. Nga si jwngkadaka duku ogulvgavbolo sinv ngv turkur dukunv vla mvngjwng kunam lvgalo!”<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Ninyia vjakpigobv svbv minda namgola, Parisis vla Sadusis ngv yalung durap minsu lakula okv apam lokv apinain sitoku. (<verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mt 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mk 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Lk 20:27</ref> </char></note> Holvgabv Sadusis vdwv vbv minto sikunv nyi vdwv ho turkur kumare okv hoka ka nyidogindung vla okv dow go kaama dunv; vbvritola Parisis vdwv ho aom am mvngjwng nyadu.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Gokyagokya kunamv gamtv yaya toku, okv Parisis lokv Pvbv tamsarnv meegonv daknya tokula okv achibv mintor nyadubv mintoku: “So nyi angv gvlo ngonu ogugoka lvkobv rimur namgo kaapama! Vbvritola dow vla nyidogindung ngv ninyia jvjvklvbv mimu rungdu ka nvpv!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Larmi suku nvngv yalung duyak minsu nyatoku hokaku kamandar angv busu toku Paulnyi pamwk kuji mvngla. Vbvrikunamv ninyia orto jitoku ninyigv sipai vdwa apam bolo ila, Paulnyi bunugv lokv svvlinto okv hv sipai naam lo aagvto vtoku.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Ho ayu Paul gv dakku lo Ahtu dakming gvvto la minto, “Busu mabvkv! No ngo gvbv Jerusalem soka minkar jipv, okv Rom loka vbv dvdvbv rilaka.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulnyi mvki dubv gwngnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Arugunv nga Jius meegonv lvkobv kaarwk sila okv rungnamgo rungto. Bunu Paulnyi mvkima dvdvlo bunu dvnamtvngnam ogugoka dvku mare vla milv nyatoku. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Hoka champi lvyagobv doopam tvla lvkobv rungnyato. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu nyibu butv vdwlo okv nyigagatv vdwlo vngla minto, “Ngonuv lvkobv milv pvkunv ngonu Paulnyi mvkima dvdvlo oguka dvmare. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Vjak vbvrikunamv no okv kvba vdwv Roman kamandarnyi gaam go milwk tvka Paulnyi no gvlo igv modubv, ninyigv lokv mvvma rungmanv yunyingsa paadubv ridunv vla gwngtoka. Vbvritola ninyigv soka aachi madvbv ngonu ninyia mvki chore.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Vbvritola Paul gv bormv gv kuunyilo angv mvki dubv gwngnam nga tvvpa tola; vkvlvgabv hv sipai doopamlo vngla kula Paulnyi mintamto. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Vbvrikunamv Paul nyigam akonyi gokla okv ninyia minto, “So yaapa nga kamandar gvlo aagv jitoka: hvkv gvlo ogugo ninyi minsvgo doodu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Nyigam angv ninyia vnggvla, ninyia kamandar gvlo aagv jito, okv minto, “Patwk doonv Paul nga gokla okv nga tvvkala no gvlo so yaapa sum aagv jito vla, ogulvgavbolo hvkv gvlo nam ogugo minsvgo dopvkv vdu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Kamandar angv ninyigv laak nga gakbwng tola, hv atubongv ninyia svsum laila, okv ninyia tvvkato, “No nga ogugo minsvgo dopvla?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Ninyia minto, “Jius tujapkunam vdwv vkvpakv vmisilaku arunyi Paulnyi doopam lo boolwkla nam tvvka dubv vla minya do, kvba ngv hoka ninyigv lvkwng lo tvvkurtvrwk minsu dubv meego chinsv go dopvkv vla gwngre. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Vbvritola bunua tvvma bvka, vkvlvgavbolo hoka nyi champi lvyago toosila okv ninyigv lvgabv toyado. Bunu ninyia mvkima dvdvlo bunu dvmatvngma dubv milvminsu nyato. Bunu mvnwng ngv um ridukubv vla okv noogv minbwk kuji nama tooyala doonya duku.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Kamandar ngv minto, “So sum no ngam minjipvnv vla yvvnyika mimpa mabvkv.” Okv hv yaapa anga vngmu toku.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulnyi gobunor Peliks gvlo jilwk toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Vbvrikunamv kamandar ninyigv nyigam anyi gunyi goklwkla okv minto, “Kaisaria lo vnggv dubv sipai lvngnyi go mingkumto, lvkobv gora jukya nvlo chamkanw go okv nungbung chilaknv nyi lvngnyi go, okv siyugv kia bajilo vngdubv mvpvripv tokula dooya laka. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Paulnyi gora lo awgo mvge jito juknv dubv okv gobunor Peliks gvlo alvbv aachi modubv.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Orto jinv ngv siti ako ho vbv lvkto:<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>“Klaudius Laisias mvngdv kunam Gobunor Peliksnyi kumrwksidunv. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Jius vdwv so nyi sum naatung tokula okv ninyia mvki dokubv rinya kunamv. Ho ngo ninyia Roman nyi gobv tvvpatvla, vkvlvgabv ngoogv sipai vdwa lvkobv ngo vnggvla okv ninyia ringpv kunv. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Ngo chinso mvngla bunu mvnwng ngv ninyia ogubv mvduridu nvdw, vkvlvgabv ngo ninyia bunugv kvbadoopam lo igv jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Ngo chinkunamv hv sidubv okv patwk lo tumdubv oguka rimur namgo kaama, ninyia gungnying nyiru minam ngv bunu atugv Pvbv lvkwngbv tvvka sunam go. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Okv vdwlo nga ninyi hoka nyirunv apam go donyapv vla mimpa tokudw, ngo ninyia no gvlo vjakpigobv aagv jidu kubv mvngpv kunv. Ngo ninyia nyirunv vdwa minpvkunv bunugv ninyia gungnying minsv nga noogv kaagia lo minlakv vla.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Sipai vdwv bunugv orto jilin kunama gvvlin toku. Bunu Paulnyi boola ikula okv ninyia ayuyupra nga Antipatris lobv vnggv toku. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Logo nvnga lvpabv vngnv sipai vdwv hv bunugv dookulo vngkurkunam okv gora sipai vdwa ninyia lvkobv vngmu toku. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Bunu ninyia kaisaria lo aagv tokula, gobunor hv siti nga jilwk toku, okv Paulnyi ninyi gvlo laklwk kunam. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Gobunor siti nga puri tula okv Paulnyi tvvkato no ogulo mooku gvngv. Ho vdwlo ninyia Silisia lokv vla ninyia tvpakunam gola, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>ninyi minto, “Ngo nam tvvriare vdwlo noogv yalung doonv ngv vngchi bolo.” Vbvrikunamv ninyi orto jilin toku Paulnyi gobunor gv dooku naam gvlo tumlwk tvla sipai dakgv moto.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Paulnyi jius vdwgv gungnying minam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Alu longu kochingbv Nyibu Butv Ananias nyigagatv vdwlo meegonyi okv Pvbv chinv ako Tertullus minam lvkobv Kaisaria bv vngla. Bunu Peliksnyi kaarwk chotola okv bunu Paulnyi gungnying milwk toku. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Vbvrikunamv, Paulnyi goklwk toku, okv Tertullus hvbv gungnying lwkrap toku:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Mvngdvnam nyigam! Noogv chinampanam lokv ngonua rigvla rinamv awgo sarsopoyo toku, okv ngonugv diringmooku gv dinchinam risvvngsv nga alvrungbv ridinvngdin gvpvku. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Ngonu so ogumvnwng nga okv ho dw mvnwnglo alvbv tulwk minggv dvnv, okv ngonu mvnwng ngv nam alvrungbv mvngyum doonv. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Ngo noogv dw nga kaibv ngemu jinwngma, ogubvrijvka, ngo nam kumdunv aya gvrila ngonugv minam achuk am tvvria jilabv. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Ngonu so nyi sum maatarbv alvmanv gobv kaadu; hv mooku mvngnwnglo Jius vdwa yalungyachung duki nvgo okv Najareth gv nyipam vdwa rigvnvgo. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Hv Pwknvyarnvnaam ngaka yarboryache dubv gwngkw nvgo, okv ngonu ninyia nyum naatoku, ngonu ninyia ngonugv Pvbv lokv jwngkadaka dubv mvngto, <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>vbvritola kamandar Laisias aala, okv lvkobv ninyia twkbwng tola ngonugv lokv dvrit linto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap kvvgonvlo verse: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngonu ninyia ngonugv Pvbv lokv jwngkadaka dubv mvngto, </char><char style="fv">7</char> Vbvritola kamandar Laisias aala, okv lvkobv ninyia twkbwng tola ngonugv lokv dvrit linto. <char style="fv">8</char>Vbvrikunamv Laisias orto go jilin toku ninyia gungnying lwknv vdwv noogv kaagialo dakdubv. </note> <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Vbvrikunamv Laisias orto go jilin toku ninyia gungnying lwknv vdwv noogv kaagialo dakdubv. So nyi sum no tvvkabolo, hv gvlo ogumvnwng nga no atubongv chinsure ho ngonu mvnwng ninyia yalungyachung bv rila gungnying lwknama.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Jius vdwv gungnying lwknama tulwk minggvto okv minto so mvnwng si jvjv ngv.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peliks gv dookulo Paul mindar sutoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Vbvrikunamv, gobunor Paulnyi mincho moto, okv Paul minto,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“So diringmooku mvnwng nga no kaadar yala anying mvngchigo rigvnvnga ngo chindo, okv vkvlvgabv ngo himpudo atubonga no kaagialo mindar chodubv. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>No atubongv ka chinsu toka, so si alu loring gola lonyi gubvka ritvmadv ho ngo Jerusalem bv kumbv vngto. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Jius vdwv chimpama nga Pwknvyarnvnaam lo yvvnyika larmisidubv, ho majvka bunu nga Jius kumkunaamlo vmalo pamtv kvvbi loka nyi vdwa charkar dubv kaanv kaama. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Hv maloka bunugv vjak nga gungnying lwkla bvnglwk nama nam jvjv gorung vla kaalin modubv rinyumare. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Ngooka vjak sum no gvlo tulwk jidunv: Ngooka riming gvvdunv abuapa vdwgv Pwknvyarnv kumnamjonam Lamtv lo bunugv mvvdunv vnam sum. Vbvritola ngooka Moses gv Pvbv okv nyijwk vdwgv kitap vdwlo lvknam mvnwng nga mvngjwng dunv. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Bunugv akinbv ngooka vbv mvngtin minggv dunv Pwknvyarnv gvlo nyi mvnwng ngv alv nvngvla alvmanv ngv sinam lokv turkur riku vla. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Okv vkvlvgabv ngo vdwgo rinyupvdw Pwknvyarnv gvla nyi gv kaagialo lokia alvbv ridu mindubv vla mvngdunv.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Nyim 21:17-28</ref> </char>
    </note> “Jerusalem am anying awgo riro kochingbv ngo hoka ngo atubogv nyi vdwgv lvgabv morko naadubv okv erinpeelwk jidubv vngto. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Ngoogv vbvrila doori hoka bunu nga kaapato Pwknvyarnvnaam lo ngoogv kumkakjokak ridung nga riro kochingbv. Hoka nga nyitwng lvkobv ribamnam kaama okv ayak achaknam kaama. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Vbvritola Asia mooku lokv Jius meego hoka dooto; bunu atuv nga rikin nvnv ogugo dubolo no kaagialo aala gungnying lwkdubv. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Vmalo so nyi vdwa milin moto vdwlo ngo kvba lo dakri hoka ogu rimur go bunu nga kaapa pv— <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Nyim 23:6</ref> </char></note> gamkin gumwng ngoogv gokla minamv vdwlo bunugv kaagialo dakri hoka: ‘Silu gv noogv jwngkadaka gvdunam si sinv ngv turkur riku vla mvngjwng nama.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Vbvrikunamv Peliks ho lamtv nga alv rungbv chinto kula tvvka kapak svnga mintor toku. “Orto jinv Laisias vdwlo aachi tokudw,” hv bunua minto, “Ngo nonugv kvba nga japjub jiriku.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Hv Paulnyi kaarianv nyigam am orto jitoku ninyia arwng lo vpv dubv, vbvritola aar dubv vpvlaka okv ninyigv ajin vdwaka ninyigv mvngnam am naaji molaka vto.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Peliks gvla Dorusila gv kaagialo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Alu meegonv kochingso Peliks ninyigv nywng Jius nyimv, Drusilanyi lvkobv aato. Hv Paulnyi harmu la okv Jisunyi ninyigv mvngjwng namgv lvkwng bv raadung nama tvvriato. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Vbvritola Paul japdungto alvnam gv lvkwngbv, atuv himv sunam gv lvkwng bv, aarinv tlo jwngkadaka namgv lvkwnglo, Peliks um tvvto kula busu toku okv minto, “No vjak vngla riku okv vdwlo ngo dw paarikudw ngo nam gokkur riku.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Ho dw akin hoka hv mvngtin tindungto Paulnyi morko lo meego jiri nvpv vla; ho lvkwngbv hv Paulnyi vngdv mola okv lvkobv japdv japdvto.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Anying nyingnyi vngro kochingso Peliks gv gobunor ritungnga Porsius Pestas ritoku. Peliks Jius vdwa alvbv mvngkiam dubv vla mvngnvgo vkvlvgabv hv Paulnyi patwk lo doomu tvla vngyu toku.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Dvbvyachoknyi lvbuto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Alu loum koching bv Pestas mooku lo vngchi tokula, nw Kaisaria lokv Jerusalem lo vngtoku, <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>ho nyibu Butv vdwvku okv Jius gv rigvdoogvnv vdwv bunu Paulnyi miyum nvbv bookin lwkto. Bunu vdwv bunua <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Paulnyi Jerusalem bv bookarla alvbv mvngkiam dukubv Pestasnyi kootoku, bunu ninyia lamtv vngkulo mvki dubv mvngsi pvvnya toku. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Pestas mirwkto, “Paulnyi Kaisaria patwk lo tumlwk pvvto okv Ngo atubongv alo baapubv vngkur jikunv. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Nyi angv ogugo rimur go doopv bolo okv klai nonugv rigvdoogvnv vdwa ngo lvkobv Kaisaria bv vngming gvvmuto.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Pestas alu piinw vmalo loring gobv bunua lvkobv doobamto, okv vbvrikunamv Kaisaria bv vngtoku. Logo nvgv alua nw kvba nga jwngkadaka dubv doolwk tola okv Paulnyi arwng so aagv tokv vla orto jito. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Vdwlo Paul aachi namgola, Jerusalem lokv aanv Jius vdwv ninyia dakyamdakchi tola okv ninyia mvngchigo maatar bv gungnying mirap toku, bunu ogu atunggo himpa mato. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Vbvritola Paul atubongv miring suto: “Ngo ogugoka Jius gv pvbv lo mimur vngmur jima vmalo kumkunaam loka vmalo Roman Dvbvyachok nyika.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Vbvritola Pestas Jius vdwgv yabv alvbv mvngkiam yatola, vkvlvgabv nw Paulnyi tvvkato, “No Jerusalem bv vngnwng yapv ai okv alo nga dakcho tola yalung nga mindar chodubvre?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Paul minto, “Ngo Dvbvyachok gv atuk si atugv kvba lo jwngkadaka kodubv dakda pvnv, ngo ogolo mindar sudubv. Ngo Jius vdwa rigakpanam go rijima, no atubongv ka alvbv chindu. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Ngo pvbv nga rigakpanam go rilo okv sikorgo ripv lo vbv rilo ngo sidukubv busukano kaama, ngo toosi sikar dukubv um tvvkaram. Vbvritola bunugv nga gungnying lwknam lo ogu jvjv nvgo kaama bolo, yvvka nga bunugv laaklo laklwk nyumare. Ngo Dvbvyachok gvlo tulwk jidukunv.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Vbvrikunamv Pestas, kochingso ninyigv minsaryanv vdwlo lvkobv tvvdikaying minsu gvila, mirwkto, “No Dvbvyachok am tulwk jipvku, vkvlvgabv no Dvbvyachok gvlo vngrung riku.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Agrippa okv Barnis gv kaagialo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Dw meego nvgv kochingso Dvbv Agrippa okv Barnis bunyiv Pestasnyi Kaisaria lo alvbv kaarwk sinyato. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Bunu kochingso hoka alu meego doonya tola, Pestas Paul gv rinamdoonam nga dvbvnyi mintamto: “Alo patwk doonv nyi angv vv Peliks gv topu namgo doopv; <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>okv vdwlo ngo Jerusalem bv vngto namv, Jius nyibu butv vdw okv nyigagatv vdwv ninyia aagv tvla gungnying lwkto okv nga minto ninyia miyakaya tvkv vla. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Vbvritola ngo bunua minto nyi akingunv nga ninyia haaknv nyi vdwa kaarwk sula okv ninyi gungnying lwknam am mindar simu mabv jilwk mvngchik namv Roman gv ribu Pvbv bv rima vla minto. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Vbvrikunamv, vdwlo bunu so aato kudw, ngo tapv mato, vbvritola alu logo nvnga ngo kvbanaam lo dooto okv nyi anga arwng aagv dubv orto jito. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Ninyia nyirunv vdwv dakrap toku, vbvritola bunu ninyia ngoogv rirung pvnvgo vla mvngnam gungnying akoka milwk mato. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Bunu mvnwng gv larmi sunamv bunugv kumnamjonam gv lvgabv okv Jisu vnam sikunv nyi angv gv lvgabv ninyia larkwng minsu namgo; vbvritola Paul ninyia turpv nvkv vla minto. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Ngo svkvnv aba lvkwng bv oguaingbv naalin svngvdw vla mvngbwk nyumato, vkvlvgabv ngo Paulnyi bunugv gungnying lwknv vdwv soogv lvgabv Jerusalem lo chaadu kula tvvdarkadar kusvdw vla tvvkato. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Vbvritola Paul madwkrwkla maato; hv orto jito chigudabia yanv gv arwng lo doomu dubv okv dvbvyachoknyi so yalung sum jwngkadaka modubv. Vkvlvgabv ngo ninyigvbv milv jidunv chigudabia yanv arwng lo doomu dubv ngoogv ninyia Dvbvyachok gvlo vngmuma dvdvlo.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agrippa Pestasnyi minto, “Ngo tvvnwngdo so nyi sum ngoogv mvngwngbv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">No arunyi tvvpare ninyia, Pestas mirwksito.<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Alu gonv nga Agrippa okv Barnis bunyi kairungnv gubv dwkdwkvrwkbv rila hardv alvbv okv mvkukrikuk jila okv tvvriaku naam arwnglo sipai kai yachok nvnga lvkobv okv pamtvlo rigvnv vdwaka lvkobv aalwk gvvtoku. Pestas orto jito okv Paulnyi aagv toku. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Pestas minto, “Dvbv Agrippa, okv ngonua soka doming gvnv mvnwng nga: no kaatoka so nyi sum yvvbunudw gungnying lwknv jius vdwv Jerusalem lo okv soka ka gamtv alvbv goklin yayala nga mindu turmu dvbv anyung kaama vla. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Vbvritola ngo chindu hv ogugoka rimur kaama ninyi simu dubv. Okv hv atubongv alvbv Dvbvyachoknyi masubolo, ngo ninyia vngmu dubv mvngbwk dukunv. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Vbvrilachin ngo oguka lvkbwklvkrwkla Dvbvyachoknyi jisv kaama ninyigv lvkwng lo. Vbvritola ngo aagv pvnv nonugv pingko so—okv Dvbv Agrippa!—no gvlo dinchirungbv aagv pvnv! Ninyigv gungnying nga japro kochingbv, ngo ogugo lvkpa ridw mvngla. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Si asarma ogulvgavbolo patwk tumnam nyi am oguka jwngkadaka mabv vngmu namv alvma mvngla.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Paul mvngging suto Agrippa gv kaagialo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agrippa Paulnyi mintoku, “No atuv atubogv lvkwng lo minsu tvka nam dwa jidukunv.” Vbvrinamv Paul laakv iyinla okv atubongv mvngging sula vbv mintoku:<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>“Dvbv Agrippa! ngo silu atubongv gamdak nvgobv mvngsudunv ho ngo atuv noogv kaagialo mvngging sula Jius vdwgv nga gungnying lwknam lokv, <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>no Jius mvnwng gv ridungsingdung nga jvjvbv chirungdo okv yalungyachung nga. Ngo nam lvbu doonv, vbvrikunamv, nga tapvbv tvvriato.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>“Jius mvnwng ngv chinto oguaingbv ngo singpvdw yaapa rilo gv singcha nama. Bunu chinto oguaingbv ngoogv singyisingcha nga singcha pvkudw atubogv diringmooku lo okv Jerusalem loku. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Nyim 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Pili 3:5</ref> </char></note> Bunu chinbwng nyadu, um bunu vdwv mvnggv ila milare, ngo ho atuk lokv achialvbv riming gvvdu ngonugv kumnam Parisis dormo nga. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Okv vjak ngo si dootola gwngkw dunv ogulvgavbolo ngonugv abuapa vdwa milv nama ngo mvngtinla— <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>alv rungnv hoka vringgola anyi haalung gv ngonugv nyi vdwv paare vla mvngtinto, bunugv Pwknvyarnvnyi ariumarubv kumnam lokv. Okv si ogulvgavbolo so mvngtin kolo, ho Dvbv Agrippa, nga Jius vdwv ho rinyingriru nyato. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Ogubv nonu mvnwng ngv sum mvngjwngmanv gobv ridunv Pwknvyarnv sinam lokv turdu kunv vla?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Nyim 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref> </char>
    </note> “Ngooka achialvbv mvngtoku ngo ogumvnwng nga gungnying milwk torungto Jisu Najaretnyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Vkvlvgabv Jerusalem lo ngo ritoku. Ngo Nyibu butv gvlo paatoku gwlwk am okv Pwknvyarnv gv nyi vdwa awgo patwk lo tumlwkto: okv vdwlo bunua mvki pvkudw ngooka mvnglwk minggvto. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Achialv dwgo ngo bunua mvritririt motoku Jius kumkunaamlo okv bunua atugv mvngjwng am mvngnwng madubv gwngkwto. Ngo ho achialvbv haachi toku bunua ngo nyebumooku pamtv loka vngtoku bunua mvdwmvku dubv.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul ninyigv mvngdw kunama mimpa toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Nyim 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>“Ngo sikv lvkwng bv ho Nyibu Butv gv orto jinam lokv okv Damaskas bv tujupkunam gv lvkobv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Ho Dvbv Agrippa nga, ho lamtv alulvpa hoka, ngo loung go kaapato doonyi loung aka hongya nvgo, nyidokolo lokv nga hongyumto okv nga lvkobv vnggvnv nyi vdwaka. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Ngonu mvnwng ngv gipv toku kvdwlo, okv ngo tvvpa toku adugo nga Hebru gaambv minvgo, ‘Sol, Sol! no nga ogubv mvdwkmvku doonv? No atubongv achi dubv mvkur sudu noogv mvnam lokv, Svv hvpu ngv soonv atugv singkio nga dusunv aingbv.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>‘No yvvla Ahtu?’ Ngo tvvka toku. Okv Ahtu mirwk sito, ‘Ngo Jisu, ho noogv mvdwmvku kunam. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Vbvritola godung lakuk okv noogv lvpa lokv dakto. Ngo noogv dooku si aapvnv nam ngoogv pakbu gobv mvdubv. No kvvbi ngaka mimpa laka ogugo kaapvdw silu ngokvlo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap lvknam megonv </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngo gvlo dooma.</char></note> okv ngo nam ogugo kaatam rikudw aarinv dw lo. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Ngo nam ringriare Israel gv nyi vdwlokv okv Jentail lokv, ngo bunu gvlo nam vngmure. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>No bunugv nyik am nyikpo molaka okv kanvparum lokv pualo limu lakuka okv Uyudvbv gv gwlwk lokv Pwknvyarnv gvloku, vkvlvgabv bunugv nga mvngjwng lokv bunugv rimur am mvngnga jiriku okv Pwknvyarnv gv darkunam nyi vdwa lvkobv bunugv dookudakku am naarwk siriku.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul ninyigv kudungkua nga minji kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>“Dvbv Agrippa, ngo nyidomooku nyikrw kaanama tvvmabv rimato. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Nyim 9:20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref> </char></note> Ahtua Damaskas lo okv Jerusalem lo okv Judia mvnwng lokv, okv Jentail vdwlo ngo tamsarto bunu mvnwng nga bunugv rimur lokv mvngdin dokubv okv Pwknvyarnv lo aakur dukubv okv ogugo ripvdw um kaatam riku bunu mvngdin pvku vla. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Si svkvlvkwngbv Jius vdwv nga naatungto vdwlo ngo Pwknvyarnvnaam lo doori lo okv bunu nga mvki dubv gwngnyato. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Vbvritola sibv riri alu lo Pwknvyarnv nga ridur toku, okv Vkvlvkwngbv ngo si daktola mvnwng nga kaatam doonv jvjv nga, kai dvlo okv miang dvlo. Ngoogv ogugo mimpvdw lvyin akindu nyijwk am okv Moses gv minamv rirung duku: <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1Kor 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Aij 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref> </char></note> Kristo ho hinching rungre okv atukchochuk bv hv sinam lokv turkur riku, dupwng riku loung gv turnama Jius okv Jentail vdwlo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Paul atubongv sibv miring sitoku, Pestas ninyia gokto, “No siru dooku, Paul! Noogv kaibv chinamv nam siru mopvku!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Paul mirwk sitoku, “Ngo siruma, noogv kairungnv! ngo jvjvrungbv mindunv. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Dvbv Agrippa! ngo nam mvngrw alvbv milare, ogulvgavbolo no so lvkwngbv chindu ngo mvngrungdo no bunu mvnwng nga chimpv kunvpv, ogulvgavbolo si chvnyung baarwnglo rinam kaama. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Dvbv Agrippa, no nyijwk nga mvngjwng dunvre? Ngo chindo no mvngjwngdu!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agrippa Paulnyi minto, “Soogv dw achuklo no nga kristan mvdubv mvngdunvre?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>“Dw v achuk jvka vmalo awjvka,” Paul mirwksito, “Ngoogv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumdunv si no okv mvnwng ngv yvvbunudw ngam silu tvvria dunv ngo jvbv—riming gvvre, rvngja mvngchik ka gvvmare!”<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Vbvrinamv Dvbv, gobunor, Barnis, okv kvvbi mvnwng vka dakrap toku, <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>okv vngrokochingbv bunu ajinanying am mimisitoku, “So nyi angv sum ninyia mvki dubv vmalo patwk lo tumdubv ogu rinam jego kaama.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Okv Agrippa Pestasnyi minto, “So nyi sum topu pvkunvpv vdwlo hv Dvbvyachok am dinchi rungbv lvbu manv guilo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Paul Rom bv svpw dula vngnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Vdwlo bunu Itali vngdubv mimbwk pvkudw, bunu Paul nyila okv patwk lo doonv kvvgonyi “Roman Rejiment um Dvbvyachok gv Rejiment vla minto ho gv nyigam amin Julius gvlo jilwkto.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Ngonu Adramitiam lokv vngto hoka svpw ako Asia gv mooku svpw dookubv vngtv nvgo, ngonu vnglintoku, Mesedonia nyi go Aristarkas Tesalonika lokv, ngonua lvkobv vngto. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Logo nvngaku ngonu vngchi toku Sidon lo. Julius Paulnyi aya mvngpato okv ninyia tulin toku vngdubv okv hv ogugo mvngrung pvdw ninyigv ajin vdwa kaala jimu dubv. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Ngonu Sidon lokv vnglintoku, okv ogulvgavbolo dooriv ngonua riketo okv ngonu durap tvku Saipras gv bokpin kiambv. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Ngonu vngbo toku Silisia svmasa nga okv pampilia okv Maira gv Lisia lo aatoku. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Hoka nyigam angv svpw go kaapato hv Alekjandaria lokv Itali bv vngjinvgo hv ngonua svpwlo aagv toku.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Ngonu tapv tapvbv vngrap toku lonyiloum go okv achialvbv adwkakubv Anyungnga vngchi toku Banggu Konidas loku. Dooriv ngonua ho kvvbi mooku lo vngmu kumato, vkvlvgabv ngonu dulu tvku Kret bokpin gv adarlo geko gv Salmone nga vngpitla. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Ngonu svmasa lvgam hoka aanwk toku okv anyung ngaku kairungbv apiai yingdula svpw rvngpumku mooku hoka vngchi toku, vv Lasia Banggu lokv adu kuma toku.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Ngonu hoka dwa awgo ria toku, okv dulv la vnglv svngvka maatar bv alv matoku okv rimur am anyu bv mvngnga la dvmatvngma doodw alu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">dvmatvngma doodw alu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sikvnvsi septembar poolu anyung lo mana la rito vmalo October poolu gv atuake lo oogv sikar kardwkjee svpw dudubv maatar rungbv alvmanv alulo ridu</char></note> hvka vngro toku. Vkvlvgabv Paul bunua so gaam sum minjito: <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>Vbvrinamv Paul mintoku svpw gv nyi vdwa, “Nyi vdw, nonuno nga tvvriato, ngonu vjak durup bolo maatar bv alv kumare, ngonugv svpw okv yikungyira ngv alv marung bv amwkre, awgo doonv ngvka nyeriku,” <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Vbvritola Sipai nyigamv tvvriato svpw atugv okv svpwa rigvnvgv minama, okv tvvma nyato Paul gv minama. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Kamchwng dw lo svpw rvngpam kolo svpw nga doogv dubv alvma, vkvlvgabv nyi mvnwng ngv svmasa lokv vngdubv gwngnyado Poneks lo vnglwk dubv, okv rinyubolo Poneks lo vngchi la hoka kamchwng nga doodubv, Poneks vv svpw rvngpam kokuv Kret pamtv gv doonyi aagia tangv yordum okv yorko ngv gvvrwk nvgo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Doonyi aagia tangv Moodum okv Yorko gv gvvrwk nvgo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo yordum doonyi chaagia okv yorko doonyi chaagia tangv. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Svmasa lo doogumdoori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Yorko peelv bv dooriv bvibvi bv rirapto, okv nyi vdwv mvngtoku si bunua doori ngv bunugv rungkubv rila vnggvre, vkvlvgabv bunu svpw rvngtung nvnv nga paksok toku okv lvgvlvma bv kret bokpin kiambv durup toku. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Vbvrinamv Vjakgobv kairungnv doori go riraptoku “Yordumdonyichagia lokv Tabv doori vnamv” bokpin kiambv lokv rilwkto. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Dooriv svpwa riketo, okv ngonu svpwa dunyu kumato, ngonu svpwa duku mato okv doori yanga rigv kooto. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Ngonu kaapato miangnv bokpin go vdwlo ngonu yorko kiambv kauda nga vngpit rilo. Hoka, ngonu meego doonu kogo paato. Hoka, miangnv svpwa kiinvpanv dubv kainv svpw arwnglo rilv kuma dubv, <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>bunu boolwk tvla okv hum oso meegonv svpwlo adakrungbv leelwkto. Bunu busunyato ho lvko nyika bunu Libya gv adar chukri apum lo riulwkji mvngla, vkvlvgabv bunu koching lo vngto okv svpwa doori lokv rigv moto. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Kainv doogumdooriv vngdvto, vkvlvgabv logo nvngaku bunu svpw gv yikungyira nga meegonyi kungnga raptoku, <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>okv ho alu svpwlo doonv atungama yikungyira aka kungnga toku. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Achialv alu go ngonu doonyi okv takara kaapa nyokuma, doori gv achialv bv awyayabv rinam lvkwng bv. Ngonu Anyungnga mvngnga sutoku turkuram mvngla.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Nyi vdwv oguka dvmabv awgo dootoku, Paul bunugv pingkolo dakrapto okv minto, Nyi vdwa, nonuno ngoogv minam nga tvvla Kret lo doonv guilo, nonu sikvnv nyenam okv amwk mare. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Vbvritola vjak ngo nonua mindwkkrwkla mindunv, haapok v mvngrw laka! nonuno yvvka atugv singtung ngv nyemare; svpw mvngchikv nyvmwngre. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Siyu Pwknvyarnv ngoogv kumnamjonam vv ninyigv nyidogindung ngv ngo gvlo aato, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>okv mintoku, ‘Paul busu mabvka! no Dvbvyachok gv kaagia lo dakrungre. Pwknvyarnv noogv lvkobv yvvbunudw nam svpwlo vngdunv mvnwng nga ayala ringyare.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Vkvlvgabv mvngrwlak, Nyi vdw! Ngo Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngingdu ho hv rirungre ninyigv ngam minama. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Vbvritola ngonu bokpin kvvbi golo riulinre.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Yupring gola yuppi toku, okv ngonu Mediterranian svmasa gv doogumdoori lokv nungbwngto. Yupra lvpa nga svpw dunv vdwv mvngtoku ngonu dvpw lo aachi rikunv mvngla. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu isi gv rungrwng nga kiikw namv champi mitar gobv rito; okv achukgo vngto la ho bunu kiikw nammv Chaom mitar gobv rungrwngto. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Bunu ho busu nyato svpwv vlwng goka tupji mari mvngla, vkvlvgabv bunu koching lakchikiam lo riokdar toochi daapigo svpwlo paklwk toku okv kumnya toku aluv loolin dubv. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Vbvrinamv svpwa vnggvnv dunv vdwv gwngkw nyato svpw lokv ringsu dubv; Bunu miangnv svpw isi lo soolu nyato okv bunu mvvla gwngnyato hoka svpw nyoktuk gv toochi meegonyi layin dvnvkv vla. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Vbvrinamv Paul mintoku sipai nyigam am okv Sipai vdwa, “Svpw dunv ngv svpwlo dooming gvvma lo nonu turjiku kaakuma.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Vkvlvgabv sipai vdwv ho oso nga papwkto okv svpwa riusiriudv motoku.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Pua madvbv, Paul bunu mvnwng nga alvbv mintoku dvnam go dvdubv: “Nonu vjak dooya kunamv loring gola loopi dooku, so dw mvnwng am nonu oguguka dvnam dvma. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Ngo nonua mindwkkrwk dunv, vkvlvgabv, dvnam go dvrung tvka; Sikv lokv nonu turungre. Nonugv dvmw sogo nvka dumpo lokv nyemare.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Sibv miro kochingbv, Paul vtwng meego naatoku, Pwknvyarnv hartv toku bunu mvnwng gv kaagia lo, pintung piyungla, okv dvrap toku. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv mvngrw nyatoku, okv bunu akinakin bv dvnam meego dvrap toku. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Ngonu mvnwng ngv svpw hoka doonv ngv lwngnyi gola chamkanw gola akv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:37 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">276; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap meegonv </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">275; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kvvbi vdwv doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">76 gv lvkwnglo. </char></note> gobv rito. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Mvnwng ngv dvgu dubv dvro kochingbv, bunu vtwng mvnwng nga svmasa bv nvvlwk lakula svpwa haajup motoku.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Svpwv amwk kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Vdwlo aluv aapv kudw, Svpw dunv ngv jobv vngtung am himbwk kumabv ritoku, vbvritola bunu dvpw go kaapato okv hoka bunu vngnyu bolo vngdubv rungnyato. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Vbvrinamv bunu svpw toochi nga papwk la isi bv lumlwk motoku okv lvkobv bunu parnv nvlo oso haka taasok toku. Vbvrinamv bunu svpw gv nyoktuk lo vji am turpvto hoka svpwa dooriv adarlo milin mola svpw dunama dulin gvvdubv vla. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Vbvrinamv svpwv chukri putung nga tupto okv vngtoku, svpw gv dumpo lakchikiam ngv haktung toku okv vngka nyuma bvku, vbvrikunamv koching lakchikiam nga sibu nungnv ngv nuyinnupin toku.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Sipai vdwv gwngrap toku patwk tumnam nyi mvnwng nga mvki dubv, turla jaalinla kiyu mamsv nga mvngla. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Vbvritola Armi nyigamv Paulnyi turmu so mvngto, vkvlvgabv hv bunugv gwngnam am rimu mato. Vbvmabvya mintoku nyi mvnwng ngv yvvbunudw jaalak nvngv poklwk chola okv lvgum alo jaalin lakv vla minto; <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Jaachin manv vdwv jaaming gvvlaka svpw gv dartungdaryung nga gakbwng tola. Okv svkv lokv ngonu mvnwng ngv ringsula isi agum lo riulin pvkunv.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Malta lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Vdwlo ngonu dvpw lo linpv kudw, ngonu chintoku vv Malta bokpin vkunyi vla. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Mooku gv nyi vdwv ngonua achialv bv ajinarum bv ritoku. Hoka nyido ngv hoto okv achialvbv sikarto, vkvlvgabv bunu vmv parto la okv ngonu mvnwng nga higu motoku. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Paul takiotaram rvkgo darkamto okv vmv partoku vmvgv agu lokv hinla ikula Tabw sogo linto okv ninyigv laak lo leedak lwkto. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Mooku gv nyi vdwvka kaaria nyatoku Paul gv laak lo tabw sogo bvyo dubv kaatola okv bunu mimisitoku, “So nyi si gwngrw siyin gunyi, hv svmasa lo simato, vbvritola vjak sinamv ninyia topu kumare.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Vbvritola Paul oguka ungv gvvmabv okv ninyigv laak lokv tabw am vmvlo orlwkto. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Bunu ninyia biungridw okv dvminmabv tapv la siridw vla kaaria nyato. Vbvritola achialvbv kaariaro kochingbv okv ninyia oguka riku mato, bunu mvngkur la okv minto, “hv Pwknvyarnv ako!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Adu yomaku mooku lo ho Puplius gv rongo mooku meego dooto, bokpin gv nyigam kaiyachok nvgo. Hv ngonua alvbv aamuto ayala okv ninyi gvlo ngonu alu loum gv nyen bv ritoku. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Puplius gv abuv gadw lo karto, chilirampin lvvmala okv eeching chila Paul ninyigv karchung bv aatoku, ninyi, kumtoku, ninyigv laakv lakpo tvla okv ninyi mvpu jitoku. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Vdwlo sibv ripvkudw, bokpin gv kvvbi lvvmanv mvnwng ngv aakumto okv mvpu toku. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Bunu mvnwng ngv ngonua amin awgo jitoku, vdwlo ngonu durup pvkudw, mooying vngtunglo ngonu ogugo mvngrung pvkudw bunu um vvpv jitoku.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malta lokv Rom bv vngnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Poolu pwkgum gv koching lo ngonu svpwlo vngraptoku Alekjandaria lokv aanvgo vbv minamgo “Pwknvyarnv anyi vnamgo,” ho gv bokpin lo kamching vdwa ho doonvgo. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Ngonu Sirakas gv Pamtv lo vngchi toku okv alu loum go dootoku. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Hokv ngonu vngrap la okv Regiam gv pamtv lo vngchi toku. Logo nvngaku dooriv mooko peelvbv rirapto, okv ngonugv Putioli banggu lo aalwk la lonyi lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Ngonu mvngjwngnv meego kaapato hoka bunu minto hopta go lvkobv doola bvkv ngonua vla, vkvlvgabv ngonu Rom bv vngtoku. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Rom gv mvngjwngnv vdwa ngonugv lvkwng bv tvvpato okv aduadu gv Appius gv banggu bajar lokv okv hotel Tri Inns vnamgo ngonua paamuto. Vdwlo Paul bunua kaapa pvkudw, hv Pwknvyarnvnyi hartv toku okv kairungbv mintvmiru toku.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rom lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Vdwlo ngonu Rom lo vngchi pvkudw, Paulnyi atubonga dongu sumu toku sipai a ninyia dakgv motola.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Alu loum gv koching bv Paul goklwkto Jius vdwgv rigv nvnga paami sidubv. Vdwlo bunu aakum tokudw, hv minto bunua, ngoogv Israel gv ajin richam vdwv, ngo ogugo gungnying malachin ngonugv nyi vdwv vmalo abuapa gv ridungsingdung rinama, ngo Jerusalem gv patwk lo tumto okv Roman vdwlo jilwkto. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Nga tvvkaro kochingbv, Roman vdwv nga topu nwngtoku, ogulvgavbolo bunu hoka nga mvki dubv oguguka mapa matoku. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Nyim 25:11</ref></char></note> Vbvritola vdwlo Jius vdwv maakv vpvdw sum, ngo kwngkwng alvbv dvbvyachoknyi koodwkkrwkla kooto, ngoogv atu nyi vdwa ngo gungnying go lwksu majeka. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Vkvlvkwngbv ngo nam kaarwk sila okv lvkobv mindunv. Ogulvgavbolo ngo silu Israel nyi mvnwng gv mvngtinnam ninyigv lvgabv ngo laak gv rvngja sum gvvdunv.<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Bunu ninyia mintoku, “Ngonu Judia lokv siti guka paama noogv lvkwnglo, ngonugv nyi akonvka Judia lokv aanv ngv ogu yunying alvmanv goka gvvlwkma noogv lvkwng lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Vbvritola ngonu tvvnwngdo noogv mvngnam am, ogulvgavbolo ngonu chindo nyi mvnwng ngv noogv so apum sum gungnying bv mindu.<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu alu go mirw pvvtoku Paulnyi paami sidubv, okv bunu nyitwng ngv alu lo aakumto Paul ogolo doopvdw. Arukamchi lokv arium lobv hv minjito ninyigv doina Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lvkwng lo, hv gwngkwto bunua Jisunyi mvngjwng modubv Moses gv Pvbv lokv okv nyijwk vdwgv lvknama minvla. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Kvvgonv bunu mvngjwngto ninyigv minam lokv, vbvritola kvvgonv mvngjwngjvjv kuma toku. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu vngyu rapto, bunugv pingkolo tolwktoak minsu mabv rila, ho koching nga Paul gaamgo mindvto, Darwknv Dowv jvjvbv mindunv noogv abuapa nga nyijwk Aijaya lokv! <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26,27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Aij 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref> </char></note> Hoka hv mintoku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Vngla okv minji lak so nyi sum:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Nonu tvvre okv tvvriare, vbvritola vdwloka tvvchinma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">nonu kaare okv kaariare vbvritola vdwloka kaachin mare,<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Ogulvgavbolo so nyi vdwsi mvngchin madu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">okv bunu tvvnwng mabv tvvdu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">okv kaanwng mabv kaadu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ho manv guilo, bunugv nyikv kaapare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">bunugv nyarung ngv tvvpare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">bunu mvngchin riku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">okv bunu ngo gvlo aalwkre, Pwknvyarnv minto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">okv ngo bunua mvpure.”’<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Okv Paul minyabv mintoku: “Nonuno chinto laka, Vkvlvgabv, ho Pwknvyarnv gv Turnam doinv Jentail vdwlo jilwk toku. Bunu vdwv tvvriare!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Paul gv minro kochingbv, Jius vdwv bunugv pinkolo achialvbv larmi sudula vngyu toku.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Anying nyingnyi go Paul atubongv dookudaku go morko jila doosuto, okv hoka Paul nyi vdwa yvvbunudw ninyia kaabv aanv mvnwng nga alvrungbv aamuto. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Hv tamsar rapto Pwknvyarnv gv Karv gv lvkwngbv okv minji rapto Ahtu Jisu Kristo gv lvkwng bv, mvngrw alvbv okv mintup minchi kaamabv.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
